来","locale":"zh-CN"},"399":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"网关拒绝请求：401、403、400","locale":"zh-CN"},"400":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"模型的问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"401":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"账号与登录","locale":"zh-CN"},"402":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"网络与代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"403":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"站点拒绝图片或工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"404":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"数据与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"405":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","content":"先看症状对应的小节。每一条都列出你会看到的错误信息、原因和处理办法；错误信息是程序实际输出的原文，可以直接搜索。","locale":"zh-CN"},"406":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"去哪里看","locale":"zh-CN"},"407":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"能看到什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"408":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"运行 `hoshimi serve` 的终端","locale":"zh-CN"},"409":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"所有日志（输出到 stderr，不写日志文件）。`HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG hoshimi serve` 或 `hoshimi serve --debug` 输出更多细节","locale":"zh-CN"},"410":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"`hoshimi check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"411":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"配置能否读取、能否通过校验，以及将要启用哪些渠道、多少账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"412":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"**渠道** 页","locale":"zh-CN"},"413":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"每个渠道的状态（**需要处理**）、账号状态（**需要登录**、**已过期**、**暂停中**、**出错**）、额度和最近的网络错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"414":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"**用量** 页的调用列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"415":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"每次调用的渠道、账号、尝试次数、错误代码和说明；勾选 **仅失败** 只看失败的","locale":"zh-CN"},"416":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"**模型** 页","locale":"zh-CN"},"417":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"每个模型的探测结果和是否被记为不可用","locale":"zh-CN"},"418":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"`GET /api/v1/network/diagnostics`","locale":"zh-CN"},"419":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#先收集信息","content":"每个渠道每类操作最近一次的网络结果，见网络与代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"420":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"`config.json` 不是合法的 JSON，多半是手动编辑时少了引号或逗号。Hoshimi 拒绝启动，而不是用空配置覆盖它（那样看起来就像所有账号都消失了），并已把原文件复制一份。按提示的行列修好 `config.json` 再启动；改不好时可以从 `.corrupt-…` 副本中把账号拷出来。`Config file … must contain a JSON object.` 表示文件的顶层不是一个对象。","locale":"zh-CN"},"421":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"启动、`hoshimi check` 和 `hoshimi config set` 都会先校验配置，例如 `network.proxy is required in proxy mode` 或 `playground.compact_threshold must be between 0.5 and 0.95.`。每一条的含义见配置文件的校验一节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"422":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"`server.host` 是 `0.0.0.0` 或局域网地址时，必须先设置工具访问密钥和 `security.allow_cidrs`，否则服务器拒绝启动（退出码 4）。按访问控制中“开放到局域网”的步骤补齐，或把 `server.host` 改回 `127.0.0.1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"423":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"这不是错误。端口被占用（或被系统保留）时，服务器自动尝试下一个端口，直到 65535，再从 1024 开始往上找。实际使用的端口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"424":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"打印在日志和标准输出的 `SERVER_READY url=http://127.0.0.1:10601` 中；","locale":"zh-CN"},"425":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"自动打开的浏览器用的就是它；","locale":"zh-CN"},"426":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"写在数据目录的 `server.json` 中；","locale":"zh-CN"},"427":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"**设置** 页显示 **端口 10600 已被占用，服务器改用 10601。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"428":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"客户端要用新端口连接。想固定端口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"429":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"开启严格端口后，端口被占用时报 `Port 10600 on 127.0.0.1 is unavailable (…), and strict port mode is on`，退出码 3。先找出占用端口的程序，常见的是另一个还在运行的 Hoshimi：看 `server.json` 中的 `pid`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"430":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"监听地址不属于这台机器（例如 IP 变了，或写错了网卡地址）。这种错误换端口也没用，服务器立即退出（退出码 3）。改用 `0.0.0.0` 或这台机器当前的地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"431":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"找不到网页界面的构建文件，服务器只提供 API。从 PyPI 安装的包自带构建；从源码运行时需要先构建网页界面，见开发环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"432":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#服务器起不来","content":"所有渠道都被关闭了，包括两个免账号渠道。启用一个渠道（`hoshimi config set providers.kilo.enabled true`），或为某个渠道添加账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"433":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"这些错误来自 Hoshimi 自己的访问控制，请求还没有到达上游。它们的响应体形如 `{\"code\": \"…\", \"message\": \"…\", \"detail\": {}}`；如果是 OpenAI 格式的 `{\"error\": {…}}`，那是上游或路由返回的错误，见后面几节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"434":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"状态和代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"435":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"436":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"原因与处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"437":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`401` `model_api_key_required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"438":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`A model API key is required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"439":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"访问 `/v1/*` 需要模型 API 密钥。用 `Authorization: Bearer <模型 API 密钥>` 或 `x-api-key` 发送。注意工具访问密钥不能用在这里","locale":"zh-CN"},"440":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`401` `auth_required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"441":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`A tool access key is required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"442":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"访问 `/api/*`、`/docs` 或 `/openapi.json` 需要工具访问密钥，只接受 `Authorization: Bearer`；模型 API 密钥和 `x-api-key` 不能用在这里","locale":"zh-CN"},"443":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`403` `remote_not_allowed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"444":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`Remote address not allowed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"445":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"客户端 IP 不在 `security.allow_cidrs` 中。把它的网段加进去","locale":"zh-CN"},"446":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`400` `bad_host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"447":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`Host not allowed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"448":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"服务器监听在回环地址，而请求的 `Host` 不是 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1` 或监听地址。常见于反向代理转发了公开域名，或用自定义的本地域名访问。让代理转发 `Host: 127.0.0.1:<端口>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"449":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`403` `bad_origin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"450":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`Cross-origin request refused`","locale":"zh-CN"},"451":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"浏览器从另一个来源发起写请求。把那个来源加入 `security.allow_origins`（需要工具访问密钥）","locale":"zh-CN"},"452":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`403` `bad_origin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"453":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"`Cross-site request refused`","locale":"zh-CN"},"454":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"请求没有 `Origin`，但浏览器标明它来自另一个站点","locale":"zh-CN"},"455":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网关拒绝请求401403400","content":"网页界面反复弹出 **请输入工具访问密钥**，或提示 **工具访问密钥不正确。**：密钥被改过，用当前的密钥重新登录。忘了密钥时，停止服务器，用 `hoshimi config set server.access_token \"<新密钥>\"` 设置一个新的（或设为 `null` 取消），再启动。详细规则见访问控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"456":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"没有一个正在运行的渠道列出这个模型（`404 model_not_found`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"457":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"用 `GET /v1/models` 或 **模型** 页确认准确的 id，注意大小写和前缀；","locale":"zh-CN"},"458":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"用 `渠道/模型` 的写法，例如 `kilo/<模型 id>`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"459":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"这个渠道可能没有运行：被关闭了、启用了却没有账号，或账号缺字段被丢弃（日志中有 `agg: dropping accounts without base_url or key: …`）。用 `hoshimi check` 查看实际运行的渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"460":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"请求没有带 `model` 且没有设置 `server.default_model` 时，返回 `model is required`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"461":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"拉取目录失败时，网关保留上一次成功的目录，30 秒后再试；**模型** 页提示 **目录加载失败或超时：…。已保留现有模型。** 一轮加载最多等 20 秒，慢的渠道会标为超时，稍后刷新即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"462":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"一个从没成功拉取过的渠道使用内置的后备列表，其中的模型不保证可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"463":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"新列表突然只剩不到一半时，网关先保留旧列表一个周期，日志里有 `the catalogue came back at N of M models (likely a partial answer)`；再过一个周期仍然如此就接受，日志写 `accepting it as the station's own answer`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"464":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"渠道的网络有问题时，**渠道** 页的 **网络** 部分会显示 **模型目录** 操作的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"465":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"上游的所有账号都说这个模型不存在（404、410，或正文明确说模型不存在），网关在 10 分钟内不再把请求发给它；10 分钟内累计 3 次则在本次运行期间一直如此。上游恢复后，用 `POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset` 清除记录，或重启服务器。规则见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"466":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"`region-blocked`（地区受限）：当前出口所在地区被站点拒绝。给这个渠道换一条代理线路，见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"467":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"`throttled`（限流）：额度不够，没有问到模型。过一会儿再探测。","locale":"zh-CN"},"468":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"`unknown`（未知）：凭据、网络或服务器出错，说明不了模型本身。看 **渠道** 页的网络错误和账号状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"469":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#模型的问题","content":"只有 `unavailable` 才说明模型本身不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"470":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"上游拒绝了这个账号的刷新令牌（日志：`<渠道>/<账号>: refresh token rejected, account needs a new login`）。这个账号不再参与轮换，续期也会跳过它，直到重新登录：","locale":"zh-CN"},"471":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"或在 **渠道** 页点 **登录**。用同一个身份重新登录会替换原账号。重启服务器会清除这个标记，但如果令牌确实失效，下一次续期还会再次标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"472":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"`502`：这个渠道没有一个可以尝试的账号了，它们要么需要登录，要么正因限流或策略拦截暂停轮换。**渠道** 页列出每个账号的状态和恢复时间（**暂停中**，如 **被限流**、**被策略阻止**），`GET /api/v1/credits` 的 `cooled` 给出剩余秒数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"473":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"限流暂停的时长取自上游的 `Retry-After` 或正文中的重置时间，没有说明时为 1 小时；策略拦截为 30 分钟。","locale":"zh-CN"},"474":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"暂停记录在内存中，重启服务器会清除，但上游的限制不会因此解除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"475":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"添加更多账号可以让请求在一个账号受限时继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"476":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"`No accounts configured for provider '…'.`（401）表示这个渠道没有任何账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"477":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"经过网关返回的上游错误保留上游的状态码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"478":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"`401`：网关已经尝试续期并换过账号，仍然被拒。检查 **渠道** 页的账号状态，必要时重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"479":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"`403`（`permission denied`）：正文与凭据无关的 403 是权限或网关拦截，不会触发续期，也不会换账号。看 **渠道** 页的网络错误：如果是 **请求被上游代理拦截**、**地区限制** 或 **客户端兼容性限制**，问题在线路或地区，不在账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"480":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"`429`：所有尝试过的账号都被限流了。请求最多尝试 `server.max_account_retries`（默认 3）个账号，账号更多时可以调大它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"481":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-85","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"模型饱和（如 CodeBuddy 的 `14003`、“模型繁忙”）时，网关直接返回上游的说明而不换账号：换哪个账号都一样，换一个模型或稍后再试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"482":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-86","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"登录在 10 分钟内没有完成就会超时（如 `Login timed out waiting for authorization`），重新开始即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"483":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-87","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"需要本地回调的站点在 `127.0.0.1` 上监听：Codex 固定使用 1455 端口（被占用时报 `codex: cannot bind the local callback port 1455: …`；`codex: another login is already in progress` 表示另一个 Codex 登录还没结束），Cline 的浏览器方式使用 48801–48811（`cline: no available callback port (48801–48811)`）。关闭占用这些端口的程序后重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"484":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-88","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"浏览器和 Hoshimi 不在同一台机器上时，回调到不了 Hoshimi。用 `hoshimi login <渠道> --no-open --manual`：在任意浏览器中打开打印出的链接，完成后把浏览器最终跳转到的地址（或授权码）粘贴回终端。并非所有站点都支持手动粘贴。","locale":"zh-CN"},"485":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-89","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"各站点的登录方式见免费站点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"486":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-90","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"定时器只在服务器启动时开启。`hoshimi serve` 默认开启两者，并覆盖配置中的 `server.auto_refresh` 和 `server.auto_checkin`；要关闭，启动时加 `--no-refresh` 或 `--no-checkin`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"487":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-91","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"签到按北京时间（UTC+8）的日历日计算，当天已成功的不会重复；查看历史：`GET /api/v1/credits/checkins`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"488":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-92","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#账号与登录","content":"没有余额或签到接口的渠道会被跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"489":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-93","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"渠道请求失败时，错误信息形如 `<渠道>: <类别>; <建议>`，类别与网络诊断中的 `kind` 相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"490":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-94","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"信息","locale":"zh-CN"},"491":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-95","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"原因与处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"492":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-96","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: proxy_error; check network configuration`","locale":"zh-CN"},"493":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-97","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"连不上配置的代理。确认代理在运行、地址和端口正确。配置的代理失败时不会退回直连","locale":"zh-CN"},"494":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-98","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: timeout; check network configuration`","locale":"zh-CN"},"495":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-99","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"连接或读取超时。站点可能需要代理才能访问，或代理太慢","locale":"zh-CN"},"496":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-100","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: connection_error; check network configuration`","locale":"zh-CN"},"497":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-101","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"DNS、拒绝连接或 TLS 错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"498":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-102","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: challenge; complete_browser_authorization`","locale":"zh-CN"},"499":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-103","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"上游返回了 Cloudflare 质询。Hoshimi 不会自动通过质询；换一条线路，或稍后再试","locale":"zh-CN"},"500":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-104","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: edge_rejected; check_endpoint_and_network`","locale":"zh-CN"},"501":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-105","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"返回的是 HTML 拦截页。检查地址是否正确、线路是否被拦截","locale":"zh-CN"},"502":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-106","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: invalid_response; check_endpoint_and_network`","locale":"zh-CN"},"503":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-107","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"期待 JSON 却收到 HTML，多半是地址指向了网页而不是 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"504":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-108","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: region_restricted; check_provider_availability`","locale":"zh-CN"},"505":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-109","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"站点不服务当前出口的地区。换一条其他地区的代理线路","locale":"zh-CN"},"506":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-110","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: client_restricted; check_client_compatibility`","locale":"zh-CN"},"507":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-111","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"站点只允许自己的客户端使用免费额度","locale":"zh-CN"},"508":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-112","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`…: signature_rejected; check_request_integrity`","locale":"zh-CN"},"509":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-113","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"站点拒绝了请求签名","locale":"zh-CN"},"510":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-114","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"这些都不会让账号作废，也不会触发换账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"511":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-115","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"还要注意：","locale":"zh-CN"},"512":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-116","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`auto` 模式读取的是服务器进程启动时的环境变量；在另一个终端里设置的 `HTTPS_PROXY` 对已经运行的服务器无效。小写的 `https_proxy` 优先于大写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"513":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-117","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"环境变量里的代理地址写错时，请求会报错而不是被忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"514":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-118","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"`network.system_proxy` 只在 Windows 上有效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"515":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-119","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"SOCKS 代理对 Bedrock 的 AWS SDK 无效，Bedrock 需要 HTTP(S) 代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"516":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-120","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"本机地址（如本地的 Ollama）始终直连，不经过代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"517":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-121","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#网络与代理","content":"配置方法见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"518":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-122","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"模型不能读图（能力中 `vision` 为 `false`）时，Playground 用 **图片模型**（`playground.vision_model`）先把图片描述成文字再发送，并在回复上方提示 **此模型无法读取图片，图片“…”已由 … 描述后发送。** 找不到能读图的模型，或 **图片模型** 设为 **关闭** 时，提示 **图片“…”已略去：没有可读取它的模型。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"519":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-123","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"模型本应能读图，上游却在回复开始前拒绝了图片（错误中提到 image、vision、multimodal 等）时，Playground 自动改用描述重试一次，提示 **… 拒绝了图片，因此改为发送图片描述。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"520":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-124","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"通过 API 调用时网关不做这种转换，上游的错误会原样返回。给不能读图的模型发图片，请先换一个 `vision` 为 `true` 的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"521":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-125","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"模型不支持工具调用，或上游在回复开始前拒绝了 `tools`（错误中提到 tool、tool_choice、function call）时，Playground 去掉工具重试，提示 **… 不支持调用工具，因此在没有工具的情况下作答。** 换一个支持工具调用的模型（**模型** 页的 **工具调用**）。工具的开关和询问模式见 Playground 工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"522":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-126","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#站点拒绝图片或工具","content":"通过 API 调用时，上游对 `tools` 的拒绝原样返回给客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"523":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-127","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"`hoshimi.db` 被更新版本的 Hoshimi 用过，而现在运行的是旧版本。旧版本仍可运行，但部分记录可能显示不正确。升级到新版本，或从备份恢复数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"524":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-128","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"`hoshimi config set` 和手动编辑都要重启服务器才生效。更重要的是，服务器运行期间，每次在网页上保存设置、登录或续期，都会把内存中的配置写回 `config.json`，覆盖运行期间对文件的修改。先停止服务器，再修改文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"525":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-129","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"升级后导入旧的 JSON 记录时，这个文件无法读取，被改名放在一边，对应的记录从空开始。不影响其他功能；不需要时可以删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"526":{"id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting-130","page_id":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-troubleshooting#数据与文件","content":"仍然解决不了时，带上 `HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG` 下的日志、`hoshimi version` 的输出和复现步骤，到 GitHub Issues 反馈。日志可能包含账号 id 和主机名，分享前检查一遍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"527":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"page","content":"用量统计","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage","locale":"zh-CN"},"528":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage","content":"网关如何记录每一次调用：记录哪些字段、token 和缓存从哪里来、速度怎么算、保存多久、如何查询，以及实时视图的事件流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"529":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#记录什么","content":"记录什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"530":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#token-和缓存从哪里来","content":"token 和缓存从哪里来","locale":"zh-CN"},"531":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#首字时间和速度","content":"首字时间和速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"532":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#保存多久","content":"保存多久","locale":"zh-CN"},"533":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#查询","content":"查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"534":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#一段时间的报表","content":"一段时间的报表","locale":"zh-CN"},"535":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#调用列表","content":"调用列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"536":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-8","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#清空","content":"清空","locale":"zh-CN"},"537":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-9","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-usage#实时视图","content":"实时视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"538":{"id":"/docs/advanced-usage-10","page_id":"/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-usage","content":"网关为经过它的每一个请求留下