ge_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"最近一次可用性探测的结果，没有探测过时为 `null`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/api-management-156","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`unavailable`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/api-management-157","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"是否被暂时停用（站点对所有账号回答了 404/410）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/api-management-158","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`GET /catalog/stream` 是 SSE：先发一个 `snapshot` 事件，列出每个渠道的缓存模型（状态 `loading`）；然后每个渠道刷新完成时发一个 `provider` 事件（状态 `ready`、`failed` 或 20 秒后的 `timeout`，附带 `error`、`last_success`、`retry_at`、`source`）；最后发 `done`。等待期间发送 `: keep-alive` 注释。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/api-management-159","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#模型目录","content":"`POST /models/unavailable/reset` 解除所有被暂时停用的模型，返回 `{\"cleared\": <数量>}`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/api-management-160","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"`GET /probe` 返回 `running`、`at`（上一轮结束时间）、`results`（模型 → `state`、`detail`、`latency_ms`、`ttft_ms`、`at`）。`state` 为 `available`、`region-blocked`、`unavailable`、`throttled` 或 `unknown`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/api-management-161","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"`POST /probe` 在后台开始一轮探测，请求体可选：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/api-management-162","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#可用性探测","content":"不写 `models` 或为空数组时，探测所有需要探测的渠道的全部模型。返回同样的快照，另有 `started`（是否真的开始了新一轮；已有一轮在运行时为 `false`，轮次不会叠加）和 `unresolved`（无法解析的模型名）。探测的含义见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/api-management-163","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#凭据续期","content":"`GET /refresh` 返回 `auto_refresh` 和每个账号的 `provider`、`account`、`refreshable`、`needs_login`、`expires_at`、`failures`、`last_error`、`last_ok`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/api-management-164","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#凭据续期","content":"`POST /refresh` 立即续期即将到期的凭据，请求体可选：`{\"provider\": \"<渠道>\", \"force\": true}`（`force` 表示不管是否到期，续期所有可续期的账号）。返回每个账号的结果：`ok`、`persisted`（新凭据已写入配置）、`terminal`（站点拒绝了刷新令牌，需要重新登录）、`error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/api-management-165","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/api-management-166","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/api-management-167","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/api-management-168","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`GET /credits`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/api-management-169","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`provider`（可选）","locale":"zh-CN"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/api-management-170","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`rows`（每个账号的 `available`、`unit`、`message`，会请求上游）、`passive`（从正常响应头读到的剩余额度，超过 5 分钟标为 `stale`）、`cooled`（被移出轮换的账号、原因 `rate_limited` 或 `policy_blocked`、剩余秒数）、`checkin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/api-management-171","page_id":"/docs/api-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-management#余额与签到","content":"`GET /credits/checkins`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/api-management-172","