to_compact`、开启的工具、生效的批准模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-420","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/compact` 立即压缩对话，可附带 `instructions`（总结应关注的内容）。它依次推送 `checkpoint`（保存后的检查点消息，步骤状态为 `running`）和 `done`（最终保存的结果）。`done` 的 `status` 为 `error` 表示失败，对话保持原样；断开连接也会同样停止。有回复正在运行时返回 `409`，没有可压缩的内容（上次压缩后没有新回复）时返回 `400`。下一个问题以检查点的 ID 作为 `parent_id` 发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-421","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"回复也会自行压缩对话（回复开始时、两轮工具调用之间，以及站点以过长为由拒绝某一轮时），表现为 `compaction` 事件和 `compaction` 步骤。从压缩点起，模型收到的是此前全部内容的总结（作为一条用户消息，后接一条确认），**复制为 API 请求** 可以看到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-422","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/title` 让模型根据第一轮问答为对话命名，并等待模型完成。使用 `playground.title_model`，未设置则用对话自身的模型。临时对话、已由模型命名的对话和你自己设置了标题的对话保持不变；模型调用失败时标题也不变。返回对话摘要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-423","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`POST /conversations/{id}/branch`，请求体 `{\"message_id\": \"...\"}`，新建一个对话，包含截至该消息的路径（使用新的 ID），沿用标题、模型、推理强度和审批模式，并设置 `branched_from`。返回 `201` 和完整对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-424","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request` 返回某条回复背后的 Chat Completions 请求体（对问题则是将用来回答它的请求）：`model`、`messages`、`stream: true`，设置了推理强度时有 `reasoning_effort`，开启了工具时有 `tools` 和 `tool_choice`。使用了工具的回复返回的是第一轮的请求。这就是网页界面的 **复制为 API 请求**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-425","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#标题分支请求与会话","content":"`GET /session` 返回 `{\"conversation_id\": \"...\"}`，即上次打开的对话（没有，或该对话是临时对话或已删除时为 `null`）。`PUT /session` 用同样的请求体设置它（新对话时为 `null`）；ID 不存在时返回 `400`。网页界面启动时会重新打开它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-426","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#一次性聊天与模型列表","content":"`POST /chat/completions` 接受 OpenAI Chat Completions 请求（见 OpenAI 兼容 API），响应与 `/v1/chat/completions` 相同，但使用工具访问密钥而不是模型 API 密钥，并以 `playground` 来源记录在用量中。请求中没有 `system` 或 `developer` 消息时，先发送 `playground.system_prompt`。不会保存为对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-427","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#一次性聊天与模型列表","content":"`GET /models` 返回与 `GET /v1/models` 相同的列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/api-playground-428","page_id":"/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-playground#一次性聊天与模型列表","content":"通过对话生成的回复、标题和图片描述分别以 `playground`、`playground-title` 和 `playground-vision` 来源记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/api","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"page","content":"API 概览","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","API 参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/api","locale":"zh-CN"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/api-0","page_id":"/docs/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api","content":"Hoshimi 的 HTTP 接口全貌：模型接口、管理接口和 Playground 接口各在哪里、用哪把密钥，请求检查与错误格式，流式响应的约定，以及运行中服务器的 /docs 和 /openapi.json。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/api-1","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#接口分组","content":"接口分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/api-2","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#认证","content":"认证","locale":"zh-CN"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/api-3","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#请求检查","content":"请求检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/api-4","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#错误格式","content":"错误格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/api-5","page_id":"/docs/api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api#流