":"/docs/cli-env-96","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#playground-工具运行命令时设置的变量","content":"这里没有设置编码相关的变量：命令按启动 Hoshimi 的终端的编码输出，输出按 UTF-8 读取。中文等非英文输出变成 `�` 时，请从 UTF-8 的终端启动 Hoshimi，见 非 UTF-8 的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-97","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#不会读取的变量","content":"**渠道的密钥变量。** `hoshimi stations` 的 **Key env** 一列（如 `ZENMUX_API_KEY`）以及其他上游工具惯用的密钥变量，Hoshimi 都不读取。渠道的凭据只来自 `config.json` 中的账户，避免出现第二个来源。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-98","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#不会读取的变量","content":"**`HOSHIMI_CONFIG`。** 旧版本用它指定配置文件，已经移除；配置文件总是 `<数据目录>/config.json`。仍然设置着它不会有任何效果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/cli-env-99","page_id":"/docs/cli-env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli-env#不会读取的变量","content":"**设置项。** 没有与 `config.json` 键对应的环境变量（例如不存在 `HOSHIMI_PORT`）。要临时改变端口、密钥等，用 `hoshimi serve` 的选项；要长期修改，用 `hoshimi config set` 或 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/cli","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"page","content":"命令行概览","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","命令行"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli","locale":"zh-CN"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/cli-0","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"hoshimi 命令的组成、全局选项、命令如何读取配置、输出与 --json、退出码和日志，以及常用的命令组合。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/cli-1","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#命令一览","content":"命令一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/cli-2","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"全局选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/cli-3","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#命令如何工作","content":"命令如何工作","locale":"zh-CN"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/cli-4","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"输出与 `--json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/cli-5","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url"