"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令如何工作","content":"**`serve` 的选项只作用于这一次启动。** 例如 `hoshimi serve --port 11000 --access-token …` 不会写入配置文件。优先级为：`serve` 的选项 ＞ `config.json` ＞ 默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/cli-31","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"列表类命令默认打印表格；加 `--json` 打印 JSON，适合脚本处理。支持 `--json` 的命令：`check`、`models`、`providers`、`stations`、`version`、`env`、`config show`。`config get` 总是打印 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/cli-32","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"数据写到标准输出，日志和错误写到标准错误，所以管道里只会得到数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/cli-33","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出与---json","content":"读取配置的命令会隐藏凭据：`config show` 和 `config get` 把 `server.access_token`、`server.model_api_key`，以及渠道和网络设置中的 API Key、令牌、密钥和代理地址显示为 `***`；`env` 把名字中含 `TOKEN` 或 `KEY` 的变量值显示为 `***`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/cli-34","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/cli-35","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/cli-36","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/cli-37","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/cli-38","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/cli-39","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"一般错误：命令失败、被取消、登录失败或超时、配置文件无法读取","locale":"zh-CN"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/cli-40","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/cli-41","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"用法错误或无效值（未知选项、`config set` 的值没有通过检查）；`check` 发现没有启用任何渠道；`login` 的站点不支持交互登录；没有子命令时显示帮助","locale":"zh-CN"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/cli-42","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/cli-43","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`serve` 找不到可用端口（或在 `--strict-port` 下端口被占用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/cli-44","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`4`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/cli-45","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"输入无效：`config get` 的键不存在；`serve` 监听非本机地址但没有配置工具访问密钥或允许的网段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/cli-46","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/cli-47","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"上游服务出错","locale":"zh-CN"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/cli-48","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`130`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/cli-49","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"被 Ctrl+C 中断","locale":"zh-CN"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/cli-50","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#退出码","content":"`serve` 运行时按 Ctrl+C 会正常关闭服务器：先结束实时用量等长连接，再退出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/cli-51","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#日志","content":"日志写到标准错误。默认级别是 `INFO`；`--debug` 打开调试日志，环境变量 `HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL` 可以设为 `DEBUG`、`INFO`、`WARNING` 或 `ERROR`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/cli-52","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#配置文件损坏时","content":"`config.json` 无法解析时，所有读取配置的命令（包括 `serve`）都会拒绝运行，并在出错前把原文件复制一份为 `config.json.corrupt-<时间>`，错误信息里会给出这个副本的路径。修好或删除 `config.json` 后再试。文件位置和格式见配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"page","conte