le":"zh-CN"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#错误","content":"错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic","content":"Hoshimi 的 `/v1/messages` 兼容 Anthropic Messages，Anthropic 官方 SDK 只需改 Base URL。模型目录与 OpenAI 接口共用，任何模型都可以通过 Messages 调用。本页示例都在本机实测过；`<model-id>` 换成 `GET /v1/models` 返回的 `id`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"Base URL","locale":"zh-CN"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"`http://127.0.0.1:10600`（不带 `/v1`，SDK 会自己拼上 `/v1/messages`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"API Key","locale":"zh-CN"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"网关的模型 API 密钥，作为 `x-api-key` 或 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送；没有设置时填任意非空字符串","locale":"zh-CN"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"`/v1/models` 中的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`；Messages 必须写明，不使用默认模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#连接参数","content":"SDK 的 `api_key` 参数发送 `x-api-key`，`auth_token` 参数发送 `Authorization: Bearer`，两种 Hoshimi 都接受。两者同时出现时以 `Authorization` 为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#python","content":"`max_tokens` 是必填项。和 Anthropic 一样，不写 `stream` 时返回完整的 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#流式","content":"SDK 的流式辅助方法可以直接使用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#流式","content":"等待上游时，Hoshimi 每 15 秒在完整事件之间插入一个 `ping` 事件，SDK 会自动忽略它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#工具调用","content":"`tool_choice` 可以是 `{\"type\": \"auto\"}`、`{\"type\": \"any\"}`、`{\"type\": \"none\"}`，或 `{\"type\": \"tool\", \"name\": \"...\"}`（名字必须是声明过的工具）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#工具调用","content":"工具结果放在下一条用户消息里，`tool_use_id` 对应上一轮的调用；`tool_result` 块要放在这条消息中的文字和图片之前。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#工具调用","content":"把上一轮的 `reply.content` 原样放回 `assistant` 消息，其中的思考块和签名也要保留（见下文）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"两种写法都可以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"`thinking.type` 可以是 `enabled`、`disabled`、`adaptive`。`enabled` 的 `budget_tokens` 至少 1024，且小于 `max_tokens`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"`output_config.effort` 可以是 `low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`、`max`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"上游不说 Anthropic 协议时，这些设置会换算成该模型支持的推理强度，换算规则见 Anthropic 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#思考与推理强度","content":"多轮对话中，要把助手消息里的 `thinking` / `redacted_thinking` 块连同原始 `signature` 一起发回。不要编辑或伪造签名，也不要把一个模型的签名拿给另一个模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-32","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#token-计数","content":"上游提供原生计数接口时（Anthropic 账号默认如此）返回的是上游的计数；否则返回 Hoshimi 的本地估算，响应头带 `x-hoshimi-token-count: estimate`。估算按请求内容的 UTF-8 字节数近似，不调用分词器。计数不生成回复，也不记入用量统计。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-33","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#curl","content":"加上 `\"stream\": true` 得到 SSE（配合 `curl -N`）。没有设置模型 API 密钥时可以省略 `x-api-key`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-34","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"Hoshimi 按请求实际落到的账号决定怎么处理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2204":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-35","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"**原生转发**：账号所在的渠道本身提供 Messages 接口（例如 `anthropic`），请求只替换模型名后原样转发，系统提示数组、内容顺序、签名、缓存标记、`context_management`、结构化输出以及将来的新字段都交给上游校验；`anthropic-*` 请求头和查询参数也会带上。上游的错误（状态码、响应体、`request-id`、`retry-after`、`anthropic-ratelimit-*` 等头）原样返回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-36","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"**协议转换**：其他渠道先把 Messages 转换成内部的 Chat 格式。文字、图片、系统提示、工具、思考都能转换，但只有原生上游才支持的功能（MCP 连接器、容器、`context_management`、服务器端工具、`task_budget`、非文本文档等）会返回 `400`，消息中写明是哪个字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-37","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#原生转发与协议转换","content":"两种路径的完整差异见 Anthropic 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-38","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#错误","content":"Messages 的错误使用 Anthropic 的格式，SDK 会抛出对应的异常（如 `anthropic.NotFoundError`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/clients-anthropic-39","page_id":"/docs/clients-anthropic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-anthropic#错误","content":"流式请求在发出响应头之前会先打开上游，所以认证失败、限流这类错误仍然带着正确的 HTTP 状态码返回；流开始后的失败以 `error` 事件告知。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2209":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"page","content":"Claude Code","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","locale":"zh-CN"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"让 Claude Code 通过 Hoshimi 调用模型：设置 ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL 和密钥、选择模型与后台模型、模型发现，以及经过协议转换的上游目前的限制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#配置步骤","content":"配置步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"准备模型和密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2213":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"设置环境变量并启动","locale":"zh-CN"},"2214":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#固定后台模型","content":"固定后台模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2215":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#写进-settingsjson","content":"写进 settings.json","locale":"zh-CN"},"2216":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#模型发现","content":"模型发现","locale":"zh-CN"},"2217":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"相关环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2218":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Claude Code 的请求如何被处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2219":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"2220":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"Claude Code 说的是 Anthropic Messages 协议，把它的 Base URL 指向 Hoshimi，它的请求就会走 Hoshimi 的 `/v1/messages`。用的是网关的模型 API 密钥，上游账号的凭据留在 Hoshimi 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2221":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"模型所在的渠道本身提供 Messages 接口时（例如 `anthropic` 渠道），Hoshimi 只替换模型名后原样转发，Claude Code 的各种请求字段都由上游处理。其他渠道的模型要经过协议转换，而较新的 Claude Code 会发送转换路径不支持的内容。在本地用 Claude Code 2.1.308（`claude -p`）测试时，经过转换的模型返回：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2222":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"`400 <渠道>: context_management requires a native Messages upstream.`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2223":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"设置 `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS=1` 后：`400 <渠道>: Messages roles must be user or assistant; use top-level system.`（这个版本会在 `messages` 中放入 `system` 角色的消息）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2224":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code","content":"所以目前请为 Claude Code 选择原生 Messages 渠道上的模型。两条路径的差别见 Anthropic 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2225":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"启动 Hoshimi，在 **渠道** 页添加一个提供 Messages 接口的渠道账号（如 Anthropic 的 API Key），见渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2226":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"在 **模型** 页或用 `curl http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1/models` 找到模型 id。写成 `anthropic/<model-id>` 可以确保由这个渠道处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#准备模型和密钥","content":"如果设置了 **模型 API 密钥**（**设置** › **访问** › **密钥**），准备好它；没有设置时任意非空字符串都可以。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"`ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` 不带 `/v1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` 以 `x-api-key` 发送。旧的 `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` 会以 `Authorization` 头发送，而 Hoshimi 在两者同时出现时以 `Authorization` 为准，所以要清掉它，或者干脆把模型 API 密钥填在 `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#设置环境变量并启动","content":"用的是 **模型 API 密钥**，不是工具访问密钥，也不是上游的 Anthropic Key。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#固定后台模型","content":"Claude Code 的后台请求使用 Haiku 别名，另外还有 Sonnet、Opus 两个别名。别名指向的模型 id 在 Hoshimi 中找不到时，请求会报路由错误。把 `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` 指向网关里存在的模型，后台请求就会固定到它；用到 Sonnet、Opus 别名时也同样设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#写进-settingsjson","content":"不想每次设置环境变量时，可以写进 Claude Code 的用户设置 `~/.claude/settings.json` 的 `env` 中，`ANTHROPIC_MODEL` 代替 `--model`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#模型发现","content":"设置 `CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_GATEWAY_MODEL_DISCOVERY=1` 后，Claude Code 会向网关请求模型列表来填充模型选择器。Hoshimi 对它发出的 `GET /v1/models?limit=1000` 最多等待 2 秒：响应慢的渠道先用缓存、配置或内置的模型 id 顶上，发现在后台继续完成；每个条目带有 `display_name` 供显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#模型发现","content":"Claude Code 的选择器只显示 id 中含 `claude` 或 `anthropic` 的模型。其他模型请用 `--model`、`ANTHROPIC_MODEL` 或上面的别名变量显式指定；Hoshimi 不会把其他模型改名伪装成 Claude。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"网关地址，`http://127.0.0.1:10600`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"模型 API 密钥，以 `x-api-key` 发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-32","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"以 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送；与上一项二选一，优先于它","locale":"zh-CN"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-33","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_MODEL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-34","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"默认主模型，等同 `--model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2245":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-35","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL` / `_SONNET_MODEL` / `_OPUS_MODEL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2246":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-36","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"三个模型别名对应的网关模型 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2247":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-37","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_GATEWAY_MODEL_DISCOVERY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-38","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"设为 `1` 时从网关的 `/v1/models` 发现模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-39","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"`CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-40","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#相关环境变量","content":"设为 `1` 时减少实验性 beta 功能，可用于排查上游不支持 beta 的问题；具体效果取决于 Claude Code 版本，它不会去掉所有 beta 头、推理强度或自适应思考，也不能代替原生转发","locale":"zh-CN"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-41","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Claude Code 发送 `thinking: {\"type\": \"adaptive\"}` 和 `output_config.effort`。原生转发时原样交给上游；转换时换算成该模型的推理强度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-42","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"原生转发保留 `anthropic-beta` 等 `anthropic-*` 请求头，并合并 OAuth 账号必需的 beta 能力；上游的限流头（`retry-after`、`anthropic-ratelimit-*`、`x-should-retry`）原样返回，Claude Code 可以据此重试。上游明确返回 `x-should-retry: false` 时，Hoshimi 也不会换账号重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-43","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"流式响应在等待上游时每 15 秒插入一个 `ping` 事件，只出现在完整事件之间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-44","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Hoshimi 不保存对话历史，Claude Code 每轮都会发送完整历史。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-45","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#claude-code-的请求如何被处理","content":"Claude Code 遇到不认识的模型 id 时会提示它假定 200k 的上下文窗口，这只是 Claude Code 自己的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-46","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"现象","locale":"zh-CN"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-47","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"原因与处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-48","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"`401`，`A model API key is required`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-49","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"设置了模型 API 密钥但没有发送，或 `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` 中是旧值覆盖了 `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-50","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"`404`，`Model '…' not found`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-51","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"主模型或某个别名指向的 id 不在目录中；检查 `--model` 和三个 `ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_*_MODEL`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2262":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-52","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"`400`，`… requires a native Messages upstream` 或 `Messages roles must be user or assistant`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-53","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"模型经过协议转换，见本页开头","locale":"zh-CN"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-54","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"连接被拒绝或 `Host not allowed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2265":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-55","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"端口不是 10600（看服务器启动时打印的地址），或从另一台机器、容器访问，见访问控制","locale":"zh-CN"},"2266":{"id":"/docs/clients-claude-code-56","page_id":"/docs/clients-claude-code","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-claude-code#排查","content":"每次调用（包括失败的）都会出现在 **用量** 页，可以在那里看到错误信息和实际使用的渠道与账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2267":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"page","content":"Codex","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex","locale":"zh-CN"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex","content":"在 Codex CLI 的 config.toml 中把 Hoshimi 添加为模型提供方，通过 Responses 接口使用网关里的任意模型；包括推理强度、工具调用和常见问题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#配置","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#找到模型-id","content":"找到模型 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"编辑 config.toml","locale":"zh-CN"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#设置密钥并运行","content":"设置密钥并运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#推理强度","content":"推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#工具调用","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"常见问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex","content":"Codex CLI 通过 OpenAI Responses 协议调用模型，可以在配置里添加自定义的模型提供方。把 Hoshimi 添加进去后，Codex 就能使用网关目录中的任何模型：Hoshimi 把 Responses 请求转换成上游各自的协议。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex","content":"本页讲的是把 Codex CLI 作为客户端接到 Hoshimi。Hoshimi 自己也有一个名为 `codex` 的渠道，用 ChatGPT 账号登录后把 Codex 的模型提供给网关，那是另一回事，见渠道概念。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#找到模型-id","content":"在 **模型** 页或用 `curl http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1/models` 选一个支持工具调用的模型。Codex 会大量使用工具，**模型** 页标有 **工具调用** 的模型更合适。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"Codex 的配置在 `~/.codex/config.toml`（设置了 `CODEX_HOME` 时在该目录下）。添加一个提供方并设为默认：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"`base_url` 带 `/v1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"`env_key` 是保存密钥的环境变量名，Codex 把它的值以 `Authorization: Bearer` 发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#编辑-configtoml","content":"`wire_api = \"responses\"` 让 Codex 调用 `/v1/responses`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#设置密钥并运行","content":"临时换模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#推理强度","content":"在 `config.toml` 中设置，或在命令行上用 `-c` 覆盖：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#推理强度","content":"Codex 以 `reasoning.effort` 发送，Hoshimi 换算成该模型自己的级别，规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口。模型的推理内容会作为 `reasoning` 项返回，Codex 显示为思考过程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#工具调用","content":"Codex 的命令执行等工具都是 `function` 类型，Hoshimi 会转换后交给上游，模型发出的调用再转换回 Codex。Codex 同时发送的 `web_search` 等内置工具和 `namespace` 类型的工具不是 `function`，Hoshimi 会忽略它们，模型看不到这些工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#工具调用","content":"Codex 每一轮都发送完整的 `input` 并设置 `store: false`，正好符合 Hoshimi 无状态的 Responses 接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"现象","locale":"zh-CN"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`Model metadata for '<id>' not found. Defaulting to fallback metadata`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"Codex 不认识这个模型名时打印的警告，请求照常发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`stream disconnected before completion: stream closed before response.completed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"流开始后上游返回了错误，Hoshimi 用错误事件结束了流，Codex 重连几次后放弃。打开 **用量** 页查看这次调用的错误信息。在本地测试中，同样的工具调用任务有的模型能完成，有的模型在第二轮被上游以 `HTTP 400` 拒绝，换一个模型通常可以解决","locale":"zh-CN"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`401`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"设置了模型 API 密钥，但 `env_key` 指向的环境变量为空或值不对","locale":"zh-CN"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`404`，`Model '…' not found`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`model` 不在目录中；可以写成 `渠道/模型` 指定渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"`400`，`previous_response_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/clients-codex-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-codex","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-codex#常见问题","content":"不会出现在 Codex 的默认配置中；Hoshimi 不保存响应，见接入客户端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","type":"page","content":"OpenAI SDK 与 curl","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-openai","locale":"zh-CN"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai","content":"用 OpenAI 的 Python、JavaScript SDK 和 curl 