s/clients-openai-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai","content":"OpenAI 的官方 SDK 只要换掉 Base URL 就能直接调用 Hoshimi。本页的示例都在本机实测过；把 `<model-id>` 换成 `GET /v1/models` 返回的某个 `id`（见接入客户端）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"Base URL","locale":"zh-CN"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"`http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"API Key","locale":"zh-CN"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"网关的模型 API 密钥；没有设置时填任意非空字符串","locale":"zh-CN"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"`/v1/models` 中的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#连接参数","content":"示例从环境变量读取密钥：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-22","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#非流式","content":"Hoshimi 在请求没有 `stream` 字段时默认流式返回。SDK 在不传 `stream` 时不会发送这个字段，`create()` 会返回一段 SSE 原文（`str`）而不是对象。Responses 的 `client.responses.create()` 也一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-23","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#流式","content":"流中有一个 `choices` 为空、只带 `usage` 的块（上游报告了用量时），不需要设置 `stream_options`；所以循环里要先判断 `chunk.choices`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-24","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#推理内容与推理强度","content":"推理模型的思考过程放在 `reasoning_content` 字段，SDK 把它作为附加属性保留：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-25","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#推理内容与推理强度","content":"流式时从 `chunk.choices[0].delta` 上用 `getattr(delta, \"reasoning_content\", None)` 读取。`reasoning_effort` 可以写 `minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high`、`xhigh`、`max`，也可以写模型自己的级别名；各模型的级别见 **模型** 页，映射规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-26","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#工具调用","content":"`tool_choice` 可以是 `auto`、`none`、`required` 或指定某个函数。每一轮都要把完整的 `messages` 发回去，Hoshimi 不保存历史。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-27","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#图片","content":"图片作为 `image_url` 内容块发送，可以是 `data:` URL：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2329":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-28","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#图片","content":"只有能看图的模型会理解图片，**模型** 页的 **视觉** 标记说明了这一点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-29","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"流式时用 `stream=True` 逐个读取事件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-30","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"Hoshimi 的 Responses 事件流不发送 `response.content_part.added` 等内容分段事件，Python SDK 的 `client.responses.stream()` 辅助方法依赖这些事件，会抛出 `IndexError`。请改用上面的 `responses.create(..., stream=True)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-31","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"Responses 的工具调用循环：把上一轮的全部 `output` 项和 `function_call_output` 一起放回 `input`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-32","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#responses","content":"Responses 是无状态的：`previous_response_id` 和结构化输出 `text.format` 会被拒绝（`400`），只接受 `type: \"function\"` 的工具。完整的字段说明见 OpenAI 兼容接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-33","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#javascript--typescript","content":"和 Python 一样，不写 `stream` 时 `create()` 返回的是 SSE 原文字符串。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-34","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"非流式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-35","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"流式（`-N` 关闭 curl 的缓冲）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-36","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"每个事件是一行 `data: {...}`，最后是 `data: [DONE]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-37","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"Responses：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-38","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"没有设置模型 API 密钥时可以省略 `Authorization` 头，`x-api-key: <密钥>` 也可以代替它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-39","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#curl","content":"在 Playground 里，回复的 **更多操作** 菜单中的 **复制为 API 请求** 会把这条回复背后的 Chat Completions 请求复制成一条 curl 命令，密钥从 `$HOSHIMI_API_KEY` 读取，可以直接作为起点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-40","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#错误处理","content":"`/v1` 的错误使用 OpenAI 的格式，SDK 会抛出对应的异常（如 `openai.NotFoundError`、`openai.BadRequestError`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/clients-openai-41","page_id":"/docs/clients-openai","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-openai#错误处理","content":"流式响应开始之后，上游的失败不能再改变 HTTP 状态码：Chat Completions 会发出一个 `data: {\"error\": {...}}` 事件并结束（没有 `data: [DONE]`），Responses 发出 `response.failed` 事件或同样的 `error` 事件。失败的调用会记录在 **用量** 页，可以在那里查看错误信息。错误码的完整列表见 API 概览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"page","content":"OpenCode","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode","locale":"zh-CN"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-0","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode","content":"在 opencode.json 中把 Hoshimi 添加为 OpenAI 兼容的提供方，让 OpenCode 使用网关里的模型；包括密钥、模型列表、推理强度，以及它和 Hoshimi 的 OpenCode Zen 渠道的区别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-1","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#配置","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-2","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"写 opencode.json","locale":"zh-CN"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-3","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#设置密钥并运行","content":"设置密钥并运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-4","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#推理强度","content":"推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-5","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#工具调用","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-6","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"通过 OpenCode Zen 渠道使用免费模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-7","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode","content":"OpenCode 可以通过 `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible` 接入任何 OpenAI 兼容的服务。把 Hoshimi 配置成一个提供方后，OpenCode 用 Chat Completions 调用网关，网关再把请求转给各个渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-8","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode","content":"本页讲的是把 OpenCode 这个编程助手作为客户端接到 Hoshimi。Hoshimi 自带的 `opencode` 渠道是反过来的：它连接 OpenCode Zen 的免费模型，提供给网关的所有客户端使用，见匿名入口。两者可以同时使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2353":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-9","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"在项目根目录的 `opencode.json`（只对这个项目生效）或全局配置 `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json` 中添加：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-10","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"`baseURL` 带 `/v1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-11","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"`apiKey` 用 `{env:HOSHIMI_API_KEY}` 从环境变量读取模型 API 密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-12","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"`models` 中的键是 Hoshimi 的模型 id（`/v1/models` 中的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`），值里的 `name` 是 OpenCode 中显示的名字。列在这里的模型会出现在 OpenCode 的模型列表中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-13","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#写-opencodejson","content":"顶层的 `model` 是默认模型，格式为 `提供方/模型`，这里的提供方是 `hoshimi`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-14","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#设置密钥并运行","content":"单次运行或换模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-15","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#推理强度","content":"在模型的 `options` 中设置 `reasoningEffort`，OpenCode 会以 `reasoning_effort` 发送：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-16","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#推理强度","content":"可以写 `low`、`medium`、`high` 等，也可以写模型自己的级别名；Hoshimi 的换算规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口，各模型的级别见 **模型** 页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-17","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#工具调用","content":"OpenCode 的读文件、搜索、执行命令等工具以 Chat Completions 的 `function` 工具发送，模型的调用原样转换回 OpenCode 执行。选择 **模型** 页标有 **工具调用** 的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-18","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"用 Hoshimi 默认启用的 `opencode` 渠道上的模型（如 `/v1/models` 中 `owned_by` 为 `opencode` 的那些）时，有两点和客户端有关：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-19","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"匿名通道会按对话生成会话 ID，来源依次是请求体中的 `session_id`、`conversation_id`、`user`，都没有时取第一条用户消息。两个以相同开场白开始的独立对话会共用会话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2364":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-20","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"匿名通道会额外声明上游要求的 `read`、`shell` 两个工具。客户端没有声明的工具，模型调用了也不会交给客户端：Hoshimi 会告诉模型这个工具不可用并让它继续回答。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/clients-opencode-21","page_id":"/docs/clients-opencode","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients-opencode#通过-opencode-zen-渠道使用免费模型","content":"渠道本身的协议细节、匿名与 API Key 账号的区别见匿名入口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/clients","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"page","content":"接入客户端","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","接入客户端"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients","locale":"zh-CN"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/clients-0","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients","content":"把 SDK、curl 或编程助手接到 Hoshimi 需要知道的事：Base URL、用哪把密钥、模型名怎么写、选哪种 API，以及流式、推理强度和工具调用的约定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/clients-1","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"需要准备的三样东西","locale":"zh-CN"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/clients-2","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/clients-3","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"模型名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/clients-4","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"选择哪种 API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/clients-5","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#流式输出","content":"流式输出","locale":"zh-CN"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/clients-6","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"无状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/clients-7","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/clients-8","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"工具调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/clients-9","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#从其他机器或容器连接","content":"从其他机器或容器连接","locale":"zh-CN"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/clients-10","page_id":"/docs/clients","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"客户端指南","locale":"zh-CN"},"2378":{"id":"/docs/clients-11","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients","content":"Hoshimi 对外提供 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 两种协议。任何能自定义 Base URL 的客户端都可以接入：上游账号的凭据留在 Hoshimi 里，客户端只需要知道网关的地址、网关的密钥和一个模型名。本页说明这些共同的约定，各客户端的具体配置见文末的指南。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2379":{"id":"/docs/clients-12","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"2380":{"id":"/docs/clients-13","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"取值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2381":{"id":"/docs/clients-14","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"在哪里找","locale":"zh-CN"},"2382":{"id":"/docs/clients-15","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"Base URL","locale":"zh-CN"},"2383":{"id":"/docs/clients-16","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"OpenAI 兼容客户端用 `http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1`；Anthropic 兼容客户端用 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2384":{"id":"/docs/clients-17","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"**概览** 页的 **接口** 区块列出各个接口地址，可以直接复制","locale":"zh-CN"},"2385":{"id":"/docs/clients-18","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2386":{"id":"/docs/clients-19","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"网关的 **模型 API 密钥**；没有设置时任意非空字符串都行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2387":{"id":"/docs/clients-20","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"**设置** › **访问** › **密钥**","locale":"zh-CN"},"2388":{"id":"/docs/clients-21","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"模型名","locale":"zh-CN"},"2389":{"id":"/docs/clients-22","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"`GET /v1/models` 返回的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2390":{"id":"/docs/clients-23","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"**模型** 页，或下文的 curl 命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"2391":{"id":"/docs/clients-24","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#需要准备的三样东西","content":"10600 端口被占用时，服务器会改用下一个空闲端口，以启动时终端打印的地址为准；**设置** › **访问** 中的 **监听地址** 显示实际使用的端口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/clients-25","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"Hoshimi 有两把互相独立的密钥，客户端只用其中一把：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/clients-26","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2394":{"id":"/docs/clients-27","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"配置键","locale":"zh-CN"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/clients-28","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"用于","locale":"zh-CN"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/clients-29","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"怎么发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/clients-30","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"模型 API 密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/clients-31","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"`server.model_api_key`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/clients-32","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"`/v1/*`：Chat Completions、Responses、Messages、模型列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/clients-33","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"`Authorization: Bearer <密钥>` 或 `x-api-key: <密钥>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2401":{"id":"/docs/clients-34","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"工具访问密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"2402":{"id":"/docs/clients-35","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"`server.access_token`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2403":{"id":"/docs/clients-36","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"`/api/*` 管理接口、网页界面、`/docs`、`/openapi.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/clients-37","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"`Authorization: Bearer <密钥>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/clients-38","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"客户端接入一律用 **模型 API 密钥**。工具访问密钥打不开 `/v1/*`，反过来也一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/clients-39","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"没有设置模型 API 密钥时，`/v1/*` 不检查密钥。多数 SDK 和工具要求填一个值，随便填一个非空字符串即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2407":{"id":"/docs/clients-40","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"同时带了 `Authorization` 和 `x-api-key` 时，以 `Authorization` 为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/clients-41","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"渠道账号的凭据（站点的 API Key、登录令牌）只保存在 Hoshimi 中，永远不要填进客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/clients-42","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#密钥","content":"密钥的设置方法、局域网访问和来源限制见访问控制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/clients-43","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"先列出可用的模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/clients-44","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"`id` 是上游自己的模型名，`owned_by` 是提供它的渠道。请求里的 `model` 有两种写法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/clients-45","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"**直接写 `id`**，如 `big-pickle`。Hoshimi 按渠道顺序找第一个提供这个模型的渠道。只启用了一个渠道时，目录里没有的模型名也会原样发给它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/clients-46","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"**写成 `渠道/模型`**，如 `opencode/big-pickle`，指定由哪个渠道处理。第一个斜杠后面的全部内容作为上游模型名发送，可以再含斜杠，例如 `kilo/kilo-auto/free`。几个渠道提供同名模型时，用这种写法选择其中一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/clients-47","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"请求不写 `model` 时，Chat Completions 和 Responses 使用 **设置** › **常规** 中的 **默认模型**（配置键 `server.default_model`，或 `hoshimi serve --default-model`）。Messages 接口始终要求写明 `model`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/clients-48","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#模型名","content":"每个模型能否看图、是否推理、能否调用工具、有哪些推理强度，在 **模型** 页可以看到，见模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/clients-49","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/clients-50","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/clients-51","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"适合","locale":"zh-CN"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/clients-52","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/clients-53","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"`POST /v1/chat/completions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/clients-54","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"绝大多数 OpenAI 兼容客户端、OpenAI SDK、OpenCode","locale":"zh-CN"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/clients-55","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Responses","locale":"zh-CN"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/clients-56","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"`POST /v1/responses`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/clients-57","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"只说 Responses 的客户端，如 Codex","locale":"zh-CN"},"2425":{"id":"/docs/clients-58","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Messages","locale":"zh-CN"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/clients-59","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"`POST /v1/messages`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/clients-60","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"Anthropic SDK、Claude Code","locale":"zh-CN"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/clients-61","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#选择哪种-api","content":"三种 API 共用同一个模型目录，任何模型都可以从任何一种 API 调用：Hoshimi 在客户端协议和上游协议之间转换。能转换不等于上游支持一切功能，例如不支持工具调用的模型，从哪种 API 调用都不会调用工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/clients-62","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#流式输出","content":"Chat Completions 和 Responses 在请求中没有 `stream` 字段时按 **流式**（SSE）返回，这和 OpenAI 官方接口相反。要一次拿到完整 JSON，请显式发送 `\"stream\": false`。OpenAI 的 Python 和 JavaScript SDK 在不传 `stream` 时不会发送这个字段，结果拿到的是一段 SSE 文本而不是对象，所以非流式调用一定要写 `stream=False`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/clients-63","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#流式输出","content":"Messages 与 Anthropic 一致：默认返回 JSON，`\"stream\": true` 时返回 SSE。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/clients-64","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Hoshimi 不保存对话。每次请求都要带上完整的历史：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/clients-65","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Chat Completions 和 Messages 发送全部 `messages`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/clients-66","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Responses 发送全部 `input`；`previous_response_id` 会被拒绝（`400`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/clients-67","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#无状态","content":"Playground 的对话保存在服务器上，但那是网页界面自己的接口，见 Playground API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/clients-68","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"三种 API 各有自己的字段，Hoshimi 都能读懂：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/clients-69","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/clients-70","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/clients-71","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/clients-72","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/clients-73","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`reasoning_effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/clients-74","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"reasoning_effort\": \"high\"`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/clients-75","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Responses","locale":"zh-CN"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/clients-76","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`reasoning.effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/clients-77","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"reasoning\": {\"effort\": \"low\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/clients-78","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"Messages","locale":"zh-CN"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/clients-79","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`output_config.effort` 或 `thinking`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/clients-80","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"`\"output_config\": {\"effort\": \"medium\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/clients-81","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#推理强度","content":"不同模型的推理选项不同。自带推理菜单的模型（例如 `disabled` / `low` / `high` / `max`）直接使用对应的级别；其余推理模型使用 Hoshimi 的三档输出预算 `light` / `balanced` / `deep`，OpenAI 的 `minimal`、`low`、`medium`、`high` 等会被映射过去。请求里不写推理强度时，Hoshimi 不改动请求。映射规则见 OpenAI 兼容接口，三档预算的含义见模型与账号行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/clients-82","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"工具由客户端执行，Hoshimi 只负责在协议之间转换工具定义、调用和结果：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/clients-83","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Chat Completions：`tools` 中的 `function` 工具，回复里的 `tool_calls`，结果用 `role: \"tool\"` 消息发回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/clients-84","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Responses：`type: \"function\"` 的工具，回复里的 `function_call` 项，结果用 `function_call_output` 项发回。其他类型的工具会被忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/clients-85","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"Messages：带 `input_schema` 的工具，回复里的 `tool_use` 块，结果用 `tool_result` 块发回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/clients-86","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#工具调用","content":"具体示例见各客户端页面。模型是否真的会调用工具取决于上游，**模型** 页的能力标记可供参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/clients-87","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#从其他机器或容器连接","content":"默认只监听 `127.0.0.1`，而且只接受 `Host` 为 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1` 或 `::1` 的请求，所以从另一台机器或容器里访问（例如通过 `host.docker.internal`）会被拒绝。网页里运行的客户端还会受到来源检查。需要时按访问控制设置监听地址、**允许的 CIDR**、**允许的主机名** 和 **允许的来源**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/clients-88","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"OpenAI SDK 与 curl\" href=\"/docs/clients-openai\" description=\"Python、JavaScript 和 curl：Chat Completions 与 Responses，流式、推理和工具调用。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/clients-89","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Anthropic SDK\" href=\"/docs/clients-anthropic\" description=\"用 Anthropic SDK 调用 Messages：流式、工具、思考和 Token 计数。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/clients-90","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Claude Code\" href=\"/docs/clients-claude-code\" description=\"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL 等环境变量、模型别名和已知限制。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/clients-91","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"Codex\" href=\"/docs/clients-codex\" description=\"在 config.toml 中添加 Hoshimi 作为模型提供方。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/clients-92","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"OpenCode\" href=\"/docs/clients-opencode\" description=\"在 opencode.json 中添加 OpenAI 兼容的提供方。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2460":{"id":"/docs/clients-93","page_id":"/docs/clients","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/clients#客户端指南","content":"<Card title=\"API 参考\" href=\"/docs/api\" description=\"认证、错误格式和每个接口的字段。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"2461":{"id":"/docs/config-network","page_id":"/docs/config-network","type":"page","content":"网络与代理","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","配置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-network","locale":"zh-CN"},"2462":{"id":"/docs/config-network-0","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network","content":"Hoshimi 访问上游站点时走哪条线路：自动读取环境代理、直连或指定代理，按渠道覆盖，哪些请求受影响，以及如何读网络诊断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2463":{"id":"/do