。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/config-network-53","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"每个渠道可以有自己的线路。在 **渠道** 页打开一个渠道，在它的 **网络** 部分选择线路；选 **继承全局配置** 就跟随 **设置** › **网络**。对应的配置是 `providers.<id>.options.network`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/config-network-54","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"渠道没有写 `network`，或写了 `{\"mode\": \"inherit\"}`，就使用全局策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/config-network-55","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"渠道写了明确的策略，就**整体替换**全局策略，不会与之合并。例如渠道写 `{\"mode\": \"auto\"}`，它会读环境变量，即使全局是 `proxy`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2518":{"id":"/docs/config-network-56","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#按渠道覆盖","content":"渠道的 `network` 对象里省略 `mode` 时等同于 `inherit`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2519":{"id":"/docs/config-network-57","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/config-network-58","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"使用的策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/config-network-59","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"模型目录、推理、令牌刷新与交换、余额、签到","locale":"zh-CN"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/config-network-60","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"所属渠道的策略","locale":"zh-CN"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/config-network-61","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#哪些请求受影响","content":"`hoshimi login` 和网页上的 **登录** 中，网关自己发出的请求（发起授权、轮询、换取令牌）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2524":{"id":"/docs/config-network-62","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network