twork#网络诊断","content":"HTTP 429","locale":"zh-CN"},"2590":{"id":"/docs/config-network-128","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`upstream_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2591":{"id":"/docs/config-network-129","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"上游服务错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2592":{"id":"/docs/config-network-130","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"其他错误状态码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2593":{"id":"/docs/config-network-131","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#网络诊断","content":"`challenge`、`edge_rejected`、`invalid_response`、`client_restricted`、`region_restricted` 和 `signature_rejected` 会在处理令牌之前被识别出来：它们不会让账号的刷新令牌作废，也不会触发换账号或标记模型失效。单纯的 HTTP 403 也不会被当作令牌过期。遇到这些情况，先检查线路（换代理或直连）、地区和站点状态。更多排查步骤见故障排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2594":{"id":"/docs/config-network-132","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#渠道并发与等待","content":"每个渠道实例的推理请求共享并发上限：默认 2，Zcode 默认 1。流式请求直到结束或关闭才释放名额。通过 `providers.<id>.options.admission` 调整并发数、发出请求的最小间隔和排队等待上限：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2595":{"id":"/docs/config-network-133","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#渠道并发与等待","content":"`max_concurrency` 必须是正整数，其余两个值是非负且有限的秒数。上游要求的等待时间会被保留；超过当前请求重试预算时，返回错误及 `Retry-After`，不会缩短时间后提前重试。限制保存在实例内存中，不在多个进程之间共享。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2596":{"id":"/docs/config-network-134","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#渠道并发与等待","content":"OpenCode 免费额度和 Cline 每日模型额度按账号与模型暂缓；Zcode 并发限制和 Qoder 排队不会使凭据失效。账号级额度错误仍暂停整个账号。额度耗尽但未给出恢复时间时，保守等待一小时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2597":{"id":"/docs/config-network-135","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"同一网关中，普通对话、原生 Messages 和可用性探测共享渠道的并发容量；探测也共享账号冷却状态。修改渠道配置会保留正在使用的名额，降低上限后等待现有请求释放。原生 Messages 请求在排队时取消，不会再向上游发请求。账号或凭据配置改变时，清除该渠道的账号级临时等待，保留供应商与模型的等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2598":{"id":"/docs/config-network-136","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"冷却可作用于供应商、账号、模型或账号与模型组合。取得名额后还会检查额度状态。原生 Messages 在 HTTP 200 响应或 SSE 中返回业务错误时，保持原始响应内容，同时记录额度或频率限制，约束后续请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2599":{"id":"/docs/config-network-137","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"提供商","locale":"zh-CN"},"2600":{"id":"/docs/config-network-138","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2601":{"id":"/docs/config-network-139","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"MiniMax Agent / API","locale":"zh-CN"},"2602":{"id":"/docs/config-network-140","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"`1002`、`1039`、`1041` 等按短期限流处理；`1008`、`2056` 等按账号额度处理；`1004`、`2049` 走凭据处理。支持 `base_resp.status_code`，未知非零值返回错误","locale":"zh-CN"},"2603":{"id":"/docs/config-network-141","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"智谱 / Z.AI","locale":"zh-CN"},"2604":{"id":"/docs/config-network-142","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"区分 `1302` / `1305` 限流、`1113` / `1308` / `1310` 等额度、`1003` 凭据过期、`1261` 上下文过长；套餐权限和公平使用限制不自动重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"2605":{"id":"/docs/config-network-143","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"TRAE","locale":"zh-CN"},"2606":{"id":"/docs/config-network-144","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"`4008` 积分耗尽；`1005` 与 plan 文案表示套餐额度；`4011` 表示频率限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"2607":{"id":"/docs/config-network-145","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"LobsterAI / Loomy / Raccoon","locale":"zh-CN"},"2608":{"id":"/docs/config-network-146","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"识别积分、余额不足及 `402` 业务码；LobsterAI 的 `40100` / `40101` 进入凭据处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"2609":{"id":"/docs/config-network-147","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"ZCode","locale":"zh-CN"},"2610":{"id":"/docs/config-network-148","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"`1002` 凭据失效；`3007` 验证失败、`3012` 风控拒绝直接返回，不自动重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"2611":{"id":"/docs/config-network-149","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"Qoder","locale":"zh-CN"},"2612":{"id":"/docs/config-network-150","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"`105` 认证失败，`110` 额度不足；排队的响应头与响应体都给出等待时间时采用较长值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2613":{"id":"/docs/config-network-151","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"其他兼容提供商的 `rate_limit_error`、`insufficient_quota`、`overloaded_error` 等标准错误类型也进入公共恢复逻辑。没有业务码的 HTTP 429 按短期限流处理；明确指出额度耗尽时才采用额度冷却。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2614":{"id":"/docs/config-network-152","page_id":"/docs/config-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-network#共享范围与业务码","content":"业务码依据 MiniMax 官方错误表、Z.AI 官方错误表和仓库中的 dsh-our-free-model 参考实现。这里描述的是本地分类与恢复策略，不代表已验证每个上游的实际可用性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2615":{"id":"/docs/config-paths","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"page","content":"数据目录与迁移","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","配置"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths","locale":"zh-CN"},"2616":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-0","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths","content":"Hoshimi 把配置、数据库和其他文件放在哪里，每个文件存什么、保留多久，日志去了哪里，以及如何备份、重置和从旧版本迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2617":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-1","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#数据目录在哪里","content":"数据目录在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"2618":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-2","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#目录里有什么","content":"目录里有什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"2619":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-3","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#数据库-hoshimidb","content":"数据库 hoshimi.db","locale":"zh-CN"},"2620":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-4","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#数据库结构的升级","content":"数据库结构的升级","locale":"zh-CN"},"2621":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-5","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#日志","content":"日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"2622":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-6","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#从旧版本迁移","content":"从旧版本迁移","locale":"zh-CN"},"2623":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-7","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#移动配置文件","content":"移动配置文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"2624":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-8","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#让旧的-json-记录自动导入","content":"让旧的 JSON 记录自动导入","locale":"zh-CN"},"2625":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-9","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#确认","content":"确认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2626":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-10","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"备份与重置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2627":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-11","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths","content":"Hoshimi 的所有状态都在一个数据目录里：配置文件、记录用量和对话的数据库，以及少数几个给人或其他程序读的文件。搬家、备份或重置时只需要处理这一个文件夹。","locale":