的忙等待，所以服务器运行时，命令行也可以同时读写同一个文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2683":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-67","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#数据库结构的升级","content":"数据库结构按编号依次升级，版本号记在 SQLite 的 `user_version` 中。新版本的 Hoshimi 第一次打开旧数据库时自动完成升级，不需要手动操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2684":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-68","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#数据库结构的升级","content":"如果数据库是被更新版本的 Hoshimi 用过的，旧版本启动时会警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2685":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-69","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#数据库结构的升级","content":"此时旧版本仍可运行，但部分记录可能显示不正确。降级前先备份数据目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2686":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-70","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#日志","content":"Hoshimi 不写日志文件，所有日志都输出到标准错误（stderr）。服务器开始监听后，标准输出会打印一行 `SERVER_READY url=http://…`，方便脚本获取实际地址。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2687":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-71","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#日志","content":"作为系统服务运行时，日志由服务管理器收集（如 `journalctl`），见安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2688":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-72","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#移动配置文件","content":"旧版本的 `--config` 参数和 `HOSHIMI_CONFIG` 环境变量已经移除，当前工作目录下的 `config.json` 既不会被读取，也不会被自动迁移。升级后先运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2689":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-73","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#移动配置文件","content":"在启动新版本之前，把旧的配置文件移动到它打印的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2690":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-74","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#让旧的-json-记录自动导入","content":"更早的版本把用量、签到和探测结果分别存在 `stats.json`、`checkin.json` 和 `probe.json` 中。升级后第一次启动时，这三个文件会被导入 `hoshimi.db`，然后改名为 `*.migrated`。无法读取的文件改名为 `*.corrupt`，对应的记录从空开始。数据库里已经有这类记录时不会再次导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2691":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-75","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#确认","content":"检查配置能否读取，并列出将要启用的渠道和账号数量。确认无误后可以删除 `*.migrated` 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2692":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-76","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"要做的事","locale":"zh-CN"},"2693":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-77","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"2694":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-78","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"完整备份","locale":"zh-CN"},"2695":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-79","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"停止服务器，复制整个数据目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2696":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-80","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"搬到另一台机器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2697":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-81","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"复制数据目录，在新机器上用 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 指向它（或放到默认位置）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2698":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-82","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"只清空用量统计","locale":"zh-CN"},"2699":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-83","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"网页 **用量** 页的 **重置统计**，或 `DELETE /api/v1/stats`。不可撤销","locale":"zh-CN"},"2700":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-84","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"丢弃所有记录","locale":"zh-CN"},"2701":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-85","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"停止服务器，删除 `hoshimi.db`（以及同名的 `-wal`、`-shm` 文件）。配置和账号不受影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"2702":{"id":"/docs/config-paths-86","page_id":"/docs/config-paths","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/config-paths#备份与重置","content":"丢弃缓存的模型目录","local