ent-architecture#services","content":"直接构造的 `Services`（测试、嵌入）只需要 `settings` 和 `registry`，其余存储默认把数据放在内存里，定时器类服务为 `None`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3176":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-82","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"在 Web UI 保存设置会调用 `Services.apply_settings(new)`，不需要重启：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3177":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-83","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"只有**构建渠道池的输入**（每个渠道的账号、选项和禁用状态）变化时才重建池；只改端口之类的设置不会重建。重建时，配置没有变化的渠道原样保留，所以它们在内存里的状态（哪个账号的刷新令牌被拒绝、哪个账号正在冷却）不会丢；只有网络选项变化的渠道也保留，只更新路由。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3178":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-84","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"持有设置对象的每个服务（续期、签到、登录、更新检查、网络客户端）都改为指向新设置，免得某个服务稍后把旧配置写回文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3179":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-85","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"`server.check_updates` 的开关立即启停更新检查的定时器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3180":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-86","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#运行中更新配置","content":"`Services.close()` 依次停止各个定时器、关闭 Playground 的后台命令和渠道的 HTTP 客户端，写入最后一批用量记录，然后关闭数据库。重复调用是安全的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3181":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-87","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"`hoshimi/api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, ...)` 构建 FastAPI 应用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3182":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-88","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#应用工厂","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"3183":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-89","page_id":"/docs/devel