iders","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#归一化分片协议","content":"只要已经产出过分片，渠道池就不再换账号重试，否则客户端会收到重复的内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3405":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-136","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#归一化分片协议","content":"OpenAI 兼容的站点不必自己解析流：`providers/openai_compat.py` 的 `consume_openai_sse(lines, provider=...)` 把 OpenAI 风格的 SSE 转成上面的分片；`read_body` 还能处理对流式请求返回整个 JSON 的上游。其他协议的转换在 `core/translate/`（`anthropic.py`、`gemini.py`、`solo.py`、`responses.py`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3406":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-137","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"适配器用 `ProviderError` 的子类报告上游的拒绝，渠道池按类型决定下一步：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3407":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-138","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"异常","locale":"zh-CN"},"3408":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-139","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3409":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-140","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"渠道池怎么做","locale":"zh-CN"},"3410":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-141","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`AuthFailed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3411":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-142","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`auth_failed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3412":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-143","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"先续期这个账号（每轮一次），成功就重试它，否则换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3413":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-144","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`RefreshTokenRejected`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3414":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-145","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`refresh_token_rejected`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3415":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-146","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"刷新令牌已失效：账号标记为需要重新登录，不再参与轮换","locale":"zh-CN"},"3416":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-147","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`QuotaExceeded`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3417":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-148","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`quota_exceeded`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3418":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-149","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"账号冷却：时长取 `Retry-After` 头，其次是错误正文里的重置时间，都没有时用 `quota_hold_seconds`；换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3419":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-150","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`PolicyBlocked`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3420":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-151","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`policy_blocked`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3421":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-152","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"账号冷却 `policy_block_seconds`，不续期；换下一个账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3422":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-153","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`ModelSaturated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3423":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-154","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`model_saturated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3424":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-155","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"模型本身过载，对每个账号都一样：立即停止，把站点的原话交给调用方","locale":"zh-CN"},"3425":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-156","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`ModelGone`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3426":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-157","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`model_gone`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3427":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-158","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"继续问其他账号；所有账号都这么说时，注册表把这个模型记为失效","locale":"zh-CN"},"3428":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-159","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"其他 `ProviderError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3429":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-160","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`upstream_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3430":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-161","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"状态码可恢复时换账号，否则（调用方自己请求的问题）立即停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"3431":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-162","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"所有账号都试过、而最后一个错误是“过一会儿可能就好”的那种时，渠道池最多再做 `backoff_retries` 轮：等待上游给出的时间（最多 `backoff_max_seconds`），没有给出时随机等待（full jitter）。一旦已经产出过内容，就不再重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-163","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`openai_compat.py` 的 `raise_for_status(response, provider=...)` 按固定顺序把一个 HTTP 回答归类：先看是否是“模型不存在”（404/410 等），再依次判断模型过载、安全拦截、401/403 认证失败、403 权限不足、额度（402/429 或正文里的额度字样）。顺序很重要：过载的模型常以普通的 429 出现，安全拦截常以普通的 403 出现，只看状态码就会把它们误判为额度用尽或凭据错误。流中以 200 返回的错误帧，只有“模型不存在”“过载”“拦截”“额度”几类会变成异常，其余作为 `error` 分片交给调用方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-164","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"失效模型记录（`failure.py` 的 `DeadModelStore`）只在内存中：一次记录在 10 分钟后被遗忘；同一窗口内被记三次，记录就不再随时间解除。这个模型再次成功产出第一个分片时，记录被清除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-165","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#错误与账号轮换","content":"`stream_using` 的 `on_route(provider_id, account_id, attempt)` 回调在某个账号产出第一个分片时触发，用量统计据此记录真正回答的账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-166","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`Provider.models()` 管理目录缓存，适配器只实现 `fetch_models()`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-167","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"成功的目录缓存 300 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-168","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"取目录失败时保留上一次的结果，30 秒后再试；从来没有成功过时使用 `fallback_models()`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3438":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-169","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"新目录不到上一次的一半时，视为不完整的回答，保留旧目录一个周期；下一个周期还是这样，才接受它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3439":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-170","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`fetch_models()` 成功取到目录时设置 `catalog_authoritative = True`（`OpenAiCompatProvider` 已经这样做），这样站点返回的空目录被当作真实答案，而不是回退到固定列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3440":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-171","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`specs()` 返回每个模型的 `ModelSpec`（`hoshimi/core/catalog.py`），它是推理强度策略和 `GET /api/v1/models` 读取的东西：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3441":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-172","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3442":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-173","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3443":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-174","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`wire`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-175","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"发给上游时用的协议：`chat`、`messages`、`responses` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-176","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`vision`、`reasoning`、`tools`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-177","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"是否接受图片、是否会思考、是否支持工具（`tools` 为 `None` 表示未知）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-178","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`context_window`、`max_output`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3448":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-179","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"上下文与输出上限，未知时为 131072 与 32768","locale":"zh-CN"},"3449":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-180","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`free`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3450":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-181","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"调用是否免费；三态，`None` 表示站点没有说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3451":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-182","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`efforts`、`effort_default`、`effort_off_id`、`effort_patch`、`effort_off_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3452":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-183","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"模型自己的推理强度选项及其在线路上的写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3453":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-184","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"`can_disable_thinking`、`region_sensitive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3454":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-185","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"能否关闭思考、是否与地区有关","locale":"zh-CN"},"3455":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-186","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#模型目录与能力","content":"各站点的能力表放在 `catalog.py`（`zhipu_spec`、`kilo_spec`、`cline_spec` 等）。默认的 `specs()` 给每个模型一个惰性的规格（不推理，所以推理强度策略不改动请求体），再从 models.dev 补充“是否推理”和“是否接受图片”这两项；能力表已经写明的不会被覆盖。推理强度的行为见模型行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3456":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-187","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写一个专用适配器","content":"以智谱 GLM 渠道（`providers/zhipu.py`）为例，它是一个 OpenAI 兼容站点：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3457":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-188","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写适配器类","content":"OpenAI 兼容的站点继承 `OpenAiCompatProvider`，只声明地址、目录路径和固定列表，并按需覆盖请求头、请求体或目录解析：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3458":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-189","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写适配器类","content":"`OpenAiCompatProvider.stream_raw` 已经完成了其余的事：构造请求体（`build_body`，强制 `stream: true`）、记录上游的额度响应头、对错误调用 `raise_for_status`、用 `consume_openai_sse` 转换流。协议不是 OpenAI 的站点直接继承 `Provider`，自己实现 `stream_raw`，借助 `core/translate/` 里的转换函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3459":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-190","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册","content":"在 `providers/factory.py` 中把类加入 `PROVIDER_CLASSES`，并把 ID 放进 `PROVIDER_ORDER` 的合适位置。这个顺序决定不带前缀的模型名先在哪个渠道里查找，也是匿名渠道的启动顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3460":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-191","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写能力表","content":"在 `catalog.py` 中为这个站点写一个 `<id>_spec(model_id, provider)`，填入上下文、图片、思考和推理强度选项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3461":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-192","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#描述账号表单","content":"在 `core/provider_forms.py` 的 `credential_forms()` 中说明添加账号时要填哪些字段（例如 `zhipu` 只需 `api_key`）。Web UI 的 **添加账号** 对话框和管理 API 都读取它；只列出适配器真正接受的字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3462":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-193","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写测试","content":"用 `httpx.MockTransport` 代替上游，检查请求发到了哪里、带了什么，以及产出的分片：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3463":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-194","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#写测试","content":"测试的布局与共享夹具见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3464":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-195","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#更新文档","content":"在免费站点或对应的渠道页面写明怎样登录、提供什么、有哪些限制，中英文都要写；渠道来自某个参考项目时，在 `core/provider_sources.py` 记录它，再运行 `python scripts/generate_provider_inventory.py` 重新生成渠道来源清单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3465":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-196","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"只需 API 密钥、协议常规的服务不必写类：在 `core/provider_definitions.py` 的 `CANONICAL_PROVIDERS` 中加一行即可，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3466":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-197","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3467":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-198","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3468":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-199","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`id`、`name`、`base_url`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3469":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-200","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"渠道 ID、显示名称、API 根地址","locale":"zh-CN"},"3470":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-201","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`protocol`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3471":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-202","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`chat`、`messages`、`responses`、`multi`（按模型选择）等","locale":"zh-CN"},"3472":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-203","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`auth`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3473":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-204","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"支持的认证方式，如 `(\"api_key\",)`、`(\"api_key\", \"oauth\")`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3474":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-205","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`plan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3475":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-206","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"套餐，用来区分同一地址上的不同服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3476":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-207","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`catalog`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3477":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-208","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"目录路径（以 `/` 开头且不含空格时直接用作 `models_path`），或对目录来源的说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3478":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-209","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`adapter`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3479":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-210","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`configured`（自动生成类）、`dedicated`（有专用适配器）、`local`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3480":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-211","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`implemented`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3481":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-212","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"是否已经实现；未实现的不会注册","locale":"zh-CN"},"3482":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-213","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`key_env`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3483":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-214","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"参考项目读取密钥的环境变量名，仅作记录，Hoshimi 不读取它","locale":"zh-CN"},"3484":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-215","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#添加一个按数据定义的服务","content":"`configured` 的服务由 `regular_provider_classes()` 生成一个 `ConfiguredProvider` 子类；`provider_forms.py` 自动为支持 `api_key` 的服务提供“API 密钥 + 地址 + 模型”的表单。目录接口特殊的服务在 `providers/catalog_profiles.py` 描述，请求体需要调整的在 `providers/request_profiles.py` 描述。`tests/core/test_provider_definitions.py` 检查同一品牌的不同服务不会因为名字或地址相同而合并。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3485":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-216","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#交互式登录","content":"需要浏览器登录或设备码的站点，在 `core/login/` 里写一个登录流程。命令行的 `hoshimi login <id>` 和 Web UI 的登录对话框共用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3486":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-217","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"流程拿到一个 HTTP 客户端和一个报告函数 `report`。站点一给出浏览器地址，流程就必须调用 `report(url)`：命令行打印它并打开浏览器，API 把它交给 Web UI，两者都不必知道站点用的是设备码、外部登录链接还是本地回调端口。然后流程阻塞，直到凭据就绪，返回渠道认识的账号字典；失败时抛出 `LoginError`，消息会直接显示给用户。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3487":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-218","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report` 是一个 `LoginReporter`，还提供：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3488":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-219","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3489":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-220","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3490":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-221","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.device_code(url, code, expires_in)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3491":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-222","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"设备码流程：报告地址、用户要输入的代码和有效期","locale":"zh-CN"},"3492":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-223","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.authorization(server, timeout)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3493":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-224","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"等待本地回调，同时允许用户粘贴最终的回调 URL 或授权码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3494":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-225","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.wait(seconds)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3495":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-226","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"轮询间隔；登录被取消时抛出 `LoginError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3496":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-227","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.check_cancelled()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3497":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-228","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"检查是否已取消","locale":"zh-CN"},"3498":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-229","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`report.on_commit(action)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3499":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-230","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"把流程自己的本地写入推迟到登录确认成功之后","locale":"zh-CN"},"3500":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-231","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#契约","content":"`LOGIN_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` 是 600 秒；管理器给整个流程多留 60 秒，让流程自己的超时先触发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3501":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-232","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#例子kilo-的设备码登录","content":"（节选，见 `hoshimi/core/login/kilo.py`。）Kilo 返回的是长期有效的密钥，所以流程不编造 `refresh_token` 或 `expires_at`，免得为它安排根本不存在的续期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3502":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-233","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"在 `core/login/manager.py` 的 `_flows()` 中加入 `\"<id>\": start_<id>_login`（流程在这里惰性导入，一个站点的问题不会影响启动）。`LoginManager` 负责其余的事：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-234","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"每次登录是一个会话（`pending`、`succeeded`、`failed`），在后台线程中运行，开始一小时后被清理；会话可以取消，等待授权码的会话可以提交授权码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-235","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"成功后，凭据写入 `config.json` 中该渠道的 `accounts`，并启用这个渠道。凭据里带有稳定身份（`user_id`、`account_id`、`userid`、`uid`、`sub`、`access_key_id`、`api_key`、`access_token` 中的第一个）时，同一身份再次登录会替换原账号，而不是新增一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3505":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-236","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"写入之后渠道池立即按新配置重建，新账号马上可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/development-providers-237","page_id":"/docs/development-providers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-providers#注册与写回","content":"需要续期的凭据，在适配器中实现 `refresh_account`。`refresh.py` 的定时器每 30 分钟检查一次所有账号，在记录的过期时间前一小时内（没有记录过期时间的账号每次都）续期，并只把变化的那个账号写回 `config.json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3507":{"id":"/docs/development-release","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"page","content":"CI 与发布","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release","locale":"zh-CN"},"3508":{"id":"/docs/development-release-0","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release","content":"版本号放在哪里、wheel 怎样带上 Web UI 构建并检查、CI 的四个工作流各做什么、一次推送怎样把新版本发布到 PyPI 和 GitHub，以及文档站怎样部署。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3509":{"id":"/docs/development-release-1","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#版本号","content":"版本号","locale":"zh-CN"},"3510":{"id":"/docs/development-release-2","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#构建发行包scriptsbuild_wheelpy","content":"构建发行包：`scripts/build_wheel.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3511":{"id":"/docs/development-release-3","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#检查安装后的发行包scriptssmoke_installpy","content":"检查安装后的发行包：`scripts/smoke_install.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3512":{"id":"/docs/development-release-4","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#ci-工作流","content":"CI 工作流","locale":"zh-CN"},"3513":{"id":"/docs/development-release-5","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#ciyml","content":"`ci.yml`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3514":{"id":"/docs/development-release-6","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#发布计划scriptscipy","content":"发布计划：`scripts/ci.py`","locale