pment-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"中文和英文的侧边栏：页面顺序与分组","locale":"zh-CN"},"3749":{"id":"/docs/development-site-26","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/src/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3750":{"id":"/docs/development-site-27","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"路由、布局、首页和组件；可用的 MDX 组件在 `src/components/mdx.tsx` 中注册","locale":"zh-CN"},"3751":{"id":"/docs/development-site-28","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/scripts/prepare-static-output.mjs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3752":{"id":"/docs/development-site-29","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"构建后检查输出是否完整","locale":"zh-CN"},"3753":{"id":"/docs/development-site-30","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"`site/public/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3754":{"id":"/docs/development-site-31","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"原样复制到输出的静态文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3755":{"id":"/docs/development-site-32","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#结构","content":"两种语言共用同一个地址 `/docs/<slug>`：站点按读者选过的语言（保存在浏览器中）显示对应版本，没有选过时，浏览器首选语言是中文就显示中文，否则显示英文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3756":{"id":"/docs/development-site-33","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#本地预览与构建","content":"开发服务器固定在 `http://127.0.0.1:3000`，端口被占用时直接失败，而不是换一个端口。构建产出 `site/.output/public`；构建脚本随后运行 `prepare-static-output.mjs`，确认 `meta.json` 中列出的每个页面都生成了 HTML，并把 `_shell.html` 复制为 `404.html`。所以侧边栏里有、但没有对应文件的页面会让构建失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3757":{"id":"/docs/development-site-34","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#建两个文件","content":"在 `site/content/docs/` 中新建 `<slug>.mdx`（中文）和 `<slug>.en.mdx`（英文）。slug 用小写和连字符，按所属部分加前缀（`guide-`、`clients-`、`providers-`、`cli-`、`config-`、`advanced-`、`api-`、`development-`）。两个文件的结构要相同：同样的章节、同样的顺序、同样的代码块和链接。中文写自然的简体中文，不是逐字翻译；英文写平实直接的英文。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3758":{"id":"/docs/development-site-35","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3759":{"id":"/docs/development-site-36","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3760":{"id":"/docs/development-site-37","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"`title`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3761":{"id":"/docs/development-site-38","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"页面标题；正文里不要再写一个 `#` 标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"3762":{"id":"/docs/development-site-39","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"`description`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3763":{"id":"/docs/development-site-40","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"显示在标题下方，也用于搜索和页面元数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"3764":{"id":"/docs/development-site-41","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"`icon`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3765":{"id":"/docs/development-site-42","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"Lucide 图标名，PascalCase（如 `Rocket`、`Terminal`、`Settings`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3766":{"id":"/docs/development-site-43","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#写-frontmatter","content":"正文以一段简短的引言开始，然后是 `##` 章节。","locale":"