` 没有改动时跳过","locale":"zh-CN"},"3816":{"id":"/docs/development-site-93","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"备份","locale":"zh-CN"},"3817":{"id":"/docs/development-site-94","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"licyk.github.io/Hoshimi","locale":"zh-CN"},"3818":{"id":"/docs/development-site-95","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"`.github/workflows/site.yml` 以 `VITE_BASE_PATH=/Hoshimi/` 构建，并（用 `GITEE_RSA_PRIVATE_KEY` 部署密钥）强制推送到 `gh-pages` 分支，由 Pages 提供服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"3819":{"id":"/docs/development-site-96","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#部署","content":"站点支持部署在子路径下：`VITE_BASE_PATH` 设置 Vite 的 `base`，路由和搜索索引都跟随它。备份站的页面带有指向 Netlify 站点的 canonical 链接，让搜索引擎以主站为准。CI 的共享检查也会对站点做类型检查、测试和构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3820":{"id":"/docs/development-site-97","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#统计与评论","content":"**统计**：站点使用 Umami，只在生产构建中加载，并且只在两个站点域名上计数；本地预览不计数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3821":{"id":"/docs/development-site-98","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#统计与评论","content":"**评论**：每个文档页面的末尾有 Giscus 评论区（`components/docs-comments.tsx`、`lib/giscus.ts`，与 rvc-next 的站点相同），基于本仓库的 GitHub Discussions，分类为 “Comment”。每个页面对应一个讨论帖，以 `specific` 方式按页面路径对应，路径去掉站点基础路径、语言前缀和首尾斜杠（`docs/<slug>`），所以同一页面的中英文版本、主站（位于根路径）和备份站（位于 `/Hoshimi/` 下）共用同一个帖子。评论区跟随站点的明暗主题和语言，切换时直接通知已加载的评论框，而不重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3822":{"id":"/docs/development-site-99","page_id":"/docs/development-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-site#readme","content":"仓库的 `README.md` 和 `README.zh-CN.md` 也是 PyPI 上的项目说明，所以其中的链接都写成完整的 URL（指向本站或 GitHub），而不是仓库内的相对路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3823":{"id":"/docs/development-testing","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type"