id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"界面布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"4155":{"id":"/docs/first-run-3","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"登录（设置了工具访问密钥时）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4156":{"id":"/docs/first-run-4","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#默认的两个匿名渠道","content":"默认的两个匿名渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4157":{"id":"/docs/first-run-5","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#各个页面","content":"各个页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"4158":{"id":"/docs/first-run-6","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#东西在哪里","content":"东西在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"4159":{"id":"/docs/first-run-7","page_id":"/docs/first-run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/first-run#接下来","content":"接下来","locale":"zh-CN"},"4160":{"id":"/docs/first-run-8","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run","content":"本页带你走一遍第一次启动之后的界面。还没有安装的话，先看快速开始。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4161":{"id":"/docs/first-run-9","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**不需要配置文件。** 没有 `config.json` 时，Hoshimi 使用全部默认值：监听 `127.0.0.1:10600`，不设任何密钥，只启用两个匿名渠道。`config.json` 在你第一次保存设置、添加账户或执行 `hoshimi config set` 时才会创建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4162":{"id":"/docs/first-run-10","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**数据目录。** 服务器在数据目录里创建 `hoshimi.db`（用量、签到记录、探测结果和 Playground 对话）和 `server.json`（正在运行的服务器的地址和 PID）。数据目录的位置见数据目录，也显示在 **设置 › 关于** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4163":{"id":"/docs/first-run-11","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**后台定时任务。** 凭据续期（每 30 分钟）和每日签到随服务器启动，日志里会各有一行。还会在后台向 PyPI 查询是否有新版本。这三项都可以关闭，见配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4164":{"id":"/docs/first-run-12","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#启动时发生了什么","content":"**浏览器。** 大约一秒后浏览器打开 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`，地址随即变成 `http://127.0.0.1:10600/#/overview`。页面地址都在 `#` 之后，可以直接收藏，例如 `#/playground`、`#/settings?tab=access`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4165":{"id":"/docs/first-run-13","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4166":{"id":"/docs/first-run-14","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4167":{"id":"/docs/first-run-15","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"左侧导航栏","locale":"zh-CN"},"4168":{"id":"/docs/first-run-16","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"**概览**、**模型**、**渠道**、**用量**、**Playground**；**设置** 在导航栏底部。窗口较窄时导航栏变成底部的标签栏。有渠道需要处理时，**渠道** 上会显示数字角标","locale":"zh-CN"},"4169":{"id":"/docs/first-run-17","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"右上角","locale":"zh-CN"},"4170":{"id":"/docs/first-run-18","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"**实时活动** 按钮：显示正在进行的调用数，点开是今天的 Token、调用次数、缓存命中率，以及正在进行和刚刚完成的调用。旁边是主题按钮，在 **浅色**、**深色**、**跟随系统** 之间切换","locale":"zh-CN"},"4171":{"id":"/docs/first-run-19","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#界面布局","content":"界面语言默认跟随系统（支持英文、简体中文和日文），可以在 **设置 › 常规 › 语言** 中固定为某一种。主题、主题色、对比度和动画在 **设置 › 外观** 中调整。这些界面偏好只保存在当前浏览器里，不写入服务器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4172":{"id":"/docs/first-run-20","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"默认没有任何密钥，打开就能用。**概览** 页 **接口** 一栏底部会写着 **尚未设置工具访问密钥。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4173":{"id":"/docs/first-run-21","page_id":"/docs/first-run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/first-run#登录设置了工具访问密钥时","content":"设置了工具访问密钥（`server.access_token`）之后，浏览器第一次访问时会弹出 **请输入工具访问密钥** 对话框：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4174":{"id":"/docs/first-run-22","page_id":"/docs/fir