t","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"设置参考","locale":"zh-CN"},"4266":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent","content":"开启工具后，Playground 的回复就成了一个智能体循环：模型可以使用内置工具；每一轮它先流式输出文字，它调用的工具依次运行（需要批准的先由审查模型或你批准），结果返回给模型，如此往复，直到某一轮不再调用工具为止。回复中的每次调用都显示为一张可以展开的卡片。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4267":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent","content":"命令和文件编辑在运行 Hoshimi 的机器上执行，权限就是运行它的用户的权限，没有沙箱。所有工具默认开启，新对话从 **自动审查** 开始：每条命令、每次文件更改以及工作区外的访问在执行前都先由模型判断，有风险的会被拒绝。**先询问** 则全部交给你决定。下文的“安全”一节说明了每种模式会放行什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4268":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择工具","content":"打开 **设置 › 工具**，**工具** 中六个工具默认全部开启，关掉不需要的即可（见设置）。这就是所有对话使用的工具：对话没有自己的开关，更改从下一次回复起对所有对话生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4269":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择工具","content":"如果你的配置文件从未设置过 `playground.tools` 或 `playground.approval`，现在会得到全部工具和 **自动审查**。配置中写明 `\"tools\": []` 的则一个工具都不开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4270":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择支持工具调用的模型","content":"只有支持工具调用的模型才会收到工具。目录中标记为不支持工具调用的模型会在没有工具的情况下作答，回复中注明“*模型* 不支持调用工具，因此在没有工具的情况下作答。”如果站点在回复开始前拒绝了工具，回复也会去掉工具再试一次，并给出同样的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4271":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"开关（设置中）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4272":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"模型看到的工具名","locale":"zh-CN"},"4273":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4274":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"何时先询问（完全访问下从不询问）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4275":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**读取文件**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4276":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"`read`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4277":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"读取文本文件，或列出文件夹","locale":"zh-CN"},"4278":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"仅当路径在工作区外","locale":"zh-CN"},"4279":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**编辑文件**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4280":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"`apply_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4281":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"用补丁创建、修改、移动和删除文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4282":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**自动审查** 和 **先询问** 下总是询问；**仅在工作区外询问** 下只在涉及工作区外的文件时询问","locale":"zh-CN"},"4283":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**运行命令**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4284":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"`shell`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4285":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"运行一条命令并等待它结束","locale":"zh-CN"},"4286":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"仅在 **自动审查** 和 **先询问** 下","locale":"zh-CN"},"4287":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**后台命令**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4288":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"`exec_command`、`write_stdin`、`kill_session`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4289":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"启动持续运行的命令，读取其输出、向其输入、停止它","locale":"zh-CN"},"4290":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"启动命令或向其输入时，仅在 **自动审查** 和 **先询问** 下","locale":"zh-CN"},"4291":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**网页搜索**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4292":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"`web_search`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4293":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"用 DuckDuckGo 或你自己的 SearXNG 搜索","locale":"zh-CN"},"4294":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"从不","locale":"zh-CN"},"4295":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"**读取网页**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4296":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"`web_fetch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4297":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"以 Markdown 形式读取公开网页","locale":"zh-CN"},"4298":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"从不","locale":"zh-CN"},"4299":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#六个工具","content":"在 **自动审查** 下，需要先询问的调用交给审查模型判断，只有它无法判断时才询问你（见下文的“自动审查”）。相对路径从工作区开始解析（见下文的“工作区”）。不论工具返回什么，发给模型的最多 32,000 个字符；更长的输出会截去中间部分，保留开头和结尾。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4300":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取文件read","content":"返回带行号的文本（`L12: …`）。默认从开头读取 2000 行，模型可以指定 `offset`（从 1 开始）和 `limit`（最多 10,000）分段读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4301":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取文件read","content":"超过 500 个字符的行会被截断；一次读取最多返回 60,000 个字符，并说明从哪里继续。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4302":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取文件read","content":"路径是文件夹时返回其内容列表：文件夹在前，最多 500 项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4303":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取文件read","content":"二进制文件（开头部分含有 NUL 字节）会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4304":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#编辑文件apply_patch","content":"接受 Codex `apply_patch` 格式的补丁，在 Codex 中会用这个工具的模型在这里也会用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4305":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#编辑文件apply_patch","content":"写入任何内容之前，会先对照现有文件算出整个补丁的结果：只要有一处无法应用，就不会修改任何文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4306":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#编辑文件apply_patch","content":"文件必须是 UTF-8 文本。换行符保持原样（CRLF 文件仍是 CRLF），文件末尾总有换行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4307":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#编辑文件apply_patch","content":"结果列出新增（`A`）、修改（`M`）和删除（`D`）的文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4308":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#编辑文件apply_patch","content":"补丁涉及工作区外的文件（或把文件移到工作区外）时，需要针对工作区外文件的批准：**更改工作区外的文件？**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4309":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#运行命令shell","content":"在模型指定的 shell 中运行命令，未指定时使用默认 shell（见下文的“选择 shell”），默认在工作区中运行，模型可以用 `workdir` 指定其他目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4310":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#运行命令shell","content":"等待命令结束：默认 10 分钟；模型可以用 `timeout_ms` 要求更长或更短的时间，没有上限。超时的命令连同它启动的所有进程一起被停止，并报告超时（退出码 124）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4311":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#运行命令shell","content":"返回退出码、耗时和输出（包含标准错误）。命令没有输入（标准输入已关闭），分页器和颜色都已关闭（`PAGER=cat`、`NO_COLOR=1`、`TERM=dumb`、`GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4312":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#运行命令shell","content":"对于持续运行或需要输入的命令，模型会被告知改用后台命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4313":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#后台命令exec_commandwrite_stdinkill_session","content":"`exec_command` 启动命令并等待一会儿（默认 10 秒，范围 0.25–30 秒；Windows 上至少 10 秒）。如果命令已结束，返回退出码和输出；否则命令作为一个*会话*继续运行，并返回目前为止的输出和会话 ID。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4314":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#后台命令exec_commandwrite_stdinkill_session","content":"`write_stdin` 向会话输入内容（用 `\\n` 表示回车），并返回新的输出，写入后默认等待 0.25 秒（最长 30 秒）；不输入任何内容时只等待新输出（从默认的 5 秒到最长 5 分钟）。会话本身没有时间限制：它一直运行到结束或被停止。它会说明命令是否仍在运行，或给出退出码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4315":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#后台命令exec_commandwrite_stdinkill_session","content":"`kill_session` 停止会话及其启动的所有进程，并返回最后的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4316":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#后台命令exec_commandwrite_stdinkill_session","content":"每个会话最多保留 1,000,000 个字符的未读输出（超出部分丢弃中间）；颜色控制码会被去掉。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4317":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#后台命令exec_commandwrite_stdinkill_session","content":"整个服务端同时最多运行 16 个后台命令。会话属于启动它的对话，该对话被删除或服务停止时会随之停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4318":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#后台命令exec_commandwrite_stdinkill_session","content":"`exec_command` 和 `shell` 一样会先询问。`write_stdin` 输入内容时也会询问（**运行此命令？**），因为向 shell 输入就是在运行命令；只读取输出时从不询问。`kill_session` 从不询问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4319":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"`shell` 和 `exec_command` 有一个可选参数 `shell`：`bash`、`zsh`、`sh`、`powershell`（优先使用 PowerShell 7 的 `pwsh`，其次是 Windows PowerShell；也接受 `pwsh` 这个名称）或 `cmd`，可以写名称，也可以写路径（如 `/usr/bin/zsh`）。未知或未安装的 shell 会报错，模型会读到错误和本机已安装的 shell 列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4320":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"Shell","locale":"zh-CN"},"4321":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"命令的运行方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"4322":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"bash、zsh、sh","locale":"zh-CN"},"4323":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"`<shell> -c <命令>`，从不作为登录 shell","locale":"zh-CN"},"4324":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"PowerShell","locale":"zh-CN"},"4325":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"`-NoLogo -NoProfile -NonInteractive -Command <命令>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4326":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"cmd","locale":"zh-CN"},"4327":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"`/d /s /c <命令>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4328":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#选择-shell","content":"调用未指定 shell 时，命令在 **设置 › 工具 › 工具如何运行 › Shell**（`playground.shell`）中选择的 shell 中运行。默认的 **自动** 使用 bash，没有 bash 时用 `sh`；Windows 上使用 PowerShell，没有时用 cmd。该选项会显示当前实际使用的 shell（“当前为 bash”）。菜单只列出本机已安装的 shell；所选 shell 未安装时按自动处理。工具说明会告诉模型默认的 shell 和已安装的 shell，命令的结果也会注明它在哪个 shell 中运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4329":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#非-utf-8-的输出","content":"Hoshimi 按 UTF-8 读取命令的输出。其他编码的输出不会让命令或回复中断：每个不是 UTF-8 的字节会变成 `�`（U+FFFD）。但 Hoshimi 不会让命令改用 UTF-8 输出，命令使用的是启动 Hoshimi 的终端的编码。终端不是 UTF-8 时（最常见的是中文、日文或韩文的 Windows，控制台使用 GBK（936）这样的代码页），中文文件名、`dir` 列表和错误信息到模型那里都会变成 `����`；`write_stdin` 输入的内容（始终是 UTF-8）也会被同样误读。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4330":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#非-utf-8-的输出","content":"解决方法：先把终端切换为 UTF-8，再在同一个终端里启动 Hoshimi，它运行的命令会继承这一设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4331":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#非-utf-8-的输出","content":"这只对当前终端窗口有效。要长期生效，或者 Hoshimi 不是从终端启动的（快捷方式、计划任务、系统服务），请在系统层面设置：Windows 上打开 **设置 › 时间和语言 › 语言和区域 › 管理语言设置 › 更改系统区域设置…**，勾选 **Beta 版：使用 Unicode UTF-8 提供全球语言支持** 并重启；Linux 和 macOS 上把 `export` 这几行写进 shell 的配置文件，或在 systemd 单元中写 `Environment=LANG=C.UTF-8`。不管终端设置、自行选择编码的程序仍会按它自己的编码输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4332":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#网页搜索web_search","content":"使用 DuckDuckGo 的轻量页面（无需密钥），或使用 **SearXNG 地址**（`playground.search_url`）中设置的 SearXNG 实例，该实例需要开启 JSON 格式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4333":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#网页搜索web_search","content":"默认返回 8 条结果（最多 20 条），每条包括标题、地址和摘要。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4334":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#网页搜索web_search","content":"DuckDuckGo 会限制请求频率；不再响应时稍等片刻，或改用 SearXNG。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4335":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取网页web_fetch","content":"读取公开的 `http://` 或 `https://` 地址（未写协议时补上 `https://`），返回最终地址、标题和内容。HTML 会转换为 Markdown，保留标题、段落、链接、列表、代码和表格，去掉脚本、样式、导航和表单，并优先取页面的主要内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4336":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取网页web_fetch","content":"只读取文本（HTML、纯文本、JSON、XML、RSS 等）；最多下载 5 MB，返回 60,000 个字符。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4337":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取网页web_fetch","content":"本地和私有地址会被拒绝：`localhost`、以 `.localhost`、`.local` 或 `.internal` 结尾的名称，以及解析到回环、私有、链路本地、保留或多播地址的任何名称。每次重定向（最多 5 次）都会重新检查。包含用户名或密码的地址也会被拒绝。这样模型就读不到保存着你账号凭据的网关本身，也读不到你网络中的其他设备。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4338":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#读取网页web_fetch","content":"两个网页工具都按网关的网络设置（包括代理）访问外网（见网络）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4339":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"审批模式决定哪些调用需要批准，以及由谁批准：审查模型或你。新对话按 **设置 › 工具 › 工具如何运行 › 工具何时先询问** 开始；每个对话可以单独选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4340":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"模式（`playground.approval`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4341":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"简称","locale":"zh-CN"},"4342":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"在以下操作前询问","locale":"zh-CN"},"4343":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**自动审查**（`review`，默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4344":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**自动审查**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4345":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**先询问** 下会询问的调用交给审查模型允许或拒绝；只有它无法判断时才询问你","locale":"zh-CN"},"4346":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**先询问**（`ask`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4347":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**询问**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4348":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"每条命令（`shell`、`exec_command`，以及输入内容的 `write_stdin`）、每次文件更改，以及读取工作区外的任何内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4349":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**仅在工作区外询问**（`workspace`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4350":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**工作区**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4351":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"只在读取或更改工作区外的文件时询问；工作区内的命令和更改直接运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4352":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**完全访问**（`full`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4353":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"**完全访问**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4354":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"从不询问，工具按模型的调用执行一切操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"4355":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具何时先询问","content":"搜索和读取网页从不询问，读取工作区内的文件也不询问。配置文件和 API 仍接受 `workspace` 的旧名称 `auto`；以它保存的对话会改为 `workspace`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4356":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#输入框中的盾牌菜单","content":"无论是否开启了工具，输入框中都始终显示一个盾牌。它显示该对话的模式（**自动审查** 为带对勾的盾牌，**询问** 为带人像的盾牌，**工作区** 为半个盾牌，**完全访问** 为红色的划掉的盾牌），点开 **工具何时先询问** 可以只为这个对话更改模式。回复进行中也可以更改：新模式从下一次工具调用起生效。新对话会重新按设置开始。在手机上，盾牌只显示图标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4357":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"在 **自动审查** 下，**先询问** 中会询问的调用改为交给模型判断，而不是询问你：每条 `shell` 和 `exec_command`、输入内容的 `write_stdin`、每次 `apply_patch`，以及工作区外的 `read`。审查模型在 **设置 › 工具 › 工具如何运行 › 审查模型**（`playground.review_model`）中设置；默认留空，即 **对话自身使用的模型**。建议选择快速而谨慎的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4358":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"审查模型会收到：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4359":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"一份固定的审查规则，改编自 OpenAI Codex 的自动审查（“guardian”）。规则告诉它这里没有沙箱。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4360":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"到目前为止的对话记录。只有你的消息算作可信；助手的文字、它的工具调用及其输出都不可信，所以文件或网页中埋下的指令无法授权任何操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4361":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"以 JSON 表示的待执行调用：工具、参数、它需要什么批准、是否涉及工作区外、工作区，以及命令所用的 shell。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4362":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"审查模型自己不能运行任何东西。它的回答包括风险等级（low、medium、high 或 critical）、你授权这次调用的明确程度（unknown、low、medium 或 high）、结论和一句理由：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4363":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"风险","locale":"zh-CN"},"4364":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"结论","locale":"zh-CN"},"4365":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"低、中","locale":"zh-CN"},"4366":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"允许","locale":"zh-CN"},"4367":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"高","locale":"zh-CN"},"4368":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"只有在你明确要求（授权至少为 medium）且范围很窄时才允许","locale":"zh-CN"},"4369":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"严重","locale":"zh-CN"},"4370":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"4371":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"高风险和严重风险的操作包括：删除无法恢复的数据、强制推送共享分支、把密钥或隐私数据发到不可信的地方、从不寻常的位置读取凭据、长期削弱安全设置等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4372":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"**允许**：调用照常运行。展开卡片会显示“*模型* 已允许”，并附上风险和理由（如有）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4373":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"**拒绝**：卡片显示 **审查已拒绝**，展开后显示“*模型* 已拒绝 · 高风险 — *理由*”。模型会被告知理由，并被告知不要绕过它：不能换个办法、间接执行或改用其他工具达到同样目的；只有找到明显更安全的替代做法，或你在了解风险后明确批准，才能继续；否则它会停下来询问你。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4374":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"**无法判断**：一次审查最多 90 秒。如果审查失败（站点出错、太慢，或回答不是一个结论），调用不会被拒绝，而是像 **先询问** 一样停在 **等待批准** 等你决定，卡片上注明“自动审查无法判断，因此询问你 — *原因*”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4375":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"审查进行中，卡片显示 **审查中…**，回复底部一行显示 **正在审查 *工具*…**。审查时间计入回复自己的用时；等你批准的时间则不计入“用时”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4376":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"如果审查模型连续拒绝 3 次调用，或在一条回复中共拒绝 10 次，回复会被停止：这一轮剩下的调用标记为 **已停止**，回复以“自动审查拒绝了此回复的 *n* 次调用，因此已停止。请说明如何继续，或换一种批准模式。”结束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4377":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#自动审查","content":"你之前在对话中给出的 **始终允许** 仍然有效：它涵盖的调用直接运行，不询问任何人，也不经过审查模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4378":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"需要询问你的调用会停在 **等待批准** 状态并自动展开，显示它将要做什么（命令，或以 diff 列出补丁改动的每个文件）以及一个问题：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4379":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"4380":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"对应的调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4381":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"**运行此命令？**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4382":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"`shell`、`exec_command`，或向会话输入内容的 `write_stdin`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4383":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"**应用这些更改？**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4384":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"工作区内的补丁","locale":"zh-CN"},"4385":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"**更改工作区外的文件？**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4386":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"涉及工作区外文件的补丁","locale":"zh-CN"},"4387":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"**读取工作区外的此文件？**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4388":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"读取工作区外的 `read`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4389":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"可以选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4390":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"**允许**：运行这一次调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4391":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"**始终允许**：运行这次调用，并且在此对话中运行同类调用时不再询问。“同类”指同一个工具开关，且工作区内和工作区外分开计算：始终允许工作区内的编辑，并不允许工作区外的编辑。这一许可持续到服务重启，删除对话时也会被清除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4392":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"**拒绝**：跳过这次调用。模型会被告知你拒绝了它，除非你要求否则不要再试；卡片显示 **已拒绝**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4393":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#批准调用","content":"调用最多等待 10 分钟，没有答复视为拒绝。停止回复会同时取消正在等待的调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4394":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"每次调用在回复中占一行：图标、动词和作用对象（**读取** `路径`、**编辑** `文件`、**运行** `命令`、**启动** `命令`、**查看** 或 **输入到** *会话 n*、**停止** *会话 n*、**搜索**“关键词”、**打开** *地址*），然后是状态：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4395":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"4396":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4397":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"**准备中…**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4398":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"模型还在写这次调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4399":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"**审查中…**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4400":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"审查模型正在判断它","locale":"zh-CN"},"4401":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"**等待批准**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4402":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"等你答复","locale":"zh-CN"},"4403":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"转圈图标和计时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4404":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"正在运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4405":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"对勾和耗时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4406":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"已完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"4407":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"**退出码** *n* 或 **失败**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4408":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"命令以错误退出，或工具执行失败；模型会读到原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4409":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"**已拒绝**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4410":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"你拒绝了它","locale":"zh-CN"},"4411":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"**审查已拒绝**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4412":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"审查模型拒绝了它；模型会读到原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4413":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"**已停止**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4414":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"回复在它完成前被停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"4415":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"点击卡片可以展开。请求的内容和返回的结果按各工具的特点排版：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4416":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4417":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"展开后显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"4418":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"`apply_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4419":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"改动了几个文件、增删多少行，然后是每个文件的操作（**新增**、**修改**、**从** *路径* **重命名**、**删除**）和它的 diff，按文件的语言高亮。应用之后，每行标出它在改动前后文件中的行号。较长的 diff 默认折叠。模型还在编写补丁时就会显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"4420":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"`read`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4421":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"文件的各行及其行号，带高亮，并注明是哪几行（**第 1–2000 行，共 5000 行**）；目录则列出其中的文件夹和文件，以及未显示的数量","locale":"zh-CN"},"4422":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"`shell` 和后台命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"4423":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"命令（带高亮）、所用的 shell 和运行目录；向会话输入的按键（**^C** 表示 Ctrl+C，**⏎** 表示回车）；然后是输出，上方标出退出码（仍在运行的会话为 **运行中**）、**已超时** 和耗时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4424":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"`web_search`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4425":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"每个结果的标题（链接）、网站和摘要","locale":"zh-CN"},"4426":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"`web_fetch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4427":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"页面标题和网站、页面链接，被截断时标出 **已截断**，以及转成 Markdown 的正文，可以展开到完整长度","locale":"zh-CN"},"4428":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"其他工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4429":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"逐行列出参数，以及输出（JSON 会高亮）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4430":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工具卡片","content":"每部分都有 **复制代码** 按钮；Playground 无法识别的内容（例如错误）按工具返回的原样显示。两轮之间，回复处显示 **处理中…**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4431":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#在回复进行中补充说明","content":"开启了工具的回复运行期间，你可以在不停止它的情况下补充内容。输入框提示“补充说明，模型会在下一步读到…”；输入后按 Enter（或点按钮，此时为 **发送给正在进行的回复**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4432":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#在回复进行中补充说明","content":"你的消息以淡色显示在回复下方，并标注 **当前步骤完成后读取**。模型在下一轮开始时（当前调用完成后）读取它，之后它会出现在回复中被读取的位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4433":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#在回复进行中补充说明","content":"在模型刚好收尾时发送的消息，会让回复再继续一轮来回应它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4434":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#在回复进行中补充说明","content":"如果回复已经结束，消息会放回输入框（“回复已经结束，你的消息已放回输入框。”），你可以把它作为新消息发送。如果回复在读取之前被停止或失败，文字同样会回到输入框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4435":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#在回复进行中补充说明","content":"输入框为空时，按钮仍是 **停止**；Esc 总是停止回复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4436":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#输入框上方的后台命令","content":"对话的工具通过 `exec_command` 启动、仍在运行的命令列在输入框上方（**后台命令**）：显示命令、**运行中** 和一个停止按钮（**停止** *命令*），它会停止该命令及其启动的所有进程。这些命令在两次回复之间持续运行，直到模型或你停止它们、对话被删除或服务停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4437":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工作区","content":"工作区是工具的起点：相对路径在这里解析，`shell` 和后台命令默认在这里运行（除非模型指定了其他目录）。它在 **设置 › 工具 › 工具如何运行 › 工作区** 中设置（`playground.workspace`，支持 `~`）；留空时使用数据目录中的 `workspace` 文件夹（见数据目录与路径）。开启工具的回复第一次运行时自动创建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4438":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#工作区","content":"工作区是审批模式的分界线：在 **先询问** 和 **仅在工作区外询问** 下，读取或更改工作区外的文件都会询问；在 **自动审查** 下则交给审查模型判断。但它不是命令的边界：命令可以 `cd` 到任何地方，操作运行 Hoshimi 的用户能操作的一切。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4439":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-197","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#停止","content":"一条回复需要多少轮工具调用就进行多少轮，没有上限；模型不再调用工具、直接作答时回复结束。**停止**（或 Esc）立即结束回复。正在运行的 `shell` 命令会连同其启动的进程一起停止；等待批准或正在审查的调用被取消；尚未运行的调用标记为 **已停止**。回复到此为止说过和做过的内容都会保留。后台命令会继续运行：请在输入框上方停止它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4440":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-198","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"没有沙箱。工具以运行 Hoshimi 的用户身份在那台机器上运行，能访问它的文件、凭据和网络。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4441":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-199","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"只有在 **先询问** 模式下，你才能在每条命令、每次文件更改发生前看到它。批准前请逐一看清楚。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4442":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-200","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"**自动审查** 是模型的判断。它可能两头出错，放行不该放行的、拒绝没有问题的，也可能被欺骗。它是一道防护，不是沙箱。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4443":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-201","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"**仅在工作区外询问** 会不经询问运行任何命令。命令并不局限于工作区，所以在这个模式下，模型可以修改或删除该用户能访问的任何文件，也可以访问你的网络。只在你信任模型和任务时使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4444":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-202","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"**完全访问** 不经询问运行所有调用，包括对工作区外文件的编辑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4445":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-203","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"**始终允许** 会在此对话的剩余时间里（直到服务重启）不再询问，在 **自动审查** 下也不再经过审查模型。需要每次检查的操作，请选择 **允许**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4446":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-204","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"`web_fetch` 会拒绝本地和私有地址，但 `shell` 和后台命令不会：命令可以访问这台机器能访问的一切，包括网关自己的 API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4447":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-205","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"模型读到的内容（网页、文件、命令输出）可能包含试图操纵它的指令。工具会读取不可信内容时，请使用 **先询问**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4448":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-206","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#安全","content":"如果其他机器可以访问这个服务，任何能登录网页界面的人都能使用这些工具。请设置访问密钥并限制可连接的来源（见访问与安全）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4449":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-207","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"设置（**设置 › 工具**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4450":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-208","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"配置项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4451":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-209","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"4452":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-210","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"**工具**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4453":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-211","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`playground.tools`：`read`、`apply_patch`、`shell`、`terminal`、`web_search`、`web_fetch` 中的任意几个","locale":"zh-CN"},"4454":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-212","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"全部六个（`[]` 表示全部关闭）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4455":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-213","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"**工具何时先询问**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4456":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-214","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`playground.approval`：`review`、`ask`、`workspace`（旧名称为 `auto`）或 `full`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4457":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-215","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`review`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4458":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-216","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"**审查模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4459":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-217","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`playground.review_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4460":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-218","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"空：对话自身使用的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4461":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-219","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"**Shell**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4462":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-220","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`playground.shell`：`auto`、`bash`、`zsh`、`sh`、`powershell` 或 `cmd`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4463":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-221","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4464":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-222","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"**工作区**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4465":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-223","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`playground.workspace`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4466":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-224","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"空：数据目录中的 `workspace`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4467":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-225","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"**SearXNG 地址**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4468":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-226","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`playground.search_url`（`http(s)` 地址）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4469":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-227","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"空：DuckDuckGo","locale":"zh-CN"},"4470":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-228","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"`terminal` 是三个后台命令工具共用的开关。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4471":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-229","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"<Card title=\"Playground\" href=\"/docs/guide-playground\" description=\"对话、附件、版本、分支与复制为 API 请求。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4472":{"id":"/docs/guide-agent-230","page_id":"/docs/guide-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-agent#设置参考","content":"<Card title=\"Playground API\" href=\"/docs/api-playground\" description=\"通过 HTTP 使用工具事件、步骤、批准、补充说明和后台命令。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4473":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"page","content":"渠道","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels","locale":"zh-CN"},"4474":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels","content":"渠道页：查看每个提供商的状态，登录站点或添加 API 密钥，管理账号的续期、过期、余额与签到，查看额度，并为单个渠道设置网络线路。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4475":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"渠道列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4476":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"渠道详情","locale":"zh-CN"},"4477":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#开启与关闭","content":"开启与关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"4478":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#登录站点","content":"登录站点","locale":"zh-CN"},"4479":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#获取链接","content":"获取链接","locale":"zh-CN"},"4480":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#在浏览器中完成","content":"在浏览器中完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"4481":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#已登录","content":"已登录","locale":"zh-CN"},"4482":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"添加账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"4483":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"4484":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#凭据续期","content":"凭据续期","locale":"zh-CN"},"4485":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#签到与余额","content":"签到与余额","locale":"zh-CN"},"4486":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#今日","content":"今日","locale":"zh-CN"},"4487":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"额度","locale":"zh-CN"},"4488":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"网络","locale":"zh-CN"},"4489":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels","content":"**渠道** 页管理模型从哪里来。一个渠道就是一个提供商：免费站点（如 Cline、TRAE、Qoder）、云服务（如 Azure、Bedrock、Vertex）、本地服务（如 Ollama、LM Studio），或者 `agg` 聚合账号。每个渠道下可以有多个账号，网关在账号之间轮换。各提供商的区别和选择方法见渠道概念。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4490":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels","content":"页面左侧是渠道列表，右侧是所选渠道的详情；窗口较窄时只显示其中之一，详情页左上角的返回按钮回到列表。所选渠道记在地址中（如 `#/channels/cline`），刷新后仍然打开它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4491":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"列表包含已经设置的渠道，以及可以直接登录或填写密钥、只是还没设置的站点。每一行显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4492":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"状态圆点和名称；不是 **就绪** 时右侧有状态标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4493":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"账号数量（**N 个账号**）；匿名渠道显示 **无需账户**，还没设置的显示 **未设置**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4494":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"今天用过时，显示今天的 Token 量（**今日 N Token**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4495":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"站点报告了额度时，下方有一条额度条：剩余 10% 及以下为红色，25% 及以下为琥珀色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4496":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"4497":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4498":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"**就绪**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4499":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"正常服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4500":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"**需要处理**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4501":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"仍在服务，但有需要人处理的事：某个账号需要重新登录、令牌已过期、账户被暂停轮换，或者被限流过、额度只剩 10% 及以下","locale":"zh-CN"},"4502":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"**已关闭**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4503":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"渠道被你关闭了","locale":"zh-CN"},"4504":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"**未设置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4505":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"没有可用的账号，也不是匿名渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4506":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"列表上方：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4507":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"**搜索供应商**：按渠道 id 或名称搜索。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4508":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"筛选：**全部**、**使用中**（就绪和需要处理）、**需要处理**、**未设置**、**已关闭**，每项带数量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4509":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"右侧是每日签到的状态（**已完成 · 时间** 或 **今日尚未签到**，悬停可看上次的结果）、**全部签到** 按钮和 **续期所有账户** 图标按钮，见下文的签到与余额和凭据续期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4510":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道列表","content":"保存某个渠道（开启它、添加第一个账号）后，它在服务器返回的顺序中可能会变，但列表中的行保持原位，不会从鼠标下跳走；刷新页面后才按新顺序排列。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4511":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"点一行打开它的详情。顶部是名称、渠道 id 和 **已启用** 开关，下面是一排操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4512":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"4513":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4514":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"**登录**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4515":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"支持浏览器登录的站点的主操作，见登录站点","locale":"zh-CN"},"4516":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"**添加账号**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4517":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"使用 API 密钥等凭据的渠道的主操作，见添加账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"4518":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"**立即续期**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4519":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"有账号时出现，对这个渠道运行一轮凭据续期","locale":"zh-CN"},"4520":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"⋮ 菜单","locale":"zh-CN"},"4521":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"**立即续期**、**立即签到**（有账号时）；两种方式都支持时，不是主操作的 **添加账号** 也在这里；**查看用量** 打开用量页","locale":"zh-CN"},"4522":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#渠道详情","content":"渠道需要处理时，操作下方出现一条提示，逐条列出原因，例如 **2 个需重新登录**、**1 个已过期**、**1 个暂停轮换**、**限流 ×3**、**额度表头无法解析 ×1**、**额度仅剩 8%**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4523":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#开启与关闭","content":"**已启用** 开关写入 `config.json` 的 `providers.<id>.enabled`，立即生效。关闭后该渠道不再参与服务，它的模型也从目录中消失；账号仍保留在配置中，重新开启即可恢复。给关闭的渠道添加账号会自动重新开启它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4524":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#登录站点","content":"免费站点通过浏览器发放凭据，不需要手动粘贴密钥。点 **登录**，对话框按三步显示进度：**获取链接**、**在浏览器中完成**、**已登录**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4525":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#获取链接","content":"网关向站点请求登录链接，显示 **正在获取登录链接…**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4526":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#在浏览器中完成","content":"链接一到，浏览器就在新标签页中打开站点的登录页（提示 **已在浏览器打开站点登录页，请在那里完成。**）。对话框中同时显示这个链接和复制按钮，标签页没有自动打开时可以手动打开。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4527":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#在浏览器中完成","content":"使用设备码的站点会显示 **验证码** 及复制按钮：在授权页面输入它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4528":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#在浏览器中完成","content":"通过本机回调完成登录的站点（如 Codex、Gemini、TRAE、CodeArts、LobsterAI）会显示 **授权码或回调地址** 输入框。浏览器和 Hoshimi 不在同一台机器上时，回调到不了服务器：登录完成后把浏览器地址栏中最终的回调地址整个复制下来，粘贴到这里，点 **提交授权码**。Anthropic 也接受 `code#state` 形式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4529":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#在浏览器中完成","content":"对话框底部显示 **此次登录将于 某时 失效**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4530":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#已登录","content":"站点返回后，账号写入 `config.json` 并立即加入账号池，提示 **已登录为 账号 id。**。点 **完成** 关闭对话框。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4531":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#已登录","content":"关闭对话框（无论怎样关闭）都会取消尚未完成的登录，之后迟到的回调不会再保存账号。失败时对话框显示原因，点 **重试** 重新开始。用同一个站点身份再次登录会替换原来的账号，不会叠加出第二个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4532":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#已登录","content":"Cline 有两种登录方式，在 Cline 渠道详情的 **网络** 部分选择 **Cline 登录方式**：**设备码（SDK）**（默认）或 **浏览器（扩展）**。修改只影响之后的登录，已有账号保持登录时所用的身份。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4533":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#已登录","content":"同样的登录也可以在命令行完成，适合没有图形界面的服务器：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4534":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#已登录","content":"每个站点的登录方式、能用的模型和注意事项见免费站点；EAC 的登录见 EAC。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4535":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"使用 API 密钥或其他凭据的渠道点 **添加账号**。表单因提供商而异，由服务器按该提供商实际接受的字段生成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4536":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"提供商支持多种鉴权方式时，先在 **鉴权方式** 中选择一种，例如 Bedrock 的 **API 密钥**、**AWS 访问密钥**、**AWS 配置档案**、**AWS 默认凭据**，Vertex 的 **API 密钥**、**Google 默认凭据**、**Google 服务账号文件**，EAC 的 **内置 EAC 中继（GitHub 登录）**、**自定义 EAC Worker 中继**、**EAC Bearer 直连中继**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4537":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"常见字段有 **API 密钥**、**API 地址（可选）**（留空使用默认地址）、**模型 ID**（以空格或逗号分隔，也接受 JSON 数组）、**通信协议**，以及云服务特有的字段，如 **Azure 资源名称**、**部署映射（JSON）**、**Cloudflare 账号 ID**、**AWS 区域（默认 us-east-1）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4538":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"本地服务（Ollama、LM Studio、llama.cpp）使用 **本地服务（密钥可选）**；网关只在添加账号之后才会连接本地服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4539":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"**账号 ID（可选）**：留空则由网关自动命名。同一渠道中已有同名账号时会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4540":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"点 **保存账号**。网关先让提供商检查这份凭据，通过后把它**追加**到 `config.json` 中该渠道的账号列表（不会替换已有账号），并立即加入运行中的账号池，提示 **账号 账号 id 已添加。**。密钥保存在 `config.json` 中，之后不会再回传给浏览器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4541":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"`agg` 聚合渠道的表单不同：在 **站点** 中从可搜索的列表里选一个站点，或选 **自定义地址…** 并在 **Base URL** 中填写该站点的 OpenAI 兼容根地址，再填 **API key**。站点列表可以用 `hoshimi stations` 查看，见聚合账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4542":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#添加账号","content":"各云服务需要哪些字段，见云服务和本地与兼容端点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4543":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**账户** 部分列出这个渠道的每个账号：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4544":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"账号 id。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4545":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"一行状态说明：令牌何时过期（如“3小时后过期”“2天前已过期”，悬停可看确切时间）、余额（数量和单位，或站点返回的说明）、暂停轮换的原因及恢复时间（如“被限流，10分钟后恢复”）。账号出错时另起一行显示最近的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4546":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"右侧是今天的 Token 量和最近一次使用的时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4547":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"状态标记和 ⋮ 菜单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4548":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"4549":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4550":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**就绪**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4551":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"可以使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4552":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**需要登录**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4553":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"站点拒绝了刷新令牌，必须重新登录","locale":"zh-CN"},"4554":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**已过期**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4555":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"令牌已过期","locale":"zh-CN"},"4556":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**暂停中**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4557":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"因 **被限流** 或 **被策略阻止** 暂时退出轮换，到时自动恢复","locale":"zh-CN"},"4558":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**出错**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4559":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"最近的续期失败了，下一轮会再试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4560":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"暂停轮换的时长按站点给出的重置时间计算，站点没有说明时默认一小时。暂停只记在内存中，重启后清除。轮换和重试的完整规则见模型能力与推理强度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4561":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"账号的 ⋮ 菜单：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4562":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**立即续期**：账号有刷新令牌时出现，对这个渠道运行一轮续期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4563":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"**删除**：确认 **删除这个账号？** 后，凭据从 `config.json` 和运行中的账号池中移除。重新登录即可恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4564":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#账号","content":"账号的密钥和令牌都明文保存在数据目录的 `config.json` 中（尽量设置为仅所有者可读）。不要分享填好的配置文件。用 `hoshimi config path` 查看它的位置，见数据目录与路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4565":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#凭据续期","content":"**设置 › 自动化 › 凭据续期** 打开时（默认打开），网关在启动 30 秒后开始，每 30 分钟检查一遍所有带刷新令牌的账号：令牌将在一小时内过期，或者没有记录过期时间的，就续期。续期得到的新令牌写回 `config.json` 中对应的账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4566":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#凭据续期","content":"站点拒绝刷新令牌（401/403，或明确说明令牌无效）时，账号标为 **需要登录**，不再重试，需要重新登录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4567":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#凭据续期","content":"其他失败（网络问题、站点错误）标为 **出错**，下一轮再试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4568":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#凭据续期","content":"**立即续期** 和 **续期所有账户** 立即运行一轮，使用与定时任务相同的规则：只续期快要过期的账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4569":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#凭据续期","content":"定时续期打开时，渠道页每 30 秒刷新一次，续期的结果会自动显示出来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4570":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#签到与余额","content":"一些站点每天发放免费额度，需要“签到”领取。**设置 › 自动化 › 每日签到** 打开时（默认打开），网关在启动 30 秒后签到一次，之后每 24 小时检查一次；当天（按站点统一使用的北京时间 UTC+8 计算）已经签过就跳过。签到逐个账号依次进行，不会同时向多个站点发请求，以免触发风控。不支持签到的站点自动跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4571":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#签到与余额","content":"列表上方的 **全部签到** 立即为所有渠道的所有账号签到；渠道详情 ⋮ 菜单中的 **立即签到** 只签这个渠道。站点通常对第二次签到回答“已领取”，重复点击没有坏处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4572":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#签到与余额","content":"列表上方的状态只反映定时签到：**已完成 · 时间** 表示今天的定时签到已经领到，**今日尚未签到** 表示还没有。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4573":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#签到与余额","content":"渠道详情的 **最近签到** 列出这个渠道最近 5 次签到的结果：**已领取** 或 **失败**、账号、站点的说明、领到的额度（**+N**）和时间。全部签到记录保留 365 天，可以通过 `GET /api/v1/credits/checkins` 读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4574":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#签到与余额","content":"余额在打开渠道页时向各站点查询一次（`GET /api/v1/credits`），显示在每个账号的状态行中。没有余额接口的站点不显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4575":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#今日","content":"**今日** 部分显示这个渠道今天（服务器本地时间）的 **token**、**调用次数**、**缓存命中** 和 **失败** 次数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4576":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"很多站点在每个响应中通过限流响应头报告剩余额度。网关从正常的响应中读取它，不会额外发请求；有读数时详情页出现 **额度** 部分：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4577":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4578":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4579":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"额度条","locale":"zh-CN"},"4580":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"剩余百分比；10% 及以下为红色，25% 及以下为琥珀色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4581":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"**剩余**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4582":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"剩余量 / 上限","locale":"zh-CN"},"4583":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"**来源**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4584":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"读数来自哪个响应头","locale":"zh-CN"},"4585":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"**更新于**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4586":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"最近一次读数的时间；超过五分钟时副标题提示 **最近一次读数已超过五分钟。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4587":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"**已见响应**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4588":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"读取过的响应数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4589":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"**被限流**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4590":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"429 的次数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4591":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"**凭据被拒**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4592":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"401/403 的次数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4593":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"**服务器错误**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4594":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"5xx 的次数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4595":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"网关按下面的顺序取第一对能解析的“剩余/上限”响应头：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4596":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"剩余","locale":"zh-CN"},"4597":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"上限","locale":"zh-CN"},"4598":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4599":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4600":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4601":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4602":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`ratelimit-remaining-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4603":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`ratelimit-limit-requests`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4604":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`ratelimit-remaining`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4605":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`ratelimit-limit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4606":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining-requests-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4607":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit-requests-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4608":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-remaining-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4609":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"`x-ratelimit-limit-day`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4610":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#额度","content":"格式不对的响应头计为“额度表头无法解析”。额度读数只保存在内存中，界面只显示响应头的名称，不显示其原始值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4611":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"每个渠道可以有自己的网络线路，覆盖 **设置 › 网络** 中的全局设置。在 **请求出口** 中选择：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4612":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4613":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4614":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**继承全局配置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4615":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"默认，使用 **设置 › 网络** 的设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4616":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**自动（环境代理）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4617":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"读取 `HTTP_PROXY`、`HTTPS_PROXY`、`ALL_PROXY` 和 `NO_PROXY` 环境变量；此时还可以打开 **无环境代理时使用 Windows 系统代理**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4618":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**直连**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4619":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"不使用任何代理","locale":"zh-CN"},"4620":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"**指定代理**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4621":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"在 **代理地址** 中填写 HTTP(S) 或 SOCKS5 地址后点 **保存**；**清空** 回到继承","locale":"zh-CN"},"4622":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"这条线路覆盖网关为这个渠道发出的所有请求：模型目录、推理、登录、令牌刷新、余额查询和签到。代理地址保存后只显示 **已配置代理，保存可替换。**，不会再显示出来。指定的代理连不上时不会退回直连。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4623":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"这一部分下方还会列出这个渠道最近失败的网络操作：操作（如 **模型目录**、**推理请求**、**令牌刷新**、**签到**）、失败类型（如 **连接超时**、**代理连接失败**、**地区限制**、**需要浏览器授权**）、HTTP 状态码和时间；悬停可以看到目标主机和所用的线路。成功的操作不列出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4624":{"id":"/docs/guide-channels-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-channels","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-channels#网络","content":"网络设置的完整说明见网络与代理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4625":{"id":"/docs/guide-models","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"page","content":"模型","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models","locale":"zh-CN"},"4626":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"模型页：浏览所有可调用的模型，查看能力、上下文长度和免费标记，运行可用性探测，复制模型 id 或在 Playground 中试用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4627":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"模型列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4628":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"搜索与筛选","locale":"zh-CN"},"4629":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"目录如何加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"4630":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"可用性探测","locale":"zh-CN"},"4631":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#网关记住的故障","content":"网关记住的故障","locale":"zh-CN"},"4632":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"复制 id 与试用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4633":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-models#列表为空时","content":"列表为空时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4634":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models","content":"**模型** 页列出网关此刻能回答的每一个模型 id，也就是客户端在请求的 `model` 字段中可以填写的值。模型来自所有已启用的渠道：各站点自己公布的模型列表，加上渠道和账号配置中声明的模型。想让某个模型出现在这里，先在渠道页给它的提供商登录或添加账号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4635":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"标题下方显示模型总数；做过探测后，还显示其中 **可用** 的数量（**N 个模型 · N 个可用**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4636":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"列","locale":"zh-CN"},"4637":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4638":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**模型 id**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4639":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"请求中使用的 id。下面一行是站点给出的显示名称（与 id 不同时），站点明确说明免费时加上 **免费**。id 太长时截断，悬停可看完整 id","locale":"zh-CN"},"4640":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**提供商**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4641":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"模型来自哪个渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4642":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**上下文**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4643":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"上下文窗口，以 K（1024 个 Token）为单位；不知道时显示 —","locale":"zh-CN"},"4644":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**能力**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4645":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"三个小图标：**推理**（悬停时显示可选的推理强度档位数，如 **推理 · 3 档位**）、**视觉**（能读取图片）、**工具调用**。站点明确说明不支持工具时显示 **不支持工具调用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4646":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**可用性**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4647":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"最近一次探测的结论，见下文；从未探测过的模型显示 **未探测**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4648":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"点 **模型 id**、**提供商**、**上下文**、**可用性** 的列标题可以排序。窗口较窄时，**上下文**、**提供商** 等列会依次隐藏；在手机上，可用性标记移到模型 id 下方，每行的两个按钮收进 ⋮ 菜单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4649":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"关于这些标记：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4650":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"**免费** 只在站点自己说明免费时出现。没有标记不代表收费，只是站点没有说；有标记也不保证额度无限。本地模型不会自动标为免费。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4651":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型列表","content":"能力来自提供商的能力表和账号中的显式声明；站点自己公布的元数据作为补充，models.dev 只为没有声明的模型补充视觉和推理两项。推理强度档位因提供商而异，详见模型能力与推理强度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4652":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"**搜索模型**：按模型 id、提供商或显示名称搜索。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4653":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"**提供商**：只看某一个提供商（**全部提供商** 恢复）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4654":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"**可用性**：做过探测后出现，只列出已经出现过的结论，以及 **未探测**；**全部状态** 恢复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4655":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#搜索与筛选","content":"没有匹配的模型时显示 **没有匹配的模型**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4656":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"模型目录和 Playground、设置中的模型选择器共用，以流的方式加载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4657":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"先显示缓存中的模型（成功的目录会保存在数据目录的 `catalog-cache` 中，七天内有效），页面立刻可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4658":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"各提供商再分别查询自己的模型列表，谁先返回先更新谁。加载过程中列表上方显示 **正在加载供应商：已完成/总数**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4659":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"20 秒后仍未返回的提供商标为超时。失败或超时的提供商会列在 **目录加载失败或超时：……。已保留现有模型。** 中，并附上原因（例如 **连接超时**、**代理连接失败**、**凭据被拒绝**、**地区限制**）；连接中途断开时显示 **目录连接中断，已保留收到的模型。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4660":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#目录如何加载","content":"失败不会清空已有的模型：上一次成功的目录一直保留。失败后不会自动重试，点 **重试**（或工具栏右侧的刷新按钮）重新加载目录。某个站点的列表突然缩水到不足原来一半时，网关会先保留旧列表，等下一次查询确认后才接受。更多细节见模型能力与推理强度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4661":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"有些渠道的模型列表只是一串 id，看不出哪些模型在你的网络出口上真的能用。点工具栏的 **探测**，网关会在后台对这些模型逐个发一个最小的请求（一条 `ping`，最多 64 个输出 Token），根据回答给出结论。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4662":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"默认探测的是模型列表无法说明可用性的渠道：OpenCode Zen、`agg` 聚合账号和 NVIDIA NIM（已启用的那些）。Kilo 的免费列表已经由上游筛选过，不在默认探测范围内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4663":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"每次最多同时探测 2 个模型，每个模型最多等 45 秒，以免触发站点的限流。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4664":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"探测进行中按钮显示 **探测中…**，重复点击不会叠加新的一轮。结束时提示 **本轮探测结束**，列表随之更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4665":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"结论保存在数据目录的 `hoshimi.db` 中，重启后仍在。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4666":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"结论","locale":"zh-CN"},"4667":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4668":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**可用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4669":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"模型返回了内容或 Token","locale":"zh-CN"},"4670":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**地区受限**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4671":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"站点拒绝为这个网络出口服务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4672":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**不可用**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4673":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"站点给出了针对这个模型的拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"4674":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**限流**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4675":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"额度用完，没能问到模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4676":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"**未知**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4677":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"凭据、网络或站点自身的错误，不能说明模型本身","locale":"zh-CN"},"4678":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"只有 **不可用** 是针对模型本身的结论；地区受限、限流和未知都不表示模型已经没了。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4679":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"只探测指定的模型时，可以直接调用管理接口（设置了工具访问密钥时带上它）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4680":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#可用性探测","content":"`GET /api/v1/probe` 读取最近一轮的结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4681":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#网关记住的故障","content":"除了探测，网关在正常转发时也会记住模型故障：站点对某个模型回答 404/410（或 400/422 且明确说明模型已移除）记一次，10 分钟内记满三次就在本次运行中屏蔽它。被屏蔽的模型在列表中显示为 **不可用**（优先于探测结论），对它的请求直接返回 `503 model_unavailable`，不再打扰上游。重启服务器，或调用 `POST /api/v1/models/unavailable/reset`，即可解除所有屏蔽：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4682":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"每行右侧有两个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4683":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"**复制模型 id**：把 id 复制到剪贴板，粘贴到客户端的 `model` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4684":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#复制-id-与试用","content":"**在 Playground 中打开**：用这个模型新开一个 Playground 对话，推理强度为 **自动**。当前对话已有内容时不会被覆盖，而是另开新对话。见 Playground。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4685":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#列表为空时","content":"**暂无模型**：还没有任何可用的渠道。到渠道页登录一个免费站点或添加 API 密钥，然后点刷新。全新安装时 OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo 无需账号即可使用，见匿名渠道。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4686":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#列表为空时","content":"某个提供商的模型没有出现：看列表上方的失败原因，再到该渠道的详情页检查账号状态和 **网络** 部分的诊断信息。常见问题见故障排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4687":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview","locale":"zh-CN"},"4688":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview","content":"概览页：今天的用量、可复制的接口地址、已启用的渠道，以及版本、更新和默认模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4689":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"今日","locale":"zh-CN"},"4690":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"接口","locale":"zh-CN"},"4691":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"4692":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"服务器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4693":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview","content":"**概览** 是打开界面时的第一页，一眼看清网关现在的状态。页面从上到下分为 **今日**、**接口**、**渠道** 和 **服务器** 四部分；想看更多细节时，各部分都有按钮跳到对应的页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4694":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"数字","locale":"zh-CN"},"4695":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4696":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**token**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4697":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"今天所有调用的输入 + 输出 Token","locale":"zh-CN"},"4698":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**调用次数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4699":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"今天经过网关的请求数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4700":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**缓存命中**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4701":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"输入 Token 中从上游缓存读取的比例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4702":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"**正在进行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4703":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"此刻正在进行的调用数","locale":"zh-CN"},"4704":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#今日","content":"“今天”按服务器的本地时间计算。右侧的小折线是最近 24 小时每小时的 Token 量。标题旁的圆点是实时连接的状态（**实时**、**正在重连…**、**离线**）：处于 **实时** 时，调用一结束这些数字就会更新。点 **用量** 打开用量页查看图表和每次调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4705":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"这一部分列出客户端要用的地址，副标题是 **Base URL**，即你打开界面所用的地址（默认 `http://127.0.0.1:10600`）。每一行右侧的按钮复制完整的 URL：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4706":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"4707":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4708":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/chat/completions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4709":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Chat Completions**（OpenAI）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4710":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/responses`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4711":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Responses**（OpenAI）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4712":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/messages`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4713":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Anthropic Messages**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4714":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/messages/count_tokens`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4715":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**Token 数量估算**（Anthropic）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4716":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"`/v1/models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4717":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"**模型列表**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4718":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"大多数 SDK 把 `http://127.0.0.1:10600/v1` 作为 base URL。例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4719":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"如果在 **设置 › 访问** 中设置了 **模型 API 密钥**，请求还要带上 `Authorization: Bearer <模型 API 密钥>`（或 `x-api-key`）。模型 id 可以在模型页复制。各种客户端的接法见接入客户端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4720":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#接口","content":"列表下方的一行说明工具访问密钥的状态：**管理此服务需要工具访问密钥。** 或 **尚未设置工具访问密钥。**。没有设置工具访问密钥时，标题旁还有 **API 文档** 按钮，在新标签页中打开服务器自带的接口文档（`/docs`）。设置了密钥后这个按钮不显示，因为该页面无法携带浏览器中保存的密钥；此时可以用请求头访问 `/docs` 和 `/openapi.json`，见 API 参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4721":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"这里列出已设置或已启用的渠道（只是可用但还没设置的站点留在渠道页）。每张卡片显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4722":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"渠道名称和状态：**就绪**、**需要处理**、**已关闭**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4723":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"账号数量，或者 **无需账户**（匿名渠道，如 OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4724":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"目录中来自该渠道的模型数（目录加载完成后显示）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4725":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"今天用过时，显示今天的 Token 量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4726":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"点卡片直接打开该渠道的详情，点 **管理渠道** 打开渠道列表。模型目录正在加载或有提供商加载失败时，卡片上方会显示加载进度、失败的提供商及原因，以及 **重试** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4727":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#渠道","content":"一个渠道都没有时显示 **没有启用任何提供商**。这时到 **渠道** 页登录一个免费站点或添加 API 密钥即可；不需要编辑文件，也不需要重启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4728":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"4729":{"id":"/docs/guide-overview-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-overview#服务器","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"}