令，通过上下文压缩让长对话继续下去，以及把回复复制为 API 请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#开始对话","content":"开始对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#打开-playground","content":"打开 Playground","locale":"zh-CN"},"4742":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#选择模型","content":"选择模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4743":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"提问","locale":"zh-CN"},"4744":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"4745":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#临时对话","content":"临时对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"4746":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"对话列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4747":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#标题","content":"标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"4748":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型与推理强度","content":"模型与推理强度","locale":"zh-CN"},"4749":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"附件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4750":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型无法读取图片时","content":"模型无法读取图片时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4751":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"回复能显示的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4752":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#图片查看器","content":"图片查看器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4753":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#推理过程","content":"推理过程","locale":"zh-CN"},"4754":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#编辑重试与版本","content":"编辑、重试与版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"4755":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#分支对话","content":"分支对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"4756":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#复制为-api-请求","content":"复制为 API 请求","locale":"zh-CN"},"4757":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"上下文与压缩","locale":"zh-CN"},"4758":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复用时","content":"回复用时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4759":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"回复的结束状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"4760":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"Playground 设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4761":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"适合 Playground 的系统提示词","locale":"zh-CN"},"4762":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"对话保存在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"4763":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground","content":"**Playground** 是网页界面内置的聊天应用。它和客户端走同一个网关调用模型，所以是试用模型、检查账号、查看请求实际内容的最快方式。对话保存在服务端的数据目录中，关掉页面、重启进程都不会丢，换一个浏览器打开也能接着用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4764":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground","content":"本页介绍聊天本身。让模型读取文件、运行命令、搜索网页见 Playground 工具；页面背后的 HTTP 接口见 Playground API。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4765":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#打开-playground","content":"在导航中选择 **Playground**。页面会打开你上次打开的对话（不论在哪个浏览器），没有时显示一个空对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4766":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#选择模型","content":"输入框中的 **模型** 菜单列出服务端提供的全部模型，列表较长时可以输入关键字搜索。还没选过模型时默认选第一个。也可以在模型页对某个模型选择在 Playground 中试用，这会用该模型开始一个新对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4767":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"在输入框中输入内容，按 Enter。对话随第一条消息在服务端创建，回复以流式显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4768":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"窗口较宽时，对话列表显示在对话旁边；较窄时以抽屉形式滑出，用页头开头的按钮打开或关闭。页头末尾的按钮用于开始下一个对话：显示 **新对话**；如果当前是一个还没写过内容的新对话，则显示 **临时对话**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4769":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"按键","locale":"zh-CN"},"4770":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4771":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"Enter","locale":"zh-CN"},"4772":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"4773":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"Shift+Enter","locale":"zh-CN"},"4774":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"换行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4775":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"Esc","locale":"zh-CN"},"4776":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"停止正在生成的回复","locale":"zh-CN"},"4777":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"输入框为空时按 ↑","locale":"zh-CN"},"4778":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"编辑你的上一个问题","locale":"zh-CN"},"4779":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"在输入框开头输入 /","locale":"zh-CN"},"4780":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"打开命令菜单","locale":"zh-CN"},"4781":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"Ctrl+Shift+O（macOS 上为 Cmd）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4782":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"新对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"4783":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"手机和平板的键盘没有 Shift+Enter，因此在这些设备上 Enter 用于换行，只有点按 **发送** 才会发送消息（输入框和编辑问题时都是如此），输入框下方的提示也会相应变化。命令菜单打开时，Enter 仍执行高亮的命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4784":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"整个对话作为一个整体滚动。工具的输出、压缩总结和正在编辑的问题较长时会各自滚动；滚到顶部或底部后，继续朝同一方向滚动（滚轮、触控板或手指滑动）会接着滚动整个对话，而不会停在原处。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4785":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"按 **停止**（或 Esc）会结束回复，已生成的内容会保留，回复标记为 **已停止**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4786":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#提问","content":"回复在服务端进行，而不是在页面里。打开其他对话、开始新对话、离开 Playground 或刷新页面都不会停止它：它会在后台继续，多个对话可以同时进行。再次打开该对话，就能从当前进度接着看，包括已经生成的内容；也可以在那里停止它。在没有页面显示时结束的回复会照常保存，对话也会照常命名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4787":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"在输入框开头输入 /，输入框上方会打开命令菜单。继续输入可以筛选（输入 `/co` 只剩 **/compact** 和 **/status**，匹配的字母加粗显示）。↑、↓ 移动，Tab 补全命令名，Enter 执行，Esc 关闭菜单，直到你改动输入的内容。需要从列表中选择的命令，在命令名后输入空格即打开列表，后面的文字用于筛选：输入 `/model gpt` 再按 Enter，选中第一个匹配项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4788":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"4789":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4790":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"`/model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4791":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"为此对话选择模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4792":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"`/effort`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4793":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"选择推理强度（仅限有档位的模型）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4794":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"`/compact` *要保留的重点*","locale":"zh-CN"},"4795":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"立即压缩对话（见上下文与压缩）；命令后的文字告诉总结要关注什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4796":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"`/status`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4797":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"上下文窗口的已用与剩余、上次请求和整个对话的 token 数（含缓存命中）、压缩次数、回复用时以及工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4798":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"`/new`（或 `/clear`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4799":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"开始新对话","locale":"zh-CN"},"4800":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"`/fork` *标题*","locale":"zh-CN"},"4801":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"在新对话中继续此对话，截至屏幕上的消息；命令后的文字作为新对话的标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"4802":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"`/permissions`（或 `/approval`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4803":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"选择工具运行前何时询问","locale":"zh-CN"},"4804":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#命令","content":"回复进行中时，只有 `/status`、`/permissions` 和 `/new` 可以执行，其他命令会说明原因。斜杠后面跟的不是命令时（例如 `/etc/hosts`），会作为普通消息发送。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4805":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#临时对话","content":"在一个空的新对话中，页头按钮显示为 **临时对话**。临时对话和普通对话用法一样，但是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4806":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#临时对话","content":"不会出现在对话列表中，也不会被自动命名；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4807":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#临时对话","content":"一离开（打开其他对话或开始新对话）就被删除，遗留下来的会在服务下次启动时删除；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4808":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#临时对话","content":"没有对话菜单，也没有 **在新对话中分支**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4809":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#临时对话","content":"处于临时对话时，输入框提示“有问题，尽管问（此对话不会保存）”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4810":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"对话按最近使用时间分组：**今天**、**昨天**、**过去 7 天**、**过去 30 天** 和 **更早**。从其他对话分支出来的对话带有分支图标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4811":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"**搜索对话**：边输入边按标题筛选列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4812":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"每个对话都有一个菜单（**对话选项**，即 `…` 按钮），包含 **重命名**、**归档** 和 **删除**。当前打开的对话在页头也有同样的菜单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4813":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"**重命名**：设置你自己的标题，之后不会再被自动生成的标题替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4814":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"**归档**：把对话收起来而不删除。列表底部的 **已归档的对话** 显示归档内容；在其中选 **恢复** 可以取回对话，在已归档的对话中发送新消息也会让它回到列表。**返回对话列表** 回到普通列表。归档当前打开的对话会开始一个新对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4815":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"**删除**：先确认，然后永久删除对话、其全部消息以及只属于它的附件。其中正在进行的回复会先被停止，它的工具启动的所有后台命令也会停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4816":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话列表","content":"有回复正在进行的对话，标题后会显示一个转圈图标（**处理中…**），无论页面是否在显示它；工具调用正在等待你批准的对话则显示一个盾牌（**等待批准**）。打开它即可答复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4817":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#标题","content":"在模型为对话命名之前，对话以第一个问题作为标题（最多 80 个字符）。第一条回复完成后，由模型用不超过六个词、以你提问所用的语言为对话命名。由哪个模型命名取决于 **标题模型** 设置（见下文的 Playground 设置），默认使用对话自身的模型。命名的模型调用失败时，第一个问题继续作为标题。用 **重命名** 设置的标题会一直保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4818":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型与推理强度","content":"模型和推理强度在输入框中选择，并随对话保存，重新打开对话时会恢复。回复生成期间这两个菜单不可更改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4819":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型与推理强度","content":"**模型**：服务端提供的任意模型。换模型时推理强度会重置为自动。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4820":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型与推理强度","content":"**推理强度**：只有支持推理级别的模型才显示。**自动（服务端默认）** 不发送级别，由模型和供应商决定；选择其他项则作为请求的 `reasoning_effort` 发送。各供应商如何对应这些级别见模型行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4821":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"点 **添加图片和文件**（`+` 按钮）、把文件拖放到对话区域，或直接粘贴到输入框。每个文件会立即上传，显示在文本上方；发送前可以点关闭按钮移除。消息可以只有附件、没有文字。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4822":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4823":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"支持的文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4824":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"发送方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"4825":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"图片","locale":"zh-CN"},"4826":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"PNG、JPEG、WebP、GIF","locale":"zh-CN"},"4827":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"作为图片发送。最长边超过 2048 像素的图片会在浏览器中缩小（并重新编码为 WebP 或 JPEG）；尺寸不超限且小于 1 MB 的图片，以及尺寸不超限的 GIF，按原样发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"4828":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"文本文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4829":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"任意 `text/*` 类型、JSON、XML、YAML、TOML、SQL、shell 脚本，以及按扩展名识别的源代码等文件（`.py`、`.ts`、`.vue`、`.rs`、`.go`、`.md`、`.csv`、`.log`、`.diff` 等）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4830":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"以文件名为标记、作为文字嵌入你的消息。最多可附加 2,000,000 个字符；发给模型的是前 200,000 个字符，并告诉模型其余部分已截断","locale":"zh-CN"},"4831":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"PDF","locale":"zh-CN"},"4832":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"带文字层的 PDF","locale":"zh-CN"},"4833":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"在浏览器中逐页提取文字，再作为文本文件发送。没有文字的扫描版 PDF 会被拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"4834":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#附件","content":"其他文件会被拒绝，并提示“请发送图片、文本文件或 PDF”。上传后一直没有发送的附件会在一天后删除。附件只存一份，分支之间共享，分支对话不会复制附件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4835":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型无法读取图片时","content":"能读取图片的模型直接收到图片。对于不能读取图片的模型（目录中标记为不支持视觉），Playground 会请另一个模型描述每张图片，并用描述代替图片发送：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4836":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型无法读取图片时","content":"给这类模型附加图片时，输入框上方会提示“此模型无法读取图片，将由另一个模型描述图片。”","locale":"zh-CN"},"4837":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型无法读取图片时","content":"生成描述期间，回复处显示“正在用 *模型* 读取图片…”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4838":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型无法读取图片时","content":"回复下方会注明哪张图片由哪个模型描述。描述与图片一起保存，只需生成一次，之后的每轮对话都不会再请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4839":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型无法读取图片时","content":"由哪个模型描述图片取决于 **图片模型** 设置。**自动** 选择目录中第一个能读取图片的模型，跳过上一次可用性探测判定为不可用或受地区限制的模型。**关闭** 则从不请求描述：图片会被略去，回复中会说明。也可以指定一个模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4840":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#模型无法读取图片时","content":"如果一个标记为能读取图片的模型因为图片被其站点拒绝，回复会改用描述再试一次，并附注说明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4841":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"回复是 Markdown，Playground 渲染的不只是文字：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4842":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"回复中写的","locale":"zh-CN"},"4843":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"显示为","locale":"zh-CN"},"4844":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"行内的 `$…$` 或 `\\(…\\)`；单独成行的 `$$…$$` 或 `\\[…\\]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4845":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"排版后的数学公式（KaTeX）。较宽的公式可以横向滚动。单独的 `$` 仍是美元符号，所以 “$5 and $10” 不会被当成公式。无法解析的 TeX 以错误色的代码显示","locale":"zh-CN"},"4846":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"` ```mermaid ` 代码块","locale":"zh-CN"},"4847":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"代码块完整后，以界面配色绘制的图表，代码块头部注明图表类型（flowchart、sequence……）。**代码** 显示源码，**图表** 切回图表。图表以原始大小显示，栏宽不够时缩小，但不小于 60%，以免文字小到无法阅读；框架最多显示 480 像素高。大于框架的图表会在还有内容的边缘淡出：可以拖动，或横向滚动。按住 Ctrl 或 ⌘ 滚动滚轮、双指捏合，或用头部的 **缩小** / **放大** 按钮缩放；两者之间的百分比是当前大小，点击它恢复实际大小。**适应窗口** 显示整个图表，箭头按钮在图片查看器中打开。不按修饰键的滚轮仍然滚动对话。无法绘制的图表会在代码上方说明原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4848":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"` ```svg ` 代码块","locale":"zh-CN"},"4849":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"图片。**代码** 显示源码","locale":"zh-CN"},"4850":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"` ```html ` 代码块","locale":"zh-CN"},"4851":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"它的代码，附 **预览** 按钮，可在框架中显示页面。框架会运行页面的脚本，但无法访问网络、本界面或访问密钥","locale":"zh-CN"},"4852":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"`![描述](地址)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4853":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"图片。地址以 `.mp4`、`.webm`、`.mov` 结尾时显示视频播放器；`.mp3`、`.wav`、`.ogg` 等显示音频播放器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4854":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"每个代码块、图表和 SVG 的头部都是一条工具栏：表示内容的图标（代码、命令、diff、图表、图片、页面）、语言（**Python**、**Bash**……，未注明语言时为 **纯文本**），以及按钮，最后是 **复制代码**。直接写在回复中（代码块之外）的 HTML 会作为文字显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4855":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复能显示的内容","content":"**来自其他网站的媒体。** 加载图片会让提供它的网站知道你正在阅读，而且地址中可以夹带对话内容，因此回复引用的其他网站上的图片、视频或音频，会先显示为一个注明网站的按钮（“加载来自 example.com 的图片”）。直接写在回复中的媒体（`data:` 地址）会立即显示。如需始终加载，在 **设置 › 外观** 中把 **来自其他网站的图片和视频** 设为 **始终加载**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4856":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#图片查看器","content":"点击对话中的任意图片（附件、回复中的图片、图表或 SVG）即可在查看器中打开：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4857":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#图片查看器","content":"**缩放**：鼠标滚轮、双指捏合、双击，或 + 和 -；0 或 **适应窗口** 复原。放大后可拖动查看。图表和 SVG 图片在任何缩放比例下都保持清晰。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4858":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#图片查看器","content":"**切换**：用两侧按钮、← 和 → 或滑动，在对话中的所有图片之间切换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4859":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#图片查看器","content":"**下载** 保存图片；**在新标签页中打开** 单独打开它（直接写在回复中的图片不提供此项，浏览器不会把它们作为页面打开）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4860":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#图片查看器","content":"Esc 或 **关闭** 关闭查看器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4861":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#推理过程","content":"对于会展示推理过程的模型，回复开头有一行折叠的标题：推理期间显示 **正在思考…** 和已用时间，开始作答后显示 **已思考** *时长*。点击这一行即可展开推理内容，展开状态会保持。不返回推理内容的模型没有这一行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4862":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#编辑重试与版本","content":"对话是一棵树：编辑问题或重试回复都会在原消息旁边新增一个版本，新旧版本都可以查看。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4863":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#编辑重试与版本","content":"**编辑消息**（在问题上，或在空输入框中按 ↑ 编辑上一个问题）会在原位置打开问题。修改文字、移除附件，然后点 **发送**（或按 Enter；Esc 取消）。修改后的内容成为这个问题的新版本，并重新获得回复；旧版本后面的内容仍留在旧版本下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4864":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#编辑重试与版本","content":"**重试**（在回复上）为同一个问题再要一条回复，使用输入框中当前选择的模型和推理强度。先换模型再重试，就可以在同一个问题上比较不同模型。失败的回复在错误信息旁也有 **重试**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4865":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#编辑重试与版本","content":"有多个版本的消息会显示 **上一个版本**、*n* / *总数* 和 **下一个版本**。切换到另一个版本时，会同时显示该版本下最新的回复；它们从箭头所指的一侧滑入，上方的消息保持不动。屏幕上显示的版本会随对话保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4866":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#编辑重试与版本","content":"回复生成期间不能编辑、重试或切换版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4867":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#分支对话","content":"**在新对话中分支**（在回复上）会把对话截至这条回复的内容复制到一个新对话并打开它（提示“已在新对话中打开”）。新对话沿用标题、模型和推理强度，以及原对话的审批模式；原对话保持不变。想让一段对话朝两个方向发展、又不想来回切换版本时，可以用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4868":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#复制为-api-请求","content":"在回复的 **更多操作** 中，**复制为 API 请求** 会复制一条 `curl` 命令，通过网关的公开 API 发送同样的 Chat Completions 请求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4869":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#复制为-api-请求","content":"请求体由服务端按这条回复当时的发送方式生成：系统提示词在最前，文件内容嵌入消息，图片为 `data:` URL（对不能读图的模型则是图片描述），选择了推理强度时带上 `reasoning_effort`，对话开启了工具时附带工具定义和 `tool_choice`。对于使用了工具的回复，复制的是第一轮的请求。把 `HOSHIMI_API_KEY` 设为你的模型 API 密钥；服务端没有设置模型 API 密钥时可以去掉这个请求头（见访问与安全）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4870":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#复制为-api-请求","content":"消息上的 **复制** 复制消息文字，代码块上的 **复制代码** 只复制代码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4871":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"每个模型都有**上下文窗口**：一次能读取多少对话内容。发送按钮旁的圆环显示剩余比例；点击它或输入 `/status` 查看详情。窗口大小取自模型所在站点的列表；如果站点以请求过长为由拒绝并给出实际上限，之后就按这个上限计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4872":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"对话接近窗口上限时会被**压缩**：由模型为此前的对话撰写一份总结（目标、决定及原因、已完成与待完成的工作、涉及的文件、下一步），此后模型读取这份总结（以及逐字保留的你最近的几条消息），而不再读取之前的全部内容。对话本身仍完整显示在屏幕上，压缩的位置会有一条分隔线，点击即可查看总结。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4873":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"以下情况会压缩对话：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4874":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"**回复开始时**：对话达到窗口的 85%（`playground.compact_threshold`），或剩余空间已不足以容纳回复；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4875":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"**回复的两轮工具调用之间**：让长时间运行的智能体任务得以继续；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4876":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"**模型以请求过长为由拒绝时**：压缩对话后重新发送请求；仍然过长时，再截短较长的工具输出发送一次。即使关闭了自动压缩也会这样处理；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4877":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"**你输入 `/compact` 时**，后面可以写上总结应保留的内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4878":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#上下文与压缩","content":"压缩失败时对话保持原样。编辑压缩点之前的问题，或从那里分支，会回到完整的对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4879":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复用时","content":"回复进行时，底部一行会显示它正在做什么（撰写、运行或审查工具、压缩上下文）以及已用时间，每秒更新。工具调用等待你批准时计时暂停；审查模型花费的时间照常计入。回复结束后，操作按钮旁会保留 **用时 1m 23s**（或 **… 后停止**、**… 后失败**）；鼠标悬停可查看开始和结束时间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4880":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"显示内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"4881":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4882":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-143","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"**已停止**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4883":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-144","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"你停止了回复，或服务已停止；已生成的文字会保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"4884":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-145","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"**此回复失败。** 及原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4885":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-146","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"模型或站点返回了错误；点 **重试** 再试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4886":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-147","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"“……图片已由……描述后发送”","locale":"zh-CN"},"4887":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-148","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"不能读图的模型收到的是图片描述","locale":"zh-CN"},"4888":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-149","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"“图片……已略去：没有可读取它的模型”","locale":"zh-CN"},"4889":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-150","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"没有可用的描述模型，或 **图片模型** 设为 **关闭**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4890":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-151","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"“……拒绝了图片，因此改为发送图片描述”","locale":"zh-CN"},"4891":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-152","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"站点拒绝了图片，回复已改用描述重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4892":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-153","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"回复上方的 **上下文已压缩**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4893":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-154","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"在此回复之前压缩了对话（见上下文与压缩）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4894":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-155","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"“The conversation no longer fits in …'s context window, even compacted.”","locale":"zh-CN"},"4895":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-156","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"即使压缩后对话仍然过长：请开始新对话，或从更早的消息分支","locale":"zh-CN"},"4896":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-157","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#回复的结束状态","content":"与工具有关的提示（模型不支持调用工具）见 Playground 工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4897":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-158","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"Playground 自身的设置位于 **设置 › 常规 › Playground**（见设置），对应 `config.json` 中的 `playground`（见 config.json）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4898":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-159","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4899":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-160","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"配置项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4900":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-161","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"4901":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-162","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4902":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-163","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**系统提示词**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4903":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-164","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.system_prompt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4904":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-165","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"空","locale":"zh-CN"},"4905":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-166","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"从下一条消息起，作为每个 Playground 对话的第一条消息发送。留空则不发送","locale":"zh-CN"},"4906":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-167","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**标题模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4907":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-168","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.title_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4908":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-169","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"空（**对话自身使用的模型**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4909":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-170","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"在新对话收到第一条回复后为其命名的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4910":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-171","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**图片模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4911":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-172","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.vision_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4912":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-173","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`auto`（**自动**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4913":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-174","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"为不能读取图片的模型描述图片：`auto`、`off` 或某个模型 ID","locale":"zh-CN"},"4914":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-175","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**自动压缩长对话**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4915":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-176","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.auto_compact`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4916":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-177","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`true`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4917":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-178","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"对话接近窗口上限时自动压缩。被拒绝为过长的请求无论如何都会压缩","locale":"zh-CN"},"4918":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-179","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**压缩阈值**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4919":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-180","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.compact_threshold`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4920":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-181","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`0.85`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4921":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-182","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"对话达到窗口的多大比例（0.5 到 0.95）时压缩","locale":"zh-CN"},"4922":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-183","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"**总结模型**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4923":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-184","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"`playground.compact_model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4924":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-185","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"空（**对话自身使用的模型**）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4925":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-186","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"撰写总结的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4926":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-187","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#playground-设置","content":"工具相关的设置（`playground.tools`、`workspace`、`approval`、`search_url`）见 Playground 工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4927":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-188","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"系统提示词默认为空，模型只能看到对话和工具说明。下面这套提示词补上其余部分：何时直接动手、何时询问，如何用好工具，如何对待批准、对话中途补充的消息和压缩，以及回复在这里如何渲染。把它粘贴到 **设置 › 通用 › Playground › 系统提示词** 即可。它适用于开启和不开启工具的对话，也适用于任何模型；回复会使用用户提问所用的语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4928":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-189","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"它改编自 OpenAI 的 Codex 发给模型的基础指令。只有 Codex 才有的部分已去掉（它的身份、消息通道、技能、应用、插件和 JavaScript 工具调度），Playground 不同的地方已相应调整：本地文件写路径而不是链接；问题直接写在回复里；工具说明已经介绍了每个工具，所以提示词只讲怎么用好它们，不重复它们是什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4929":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-190","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"推荐使用英文版：模型对英文指令的遵循最稳定，而回复仍会使用用户的语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4930":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-191","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"也可以使用中文版，内容与英文版相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4931":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-192","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#适合-playground-的系统提示词","content":"可以按需修改：说明你的项目及其约定、或设定语气的内容，加在最后即可。提示词只是描述；工具实际能做什么，仍由你开启的工具和批准模式决定（见 Playground 工具）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4932":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-193","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"对话、消息和附件保存在数据目录的 `hoshimi.db` 中（见数据目录与路径），直到你删除为止。上次打开的对话也记录在这里，因此在任何浏览器中打开 Playground 都能回到它。服务停止时被中断的回复会保存为已停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4933":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-194","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"Playground 发起的每次模型调用都会像其他调用一样记录在用量中，并带有各自的来源：回复为 `playground`，命名标题为 `playground-title`，描述图片为 `playground-vision`，压缩总结为 `playground-compact`，自动审查工具调用为 `playground-review`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4934":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-195","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"<Card title=\"Playground 工具\" href=\"/docs/guide-agent\" description=\"让模型读取和编辑文件、运行命令、搜索网页，并由你批准。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4935":{"id":"/docs/guide-playground-196","page_id":"/docs/guide-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-playground#对话保存在哪里","content":"<Card title=\"Playground API\" href=\"/docs/api-playground\" description=\"这个页面背后的对话接口与流式事件。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"4936":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"page","content":"设置","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings","locale":"zh-CN"},"4937":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"设置页的八个标签页：常规、工具、访问、安全、网络、自动化、外观与关于，每一项的作用和对应的配置项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4938":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"常规","locale":"zh-CN"},"4939":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#工具","content":"工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4940":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#访问","content":"访问","locale":"zh-CN"},"4941":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#安全","content":"安全","locale":"zh-CN"},"4942":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#网络","content":"网络","locale":"zh-CN"},"4943":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#自动化","content":"自动化","locale":"zh-CN"},"4944":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#外观","content":"外观","locale":"zh-CN"},"4945":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#关于","content":"关于","locale":"zh-CN"},"4946":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-settings#界面中没有的设置","content":"界面中没有的设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4947":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"**设置** 在导航栏最下方，分为八个标签页。当前标签页记在地址中（如 `#/settings?tab=access`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4948":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"每一项改动后**单独保存**，不需要点总的保存按钮：开关和选择框改动即保存，文本框和数字框在离开输入框（或按回车）时保存，列表类的输入每增删一项就保存。保存成功提示 **已保存**；需要重启才生效的项提示 **已保存 · 重启后生效。**。值不合法时提示错误原因，配置不会被修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4949":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"除了 **语言** 和 **外观** 是浏览器端的偏好，其余设置都写入数据目录中的 `config.json`，并立即作用于正在运行的网关。下文每一项都给出对应的配置键，配置文件的完整说明见配置文件。用命令行或直接编辑文件修改配置后需要重启服务器；在设置页修改则不需要（监听地址和端口除外）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4950":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings","content":"某个渠道的开关和网络线路不在这里，而在渠道页该渠道的详情中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4951":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**常规** 部分：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4952":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4953":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"配置键","locale":"zh-CN"},"4954":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4955":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**语言**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4956":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"无（浏览器端）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4957":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**自动检测（当前系统语言）**、English、简体中文、日本語","locale":"zh-CN"},"4958":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#常规","content":"**默认模型**",