有一个站点时不需要任何声明。站点多了以后，用 `models` 把 ID 固定到对应账号，可以避免请求先落到不认识该 ID 的站点上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5587":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-137","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#同一渠道下的多个站点","content":"站点的规则（聊天模型筛选、免费标记、能力表）按 `base_url` 地址识别，而不是按 `preset` 名字：写着 `preset: sambanova` 却把 `base_url` 指向别处的账号，不会套用 SambaNova 的规则。自定义地址不套用任何站点规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5588":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-138","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"站点的 `/models` 通常只有 ID。没有声明时，agg 把模型当作不支持图片、不思考的普通模型，调用方的请求原样转发。需要时在 `options` 中声明：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5589":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-139","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"键","locale":"zh-CN"},"5590":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-140","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"5591":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-141","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`vision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5592":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-142","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"是否接受图片输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5593":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-143","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`reasoning`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5594":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-144","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"是否为思考模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5595":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-145","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`context_window`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5596":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-146","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"上下文长度（token）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5597":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-147","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`max_output`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5598":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-148","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"最大输出长度（token）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5599":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-149","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`efforts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5600":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-150","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"思考级别菜单，按显示顺序。包含 `disabled` 时可以关闭思考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5601":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-151","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`effort_default`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5602":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-152","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"默认级别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5603":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-153","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`effort_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5604":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-154","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"选中某个级别时合并到请求体的 JSON，其中的 `\"$effort\"` 替换为级别名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5605":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-155","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`effort_off_patch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5606":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-156","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"选中关闭级别时合并到请求体的 JSON。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5607":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-157","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`region_sensitive`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5608":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-158","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"是否与网络出口地区相关。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5609":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-159","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"`model_specs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5610":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-160","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"按模型 ID 覆盖以上各键。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5611":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-161","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#能力声明","content":"优先级：账号声明高于站点自己目录中的信息，站点信息高于默认值；平铺在 `options` 中的键作为默认值，`model_specs` 中该 ID 的值最后生效。平铺键会作用于整个渠道的所有 ID，渠道下有多个站点时，请把声明写在 `model_specs` 中。没有声明的 ID，只从 models.dev 补充“是否思考、是否接受图片”两项，不借用其他站点的上下文长度。也可以把同样的键写在 `providers.agg.options` 中作为整个渠道的默认值。能力与思考级别的完整规则见模型行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5612":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-162","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"`GET /v1/models` 中每个模型的 `free` 字段有三种值：`true`、`false`、`null`（站点没有说明）。agg 只采信站点自己公布的信息：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5613":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-163","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"从目录行读取：`anyapi`、`gmi`、`opengateway`、`orcarouter`、`tokenrouter`、`xkiro`、`bai`（ID 带 `:free`）、`merge`（某条线路输入输出价格都为 0）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5614":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-164","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"从站点定价页记录的固定 ID：`agnes`、`bai`、`commandcode`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5615":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-165","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"`venice` 和 `llm7` 故意不标记：Venice 的 0 价模型仍要求账号有正余额，LLM7 的标价是公开报价而非账号余额。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5616":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-166","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#免费标记","content":"免费标记只说明站点的价目，不保证账号有额度或一定能调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5617":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-167","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"**聊天模型筛选**：已知站点的目录会去掉图像、视频、嵌入、语音转写等非聊天模型，筛选规则按站点分别实现；目录字段缺失时保留该行，避免站点改版后目录变空。LLM7 按自己的 `model_type` 字段筛选。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5618":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-168","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"**CommandCode**：`claude-` 开头的模型改走 Anthropic Messages（`<base_url>/messages`）；站点的视觉和思考能力表作为默认值，账号声明优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5619":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-169","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"**请求格式**：已知站点的请求把 `max_completion_tokens` 改为 `max_tokens`、`developer` 消息改为 `system`；自定义地址的请求不做这些改写。上游即使对流式请求返回完整的 JSON 文档也能正确读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5620":{"id":"/docs/providers-agg-170","page_id":"/docs/providers-agg","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-agg#站点特有的处理","content":"这些规则大多移植自 pi-free，差异见从 pi-free 迁移。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5621":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"page","content":"匿名入口","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","渠道"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous","locale":"zh-CN"},"5622":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-0","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-anonymous","content":"OpenCode Zen 和 Kilo 两个默认开启、无需账号的免费入口：它们提供什么、怎样关闭、怎样加密钥扩大目录，以及协议上的处理和注意事项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5623":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-1","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#概览","content":"概览","locale":"zh-CN"},"5624":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-2","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#关闭匿名入口","content":"关闭匿名入口","locale":"zh-CN"},"5625":{"id":"/docs/providers-anonymous-3","page_id":"/docs/providers-anonymous","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-anonymous#opencode-zenopencode","content":"OpenCode Zen（