le":"zh-CN"},"7373":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-399","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#内置服务一览","content":"`codex`（ChatGPT 订阅登录）见免费站点；云平台和 NVIDIA 见云平台和 NVIDIA NIM。这些服务的来源对照见渠道清单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7374":{"id":"/docs/providers-local-400","page_id":"/docs/providers-local","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-local#什么时候用-agg","content":"服务在上表中时，用对应的渠道：它带有该服务的协议、目录接口和兼容规则。服务不在表中但讲 OpenAI Chat Completions 时，用 agg：在账号里写上地址和密钥即可，同一个 agg 渠道可以放多个站点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7375":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","type":"page","content":"NVIDIA NIM","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi 文档","渠道"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-nvidia","locale":"zh-CN"},"7376":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-0","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia","content":"用 API 密钥接入 NVIDIA 托管的 NIM 模型：添加账号、选择模型、目录筛选，以及适配器为兼容 NIM 所做的请求转换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7377":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-1","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"添加账号","locale":"zh-CN"},"7378":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-2","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#选择模型","content":"选择模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"7379":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-3","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#目录","content":"目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"7380":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-4","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"请求转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"7381":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-5","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia","content":"`nvidia` 渠道连接 NVIDIA 托管的 NIM 推理服务（`https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1`），使用 OpenAI Chat Completions 协议，账号只需要一个 NVIDIA API 密钥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7382":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-6","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"打开 **渠道** › **NVIDIA NIM**，点 **添加账号**，填写 **API 密钥**，点 **保存账号**。账号立即生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7383":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-7","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"用 `hoshimi config path` 找到配置文件，加入：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7384":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-8","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"编辑文件后重启服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7385":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-9","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#添加账号","content":"账号也接受 `access_token` 代替 `api_key`，账号上的 `models` 可以声明模型列表代替实时目录；渠道选项 `options.base_url` 可以替换默认地址。这个上游密钥与网关自己的模型 API 密钥、管理密钥是三样不同的东西，见安全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7386":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-10","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#选择模型","content":"用 `nvidia/<model-id>` 显式指定这个渠道。模型 ID 本身带斜杠时，加上 `nvidia/` 前缀可以确保请求落到这里，而不是按渠道顺序先匹配到别的渠道：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7387":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-11","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#目录","content":"适配器实时读取模型列表，并排除已识别的非聊天任务：嵌入（`embed`）、重排（`rerank`）、`nvclip`、奖励评分（`-reward`）、检测器（`-detector`）、文档解析（`nemotron-parse`）和 `gliner`。这是任务筛选，不是故障列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7388":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-12","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#目录","content":"模型出现在目录中，不代表当前额度可用或推理一定成功。`nvidia` 参与默认的可用性探测，可以在 **模型** 页面或通过 `POST /api/v1/probe` 实际请求一次来确认，见模型行为。能力信息和账号选项遵循同一套模型规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7389":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-13","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/providers-nvidia#请求转换","content":"NIM 不支持部分 OpenAI 字段，适配器在发送前做以下转换：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7390":{"id":"/docs/providers-nvidia-14","page_id":"/docs/providers-nvidia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/