":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","content":"The gateway leaves one record for every request it handles. The charts, breakdowns and call list of the **Usage** page, and the **Live activity** in the top bar, all come from these records. This page describes the recording rules and the matching management API; using the page itself is covered in Usage page.","locale":"en"},"8307":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-11","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"Each request produces exactly one record, tagged with where it came in (`origin`):","locale":"en"},"8308":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-12","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"`origin`","locale":"en"},"8309":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-13","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"Shown as","locale":"en"},"8310":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-14","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"From","locale":"en"},"8311":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-15","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"`chat`","locale":"en"},"8312":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-16","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"Chat Completions","locale":"en"},"8313":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-17","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"`POST /v1/chat/completions`","locale":"en"},"8314":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage-18","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-usage#what-is-recorded","content":"`responses`","locale":"en"},"8315":{"id":"/en/docs/adv