sage needs text or an attachment (`400` otherwise)","locale":"en"},"9261":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-254","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"`attachment_ids`","locale":"en"},"9262":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-255","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"`[]`","locale":"en"},"9263":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-256","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"Attachments uploaded with `POST /attachments`","locale":"en"},"9264":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-257","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"`model`","locale":"en"},"9265":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-258","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"`\"\"`","locale":"en"},"9266":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-259","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"The model; falls back to the conversation's, then `server.default_model`. With none, `400` \"Choose a model first.\"","locale":"en"},"9267":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-260","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"`effort`","locale":"en"},"9268":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-261","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"`\"\"`","locale":"en"},"9269":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-262","page_id":"/en/docs/api-playground","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/api-playground#send-a-message","content":"Reasoning effort, sent as `reasoning_effort`; empty sends none","locale":"en"},"9270":{"id":"/en/docs/api-playground-263","page_id":"/en/doc