d, was cancelled or was skipped; releases wait for it","locale":"en"},"11721":{"id":"/en/docs/development-testing-129","page_id":"/en/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-testing#checks-in-ci","content":"Dependencies are installed with uv: the ty and pytest jobs install `.[dev,google,bedrock]`. The shared checks also type-check, test and build the documentation site. The release flow is in CI and releases.","locale":"en"},"11722":{"id":"/en/docs/development-webui","page_id":"/en/docs/development-webui","type":"page","content":"Web UI","breadcrumbs":["Hoshimi Documentation","Development"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/development-webui","locale":"en"},"11723":{"id":"/en/docs/development-webui-0","page_id":"/en/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-webui","content":"How the Vue app is built and laid out, types generated from OpenAPI, data fetching and the live connection, i18n, theme and design tokens, layers and motion, and the layout rules the tests enforce.","locale":"en"},"11724":{"id":"/en/docs/development-webui-1","page_id":"/en/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/development-webui#stack-and-commands","content":"Stack and commands","locale":"en"},"11725":{"id":"/en/docs/development-webui-2","page_id":"/en/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/development-webui#source-layout","content":"Source layout","locale":"en"},"11726":{"id":"/en/docs/development-webui-3","page_id":"/en/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/development-webui#deployment-root-and-routing","content":"Deployment root and routing","locale":"en"},"11727":{"id":"/en/docs/development-webui-4","page_id":"/en/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/development-webui#the-contract-with-the-server-generated-types","content":"The contract with the server: generated types","locale":"en"},"11728":{"id":"/en/docs/develop