-settings-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.title_model`","locale":"en"},"12758":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Names each new chat after its first reply. By default **The chat's own model**","locale":"en"},"12759":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"**Image model**","locale":"en"},"12760":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"`playground.vision_model`","locale":"en"},"12761":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Describes images for models that cannot read them. **Automatic** (the default): the first available model that reads images; **Off**: images are left out for models that cannot read them; or a particular model that reads images","locale":"en"},"12762":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"The **Context** section, what happens as a Playground chat nears its model's context window:","locale":"en"},"12763":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"12764":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Config key","locale":"en"},"12765":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#general","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"1276