":"en"},"12978":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"A stacked bar chart shows tokens per hour or per day by kind: **Uncached input**, **Cache read**, **Cache write**, **Output** and **Reasoning** (output other than reasoning counts as **Output**). Hover a bar for each kind and the **Total**.","locale":"en"},"12979":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"**24 hours** and **Day** are by the hour; hours of today still to come are drawn faint, not as a fall to zero.","locale":"en"},"12980":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"**7 days**, **30 days** and **90 days** are by the day. Click a day's bar to open that day hour by hour (**Choose a day to see its hours**).","locale":"en"},"12981":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#tokens-over-time","content":"Hourly detail is kept for 120 days. An older day shows **Hour-by-hour detail is not kept for this day. The totals above still include it.**","locale":"en"},"12982":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#speed","content":"When there are measurements, two line charts appear: **Time to first token** and **Decode speed (tok/s)**, both averages per bucket; buckets without a measurement are left as gaps rather than drawn as zero.","locale":"en"},"12983":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#speed","content":"Calls whose decode took less than 250 ms, or ran faster than 250 tokens a second, are left out of the averages, so a rate that could not be measured does not pass for a fast one.","locale":"en"},"12984":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"**Breakdown** groups usage four ways, chosen by tab:","locale":"en"},"12985":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"Tab","locale":"en"},"12986":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"One row per","locale":"en"},"12987":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"**Model**","locale":"en"},"12988":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-63","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"Model id (the display name when there is one, with the id under it)","locale":"en"},"12989":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-64","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"**Provider**","locale":"en"},"12990":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-65","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"Channel","locale":"en"},"12991":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-66","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"**Account**","locale":"en"},"12992":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-67","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"Account of each channel","locale":"en"},"12993":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-68","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdown","content":"**API**","locale":"en"},"12994":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-usage-69","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-usage#breakdow