`GET /app/update` 返回 `status`、`current`、`latest`（PyPI 上最新的正式版本，知道后才有）和 `checked_at`（最近一次成功检查的 Unix 秒）。`status` 为 `checking`（首次检查尚未完成）、`available`、`current`、`failed`（还没有成功过；之后的失败保留上次的结果）或 `disabled`（`server.check_updates` 关闭）。"],[876,"`GET /app/version`"],[8644,"`GET /app/version`"],[1327,"`GET /attachments/{id}`"],[9095,"`GET /attachments/{id}`"],[9405,"`GET /attachments/{id}` returns an image with its own type, a file as `text/plain`."],[1637,"`GET /attachments/{id}` 按图片自身的类型返回图片，文件以 `text/plain` 返回。"],[904,"`GET /catalog/stream`"],[8672,"`GET /catalog/stream`"],[8780,"`GET /catalog/stream` is SSE: first a `snapshot` event listing each provider's cached models (status `loading`); then a `provider` event as each provider finishes refreshing (status `ready`, `failed`, or `timeout` after 20 seconds, with `error`, `last_success`, `retry_at` and `source`); finally `done`. While waiting it sends `: keep-alive` comments."],[1012,"`GET /catalog/stream` 是 SSE：先发一个 `snapshot` 事件，列出每个渠道的缓存模型（状态 `loading`）；然后每个渠道刷新完成时发一个 `provider` 事件（状态 `ready`、`failed` 或 20 秒后的 `timeout`，附带 `error`、`last_success`、`retry_at`、`source`）；最后发 `done`。等待期间发送 `: keep-alive` 注释。"],[898,"`GET /channels`"],[8666,"`GET /channels`"],[8751,"`GET /channels` returns all the local state the Channels page needs in one read, without asking any upstream (balances need upstream requests, so they live in `/credits`):"],[983,"`GET /channels` 一次返回渠道页需要的全部本地状态，不向上游发请求（余额需要请求上游，所以不在其中，见 `/credits`）："],[1321,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context`"],[9089,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context`"],[9408,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context` says how full the conversation on screen is against its model's context window:"],[1640,"`GET /conversations/{id}/context` 返回屏幕上的对话相对于模型上下文窗口的占用情况："],[1294,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events`"],[9062,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events`"],[9316,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events` streams the reply under way from its first event (`?after=n` skips the first `n`), exactly as its send streamed them, then the rest as they come, to its `done`. Any number of clients can follow it at once. With none running it is `404`: the reply has ended, and `GET /conversations/{id}` holds it as kept."],[1548,"`GET /conversations/{id}/events` 从第一个事件起推送正在进行的回复（`?after=n` 跳过前 `n` 个），与发送时推送的事件完全相同，之后实时推送后续事件，直到 `done`。可以有任意多个客户端同时跟随。没有回复进行时返回 `404`：回复已经结束，`GET /conversations/{id}` 中是保存后的结果。"],[1291,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request`"],[9059,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request`"],[9431,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request` returns the Chat Completions body behind a reply (or the one that would answer a question): `model`, `messages`, `stream: true`, `reasoning_effort` when set, and `tools` with `tool_choice` when tools are on. For a reply that used tools it is the first round. This is the Web UI's **Copy as API request**."],[1663,"`GET /conversations/{id}/messages/{message_id}/request` 返回某条回复背后的 Chat Completions 请求体（对问题则是将用来回答它的请求）：`model`、`messages`、`stream: true`，设置了推理强度时有 `reasoning_effort`，开启了工具时有 `tools` 和 `tool_choice`。使用了工具的回复返回的是第一轮的请求。这就是网页界面的 **复制为 API 请求**。"],[1306,"`GET /conversations/{id}/terminals`"],[9074,"`GET /conversations/{id}/terminals`"],[9392,"`GET /conversations/{id}/terminals` lists the background commands (`exec_command` sessions) the conversation's tools started that are running, or have exited and not yet been read by the model:"],[1624,"`GET /conversations/{id}/terminals` 列出该对话的工具启动的后台命令（`exec_command` 会话），包括仍在运行的，以及已退出但模型尚未读取其输出的："],[1276,"`GET /conversations/{id}`"],[9044,"`GET /conversations/{id}`"],[1270,"`GET /conversations`"],[9038,"`GET /conversations`"],[9153,"`GET /conversations` and `PATCH` return the summary (no `current_leaf`, no `messages`); `POST /conversations`, `GET /conversations/{id}` and `POST .../branch` return the full conversation."],[1385,"`GET /conversations` 和 `PATCH` 返回摘要（不含 `current_leaf` 和 `messages`）；`POST /conversations`、`GET /conversations/{id}` 和 `POST .../branch` 返回完整对话。"],[918,"`GET /credits/checkins`"],[1025,"`GET /credits/checkins`"],[8686,"`GET /credits/checkins`"],[8793,"`GET /credits/checkins`"],[916,"`GET /credits`"],[1022,"`GET /credits`"],[8684,"`GET /credits`"],[8790,"`GET /credits`"],[8712,"`GET /health` at the server root is also a liveness probe that needs no key; it returns `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`."],[926,"`GET /login/poll`"],[8694,"`GET /login/poll`"],[922,"`GET /login/providers`"],[8690,"`GET /login/providers`"],[902,"`GET /models`"],[1339,"`GET /models`"],[8670,"`GET /models`"],[9107,"`GET /models`"],[8757,"`GET /models` returns `levels` (the three output budgets `light`, `balanced`, `deep`) and `data`. Each item of `data`:"],[9434,"`GET /models` returns the same list as `GET /v1/models`."],[989,"`GET /models` 返回 `levels`（三档输出预算 `light`、`balanced`、`deep`）和 `data`。`data` 的每一项："],[1666,"`GET /models` 返回与 `GET /v1/models` 相同的列表。"],[900,"`GET /network/diagnostics`"],[8668,"`GET /network/diagnostics`"],[8756,"`GET /network/diagnostics` returns the latest observation of each kind of network operation per provider: `provider`, `operation`, `kind` (such as `timeout`, `proxy_error`, `connection_error`, `rate_limited`), `status`, `at`, `host`, `route`. Network settings are covered in Network and proxies."],[988,"`GET /network/diagnostics` 返回每个渠道每类网络操作最近一次的观测：`provider`、`operation`、`kind`（如 `timeout`、`proxy_error`、`connection_error`、`rate_limited`）、`status`、`at`、`host`、`route`。网络设置见网络与代理。"],[908,"`GET /probe`"],[8676,"`GET /probe`"],[8782,"`GET /probe` returns `running`, `at` (when the last round finished) and `results` (model → `state`, `detail`, `latency_ms`, `ttft_ms`, `at`). `state` is `available`, `region-blocked`, `unavailable`, `throttled` or `unknown`."],[1014,"`GET /probe` 返回 `running`、`at`（上一轮结束时间）、`results`（模型 → `state`、`detail`、`latency_ms`、`ttft_ms`、`at`）。`state` 为 `available`、`region-blocked`、`unavailable`、`throttled` 或 `unknown`。"],[890,"`GET /provider-forms`"],[8658,"`GET /provider-forms`"],[8744,"`GET /provider-forms` lists, per provider, the ways to add an account (`method`) with their fields (`key`, `kind`, `required`, `choices`) and defaults."],[976,"`GET /provider-forms` 列出每个渠道添加账号时可用的方式（`method`）及字段（`key`、`kind`、`required`、`choices`）和默认值。"],[888,"`GET /providers`"],[8656,"`GET /providers`"],[975,"`GET /providers` 的每一项：`id`、`display_name`、`accounts`（不含匿名账号）、`account_ids`、`models`（已缓存的模型数，从不为此请求上游）、`enabled`、`keyless`（无需账号即可使用）、`requires_authorization`（需要登录或 Key 才能使用）。已配置但关闭的渠道、可以登录或填 Key 但尚未配置的渠道也会列出。"],[912,"`GET /refresh`"],[8680,"`GET /refresh`"],[8785,"`GET /refresh` returns `auto_refresh` and, per account, `provider`, `account`, `refreshable`, `needs_login`, `expires_at`, `failures`, `last_error`, `last_ok`."],[1017,"`GET /refresh` 返回 `auto_refresh` 和每个账号的 `provider`、`account`、`refreshable`、`needs_login`、`expires_at`、`failures`、`last_error`、`last_ok`。"],[9432,"`GET /session` returns `{\"conversation_id\": \"...\"}`, the conversation open last (`null` when none, or when it was temporary or deleted). `PUT /session` with the same body sets it (`null` for a new chat); an unknown id is a `400`. The Web UI reopens it on start."],[1664,"`GET /session` 返回 `{\"conversation_id\": \"...\"}`，即上次打开的对话（没有，或该对话是临时对话或已删除时为 `null`）。`PUT /session` 用同样的请求体设置它（新对话时为 `null`）；ID 不存在时返回 `400`。网页界面启动时会重新打开它。"],[9101,"`GET /session`, `PUT /session`"],[1333,"`GET /session`、`PUT /session`"],[884,"`GET /settings`"],[8652,"`GET /settings`"],[8732,"`GET /settings` returns the current settings: `data_dir`, `config_path`, `server` (host, port, `strict_port`, `access_token_configured`, `model_api_key_configured`, allowed CIDRs/hosts/origins, `max_body_bytes`, `max_account_retries`, `default_model`, `auto_refresh`, `auto_checkin`, `check_updates`, `stats_keep_days`), `providers` (each provider's `id`, `enabled`, account count, the names of its options, its network settings), `network`, `playground`, and:"],[964,"`GET /settings` 返回当前设置：`data_dir`、`config_path`、`server`（地址、端口、`strict_port`、`access_token_configured`、`model_api_key_configured`、允许的 CIDR/主机/来源、`max_body_bytes`、`max_account_retries`、`default_model`、`auto_refresh`、`auto_checkin`、`check_updates`、`stats_keep_days`）、`providers`（每个渠道的 `id`、`enabled`、账号数、已设置的选项名、网络设置）、`network`、`playground`，以及："],[896,"`GET /stations`"],[8664,"`GET /stations`"],[8750,"`GET /stations` lists the stations an `agg` account can name with `preset`: `id`, `display_name`, `base_url`, `key_env` (only a hint about which key to have ready; Hoshimi does not read that variable) and `catalog_keyless`. See The agg aggregator."],[982,"`GET /stations` 列出 `agg` 账号可以用 `preset` 指定的站点：`id`、`display_name`、`base_url`、`key_env`（只是告诉你该准备哪个 Key，Hoshimi 不读取这个环境变量）、`catalog_keyless`。见 聚合入口 agg。"],[936,"`GET /stats/calls`"],[8704,"`GET /stats/calls`"],[8813,"`GET /stats/calls` returns individual calls, newest first, over the whole retention period (`server.stats_keep_days`, 90 days by default):"],[1045,"`GET /stats/calls` 返回逐次调用，新的在前，覆盖整个保留期（`server.stats_keep_days`，默认 90 天）："],[934,"`GET /stats/days`"],[8702,"`GET /stats/days`"],[8812,"`GET /stats/days` returns every local date with usage (`date`, `calls`, `tokens`, `failed`), oldest first, plus `first` and `today`, for a calendar."],[1044,"`GET /stats/days` 返回每个有用量的本地日期（`date`、`calls`、`tokens`、`failed`），从旧到新，以及 `first` 和 `today`，供日历使用。"],[938,"`GET /stats/live`"],[8706,"`GET /stats/live`"],[8830,"`GET /stats/live` is SSE with `data: <json>` frames: first a `snapshot` (calls in flight, today's totals, the latest calls), then `started`, `progress` and `finished` events, with a `ping` every 15 seconds. A reader that falls too far behind is disconnected; reconnecting brings a fresh snapshot. Token counts of calls in flight are estimated from characters. How usage is recorded is in Usage statistics."],[1062,"`GET /stats/live` 是 SSE，每帧 `data: <json>`：先发一个 `snapshot`（进行中的调用、今日合计、最近的调用），之后是 `started`、`progress`、`finished` 事件；每 15 秒发一次 `ping`。读取太慢跟不上时流会结束，重新连接会得到新的快照。进行中调用的 Token 数是按字符数估算的。用量的记录方式见用量统计。"],[932,"`GET /stats`"],[8700,"`GET /stats`"],[1036,"`GET /stats` 的参数："],[1086,"`GET /v1/classifiers`"],[8854,"`GET /v1/classifiers`"],[1084,"`GET /v1/models`"],[1183,"`GET /v1/models`"],[8852,"`GET /v1/models`"],[8951,"`GET /v1/models`"],[15489,"`GET /v1/models` lists each ID once; `owned_by` is the channel that wins by the order above. When the model ID itself contains a `/` (Kilo's `openrouter/free`, for example), add the channel prefix, `kilo/openrouter/free`, so the first segment is not read as a channel name. Client setup is in Connecting clients."],[7723,"`GET /v1/models` 中每个 ID 只出现一次，`owned_by` 是按上述顺序胜出的渠道。模型 ID 本身含有 `/` 时（例如 Kilo 的 `openrouter/free`），建议加上渠道前缀：`kilo/openrouter/free`，避免第一段被当成渠道名。客户端配置见接入客户端。"],[5612,"`GET /v1/models` 中每个模型的 `free` 字段有三种值：`true`、`false`、`null`（站点没有说明）。agg 只采信站点自己公布的信息："],[2389,"`GET /v1/models` 返回的 `id`，或 `渠道/模型`"],[11035,"`get_app()` in `hoshimi/cli/app.py` is the one place every command is registered; each command's implementation is in `hoshimi/cli/commands/`. Typer's private imports (`typer._click`) are confined to `hoshimi/cli/factory.py`, so a Typer release that moves them breaks there first, and the command-line tests catch it. Every command takes `--debug` to turn on debug logging. `python -m hoshimi` is the same as the `hoshimi` command."],[2094,"`GIT_PAGER`"],[9862,"`GIT_PAGER`"],[2106,"`GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT`"],[9874,"`GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT`"],[6486,"`github_copilot`"],[14252,"`github_copilot`"],[5904,"`github-copilot`"],[5905,"`github-copilot`"],[6487,"`github-copilot`"],[7029,"`github-copilot`"],[7132,"`github-copilot`"],[7642,"`github-copilot`"],[13670,"`github-copilot`"],[13671,"`github-copilot`"],[14253,"`github-copilot`"],[14795,"`github-copilot`"],[14898,"`github-copilot`"],[15408,"`github-copilot`"],[14836,"`github-copilot` picks Responses, Messages or Chat from the endpoints the catalogue lists for the model."],[7070,"`github-copilot` 按目录中模型支持的端点选择 Responses、Messages 或 Chat。"],[5685,"`glm-5.3-flash-free`"],[13