n` 等命令修改的是它们自己看到的数据目录。服务器用了 `HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR` 时，在另一个终端里执行这些命令也要设置同样的值，否则改的是另一份配置。"],[3799,"`hoshimi env`"],[11567,"`hoshimi env`"],[10407,"`hoshimi env` lists the environment variables Hoshimi reads and the ones currently set;"],[2639,"`hoshimi env` 列出 Hoshimi 读取的环境变量和当前已设置的值；"],[2523,"`hoshimi login` 和网页上的 **登录** 中，网关自己发出的请求（发起授权、轮询、换取令牌）"],[10515,"`hoshimi serve --access-token … --model-api-key …` sets the keys for that run only and does not write them to the file; but any later save in the Web UI writes the whole in-memory configuration, these keys included, back to `config.json`."],[2747,"`hoshimi serve --access-token … --model-api-key …` 只为这一次运行设置密钥，不写入文件；但此后在网页上保存任何设置时，内存中的配置（包括这两个密钥）会被整体写回 `config.json`。"],[125,"`hoshimi serve --no-checkin`"],[7893,"`hoshimi serve --no-checkin`"],[122,"`hoshimi serve --no-refresh`"],[7890,"`hoshimi serve --no-refresh`"],[13195,"`hoshimi serve` listens on `127.0.0.1:10600` by default, reachable from this machine only."],[5429,"`hoshimi serve` 默认监听 `127.0.0.1:10600`，只有本机可以访问。"],[13247,"`hoshimi stations` lists every preset (`--json` prints JSON); the API is `GET /api/v1/stations`."],[5481,"`hoshimi stations` 列出全部预设（`--json` 输出 JSON），接口为 `GET /api/v1/stations`。"],[2016,"`HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR`"],[2028,"`HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR`"],[9784,"`HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR`"],[9796,"`HOSHIMI_DATA_DIR`"],[2017,"`HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL`"],[2031,"`HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL`"],[9785,"`HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL`"],[9799,"`HOSHIMI_LOG_LEVEL`"],[3118,"`hoshimi.cli`"],[10886,"`hoshimi.cli`"],[2040,"`hoshimi.db`"],[2649,"`hoshimi.db`"],[9808,"`hoshimi.db`"],[10417,"`hoshimi.db`"],[8291,"`hoshimi.db` was used by a newer Hoshimi and an older one is running now. It still runs, but some records may not show correctly. Upgrade, or restore the data directory from a backup."],[5154,"`hoshimi.db` 的完整路径：用量、签到记录、探测结果和 Playground 对话都在其中"],[523,"`hoshimi.db` 被更新版本的 Hoshimi 用过，而现在运行的是旧版本。旧版本仍可运行，但部分记录可能显示不正确。升级到新版本，或从备份恢复数据目录。"],[4110,"`hoshimi/api/`"],[11878,"`hoshimi/api/`"],[3181,"`hoshimi/api/app