()`："],[11019,"`Provider.stream_using` tries the provider's accounts in turn: a failed credential is renewed and then rotated, an account out of allowance cools down for a while, and a saturated model stops the round at once. The chosen account sends the request in the upstream's own protocol through `stream_raw`, which turns the upstream stream into **normalized chunks**. The details are in Provider adapters."],[3251,"`Provider.stream_using` 依次尝试渠道的账号：认证失败先续期再换账号，额度用尽的账号冷却一段时间，模型过载时立即停止。选中的账号通过 `stream_raw` 用上游自己的协议发出请求，并把上游的流转换成**归一化分片**。细节见渠道适配器。"],[11014,"`provider/model` whose prefix is an enabled provider: that provider."],[3246,"`provider/model` 形式且前缀是一个启用的渠道：直接使用该渠道。"],[8965,"`provider/model`, where `provider` is an enabled provider id: that provider serves it, and everything after the first slash (further slashes included) is the upstream model name."],[8791,"`provider` (optional)"],[8794,"`provider` (optional), `limit` (1–500, default 50)"],[11649,"`Provider` subclass, ID `fake`"],[3881,"`Provider` 子类，ID `fake`"],[1023,"`provider`（可选）"],[1026,"`provider`（可选）、`limit`（1–500，默认 50）"],[7713,"`providers.<id>.accounts[].id`"],[15479,"`providers.<id>.accounts[].id`"],[2737,"`providers.<id>.accounts`"],[2997,"`providers.<id>.accounts`"],[7711,"`providers.<id>.accounts`"],[10505,"`providers.<id>.accounts`"],[10765,"`providers.<id>.accounts`"],[15477,"`providers.<id>.accounts`"],[2993,"`providers.<id>.enabled`"],[7709,"`providers.<id>.enabled`"],[10761,"`providers.<id>.enabled`"],[15475,"`providers.<id>.enabled`"],[7717,"`providers.<id>.options.network`"],[15483,"`providers.<id>.options.network`"],[3001,"`providers.<id>.options`"],[7715,"`providers.<id>.options`"],[10769,"`providers.<id>.options`"],[15481,"`providers.<id>.options`"],[11062,"`providers/<id>.py`, registered in `providers/factory.py`"],[3294,"`providers/<id>.py`，在 `providers/factory.py` 注册"],[11071,"`providers/agg.py` and `core/presets.py`"],[3303,"`providers/agg.py` 与 `core/presets.py`"],[1844,"`provi