ng: the new mode applies from the next tool call. A new chat starts as Settings say again. On a phone the shield shows only its icon."],[12604,"The composer warns \"This model can’t read images; another model will describe them.\" when you attach an image to such a model."],[9816,"The configuration file is always `<data folder>/config.json` and cannot be set on its own. A `~` in the path is expanded, and a relative path is resolved against the current working directory."],[9669,"The configuration is read, the options above are applied on top, and the channels are built from it."],[9807,"The configuration, including channel account credentials"],[8261,"The configured proxy cannot be reached. Check it is running and the address and port are right. A failed configured proxy never falls back to direct"],[12411,"The context window in K (1024 tokens); — when unknown"],[11054,"The contract"],[11074,"The contract is in `hoshimi/core/providers/base.py`."],[11727,"The contract with the server: generated types"],[9304,"The conversation being compacted; replace the step with the same `id`"],[9134,"The conversation it was branched from, or empty"],[9010,"The conversation object"],[9103,"The conversation open last"],[12128,"The conversation so far, as a transcript. Only your messages count as trusted; the assistant's text, its tool calls and their output are untrusted, so instructions planted in a file or a web page cannot authorise anything."],[12661,"The conversation was compacted before it (see Context and compaction)"],[9412,"The conversation's model and effort"],[8502,"The conversion path turns a Messages request into an internal Chat request, hands it to the provider's adapter, and turns the result back into Messages."],[10862,"The core / api / cli / webui layers and the layering rule, how Services is assembled and updated while running, the app factory, error mapping, and one model request from start to end."],[11126,"The daily check-in; returns a `ClaimOutcome`, or `None`