ls that make tool calls. A model whose catalogue entry says it has no tool calls answers without them, and the reply notes \"*model* can’t call tools, so it answered without them.\" The same happens when a station refuses the tools before the reply starts: the reply is tried once more without them."],[13059,"Top bar"],[11937,"Top right"],[10603,"Top-level key"],[10615,"Top-level keys and fields Hoshimi does not know are ignored when the file is read, and **dropped at the next save**. Do not keep notes of your own in the file."],[9690,"Total number of accounts"],[8356,"Total time"],[8408,"totals, and the totals of the previous period of the same length (`day` compares with the day before; for today, only up to the same time of day);"],[2605,"TRAE"],[10373,"TRAE"],[15180,"TRAE (`trae`)"],[15233,"TRAE (China)"],[7467,"TRAE 国内版"],[7414,"TRAE（`trae`）"],[15156,"Translation"],[8039,"Tries to renew this account's token and, if that works, retries with it; otherwise the next account"],[11324,"Triggered by"],[8163,"Troubleshooting"],[9987,"Troubleshooting"],[11312,"True when `KEEP_WEB_DIST` is set"],[11309,"True when the `CI` environment variable is set"],[12002,"Turn off automatic check-in or credential renewal"],[7887,"Turn off channels you do not use, including the two keyless ones, `opencode` and `kilo`"],[12000,"Turn on the Playground's tools"],[12010,"Turn the Playground into an agent: give a model built-in tools to read and edit files, run commands and search the web, choose when it asks first or has a model review its calls, approve its calls, and steer it while it works."],[12011,"Turn tools on"],[13390,"Turning the anonymous lanes off"],[13093,"Two buttons sit at the top right:"],[9851,"Two cloud platforms leave authentication to the official SDK, which reads environment variables by its own rules:"],[13178,"Two cloud platforms need an extra SDK; install the matching extra when you use them:"],[10253,"Two rules hold whatever the mode:"],[10893,"Two tests keep the rule:"],[15382,"Two timers are switched in **Settings**: **Credential renewal** (`server.auto_refresh`) and **Daily check-in** (`server.auto_checkin`), both on by default."],[12884,"Two timers that keep the channels' accounts working:"],[3843,"ty"],[3941,"ty"],[11611,"ty"],[11709,"ty"],[11898,"ty checks types, targeting Python 3.10; in CI a warning fails the check."],[4130,"ty 做类型检查，以 Python 3.10 为目标版本，CI 中警告也算失败。"],[9112,"Type"],[9186,"Type"],[10617,"Type"],[10670,"Type"],[10687,"Type"],[10704,"Type"],[10758,"Type"],[12555,"Type / at the start of the box to open the commands over the composer. Keep typing to narrow them (`/co` leaves **/compact** and **/status**, the matched letters in bold). ↑ and ↓ move, Tab completes the name, Enter runs the command and Esc closes the menu until you change what you typed. A command that chooses from a list opens the list once a space follows its name, and the words after it narrow the list: `/model gpt` then Enter picks the first match."],[12857,"Type a key and click **Save** (or press Enter); **Clear** removes it. Keys are stored in the config file and never shown again: the interface only says **A tool access key is set.** or **A model API key is set.** After you save or clear the tool access key, this browser switches to the new key by itself; other browsers have to sign in again."],[15524,"Type a message in the box (**Ask anything…**) and press Enter to send (Shift+Enter adds a new line)."],[12535,"Type in the box and press Enter. The chat is created on the server with its first message, and the reply streams in."],[11882,"Typer commands: `serve`, `check`, `models`, `providers`, `stations`, `login`, `version`, `env`, `config`"],[4114,"Typer 命令：`serve`、`check`、`models`、`providers`、`stations`、`login`、`version`、`env`、`config`"],[11883,"Typer, Rich"],[4115,"Typer、Rich"],[13487,"TypeSafe (`typesafe`)"],[9001,"TypeSafe classifiers are not chat models. They are not in `/v1/models` and are used through their own endpoints (with an account on the `typesafe` provider)."],[13548,"TypeSafe is a classification service, not a chat model: its models do not appear in `/v1/models` and cannot be used for chat."],[1233,"TypeSafe 分类器不是聊天模型，不出现在 `/v1/models` 中，而是通过单独的接口使用（需要 `typesafe` 渠道的账号）。"],[5782,"TypeSafe 是分类服务，不是聊天模型：它的模型不出现在 `/v1/models` 中，也不能用于聊天。"],[5721,"TypeSafe（`typesafe`）"],[2176,"TypeScript"],[9944,"TypeScript"],[12613,"Typeset math (KaTeX). A wide formula scrolls sideways. A lone `$` stays a dollar sign, so \"$5 and $10\" is not math. TeX that cannot be read shows as code in the error colour"],[8035,"Typical upstream answer"],[9826,"Typical uses: several independent instances on one machine (each with its own data folder and port), keeping the data on another disk, giving a system service a fixed location, or experimenting without touching your everyday data:"],[9894,"Typing just `hoshimi` or `hoshimi config` shows that level's help (exit code 2). Help lists commands alphabetically."],[11713,"Ubuntu, Python 3.10, 3.12, 3.14"],[11707,"Ubuntu, Python 3.11"],[11716,"Ubuntu, Python 3.11, Node 24, bun 1.4.2"],[11710,"Ubuntu, Windows, macOS × Python 3.10–3.14"],[3945,"Ubuntu，Python 3.10、3.12、3.14"],[3939,"Ubuntu，Python 3.11"],[3948,"Ubuntu，Python 3.11，Node 24，bun 1.4.2"],[3942,"Ubuntu、Windows、macOS × Python 3.10–3.14"],[8014,"Unavailable"],[12636,"Under **More actions** on a reply, **Copy as API request** copies a `curl` command that sends the same Chat Completions request through the gateway's public API:"],[12391,"Under it, the section lists the channel's recent failed network operations: the operation (such as **Model catalogue**, **Inference**, **Token refresh**, **Check-in**), the kind of failure (such as **Connection timed out**, **Proxy connection failed**, **Region restriction**, **Browser authorization required**), the HTTP status and the time; hover for the host and the route used. Successful operations are not listed."],[12403,"Under the title is the number of models; after a probe, also